{"time": 1720975918, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "172216539"}, "sender": {"id": "172216539", "name": "离去之原"}, "message": "“如何?能应付的过来吗？”打趣女仆长和白狼"}
{"time": 1720975920, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "圣娅与白狼一左一右，对付邪教徒男女。"}
