{"time": 1720979419, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(哦，我的意思就是把这一块地方罩住，不让这个怪出去)"}
{"time": 1720979456, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "拉着白狼跃迁到地面上，然后立刻把白狼送到结界外。"}
{"time": 1720979530, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "“呼。”在后面着手恢复魔力，静静看着师傅和女仆长"}
{"time": 1720979551, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "女仆长和师傅都摆出架势。"}
{"time": 1720979639, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "烟雾缓缓散去，只见一头四五米高，长着双角和光秃秃的尾巴，浑身带着漆黑毛发怪物出现在你们面前。"}
{"time": 1720979681, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“啊吼吼，我终于出来了！”"}
{"time": 1720979682, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "“这是什么?”轻生询问"}
{"time": 1720979689, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "“这是什么?”轻声询问"}
{"time": 1720979708, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "怪物发出沉闷的声音，震得空气嗡嗡响"}
{"time": 1720979738, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“我也不知道。”师傅将剑横在身前。"}
{"time": 1720979749, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "女仆长头上留下一滴汗珠。"}
{"time": 1720979781, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "为师傅和女仆长施展增益魔法"}
{"time": 1720979822, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "加速，加力敏，加反应，加抗性，加护盾"}
{"time": 1720979825, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“不过怎么就只有这一部分力量？……原来是祭品不对！也罢，刀枪不入的皮肤已经够我去亲自解封了！”"}
{"time": 1720979856, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "那怪物一脚踏出，石制地面都碎裂出一个小坑。"}
{"time": 1720979887, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "。log off"}
{"time": 1721148645, "type": "reply", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": 2875548981, "name": "小雅"}, "message": "继续记录乐谱"}
{"time": 1721148750, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:mface,summary=&#91;送花&#93;,url=https://gxh.vip.qq.com/club/item/parcel/item/e7/e706d2ae351cab38c6a5d6125a131d38/raw300.gif,emoji_id=e706d2ae351cab38c6a5d6125a131d38,emoji_package_id=235847,key=9bd6ed197ad677e3]"}
{"time": 1721148770, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "那怪物朝前迈步，而在它巨大身躯面前，一只白狐的身影决绝而立，白色的长发随风飘荡"}
{"time": 1721148851, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“#$%&amp;$&amp;@？”怪物发出怪异的嘶吼，但是圣娅能听出是“哪来的虫子？”的意思"}
{"time": 1721148871, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "“师傅！那玩意的表皮好像刀枪不入，小心。”"}
{"time": 1721148882, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "随后一拳挥出"}
{"time": 1721148979, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "巨大的响声如同惊雷，烟雾弥漫了师傅之前伫立的位置"}
{"time": 1721149014, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "随后白色的残影出现在怪物身体各处，关节，眼睛，脚腕等等"}
{"time": 1721149051, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "影子们前冲合一，师傅的身影出现在怪物身后"}
{"time": 1721149077, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“真硬！”师傅不悦地皱了皱眉，甩了甩手腕"}
{"time": 1721149100, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "而怪物身上没有一点伤痕？不"}
{"time": 1721149107, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "展开心灵探测，观察怪物的内部和思想"}
{"time": 1721149134, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“$%**&amp;@！”怪物大吼起来"}
{"time": 1721149150, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“可恶的婊子”圣娅听出含义"}
{"time": 1721149167, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "只见怪物的一只眼睛血流如注"}
{"time": 1721149193, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "但是几秒钟之内血就止住了，伤口开始愈合"}
{"time": 1721149211, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=-2147428879]r"}
{"time": 1721149278, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "。rd100"}
{"time": 1721149278, "type": "reply", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": 2875548981, "name": "小雅"}, "message": "[菲儿]演奏出: 1D100=4"}
{"time": 1721149284, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(寄！)"}
{"time": 1721149348, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "怪物的心里邪恶不堪，让圣娅甚是不舒服，没获取到有用的信息"}
{"time": 1721149366, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "但是圣娅能明显感觉到这和之前的老头心灵完全不一样"}
{"time": 1721149385, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "忍着不适强行深入其中"}
{"time": 1721149389, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "。rd100"}
{"time": 1721149389, "type": "reply", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": 2875548981, "name": "小雅"}, "message": "[菲儿]演奏出: 1D100=97"}
{"time": 1721149394, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(什么byd)"}
{"time": 1721149769, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "圣娅的精神承受着考验！"}
{"time": 1721149827, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "圣娅看到了许多碎片化的记忆片段"}
{"time": 1721149981, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "从浩瀚的星河，到血腥的战争，无数古老的不知名法术和武器碰撞回响，被放逐，被囚禁，被折磨，最后只剩下孤独与疯狂。但是圣娅挺了下来，见到了怪物的心灵。"}
{"time": 1721150036, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“谁允许你进来的！虫子！”"}
{"time": 1721150040, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "“嗯...嗯...”忍着撕裂的疼痛"}
{"time": 1721150088, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "这股声音夹杂着一种力量，震慑圣娅的心灵，那是圣娅熟悉的力量。"}
{"time": 1721150104, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "来自于心灵之力"}
{"time": 1721150138, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "“对不请自来的客人，你就是这种态度吗？”"}
{"time": 1721150162, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "一边驱动灵能抵挡，一边开口"}
{"time": 1721150212, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“哦哦，你的天赋在这些家畜与虫子之间竟然如此之好？真是几万年里我第一次见！”"}
{"time": 1721150262, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“我要抓住你！研究到底是什么原因！现在，滚出这里！”"}
{"time": 1721150327, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "“我来此就是为了把你剥离出去。”看着眼前的虚空，“已死之人，就不要再出现了。”"}
{"time": 1721150356, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "圣娅感觉到了怪物的心灵力量在波动，在震颤，在达到一个频率之后，断开了联系。随后，圣娅的灵魂如同脱离了身躯一样。"}
{"time": 1721150411, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "圣娅用灵能强行扳回了意识"}
{"time": 1721150416, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "回到了自己的身躯。"}
{"time": 1721150438, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "但是头如同被大铁锤来回捶打"}
{"time": 1721150441, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "通的不行"}
{"time": 1721150448, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "痛的不行"}
{"time": 1721150499, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "远处，怪物正欲往跪坐在地的圣娅方向前进。"}
{"time": 1721150505, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "一下跪倒在地上，如同承受了钻心咒一般，只能发出唔唔的声音。"}
{"time": 1721150517, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "但是被女仆长和师傅两人拦下。"}
{"time": 1721150610, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "女仆长即使怪力无双，也比不上一个5米高的怪物，被怪物一拳就击飞到空中，但是女仆长一个鹞子翻身在空中转了几圈轻巧落地，没受到太大伤害。"}
{"time": 1721150664, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "师傅那边怪物每次拳头砸下，师傅就如同幻影一般，避开攻击同时对着怪物的关节和眼睛攻击"}
{"time": 1721150696, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "怪物根本碰不到师傅的衣角，但是师傅也奈何不了它。"}
{"time": 1721150702, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "“啊...”支撑不住身体趴倒在地，看着怪物和师傅单挑"}
{"time": 1721150743, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“我连龙都砍过，第一次见比龙皮还硬的东西。”"}
{"time": 1721150767, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "圣娅过个心灵能力恢复r100"}
{"time": 1721150804, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "。rd100"}
{"time": 1721150804, "type": "reply", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": 2875548981, "name": "小雅"}, "message": "[菲儿]演奏出: 1D100=37"}
