{"time": 1721152448, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "（还是人多好用啊）"}
{"time": 1721152453, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "。r3#d100"}
{"time": 1721152453, "type": "reply", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": 2875548981, "name": "小雅"}, "message": "[菲儿]演奏出: 1D100= \n42\n9\n62"}
{"time": 1721152469, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(我知道够了，但真的很难绷)"}
{"time": 1721152488, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "（我看出来了，这个菲儿也不太行，我感觉喵音来已经四个90秒了）"}
{"time": 1721152527, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "（你rp一下？）"}
{"time": 1721152593, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "“...大家！”感觉到蓄积已经足够，站稳身形全力施展灵能，“来自异界的怪物，这个世界不属于你！滚回被封印的监牢里吧！”"}
{"time": 1721152688, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "无形的波动涌现，在场阻拦怪物的人们都心头一震，而怪物如同时间定格一样停止了行动。"}
{"time": 1721152737, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "圣娅的眼睛冒出紫色的幽光，她这时候能看到怪物的身体上方，出现了心灵之火"}
{"time": 1721152790, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "那火焰还传来信息“不！！！！！你这该死的虫子！你怎敢用我的招式对付我？”"}
{"time": 1721152840, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "“哼，区区囚徒而已。记好了，我终有一天会来彻底了结你。”熄灭火焰"}
{"time": 1721152841, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“我知道了，你这不是天赋，你这就根本和那伙人一样！”"}
{"time": 1721152861, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "随后只有圣娅能看到的心灵之火消散"}
{"time": 1721152912, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "而于此同时，怪物身躯上的皮肤渐渐溃烂剥落，化作黑雾消散。"}
{"time": 1721152930, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "师傅一剑斩下了怪物的头颅"}
{"time": 1721152972, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "“结束了...”感觉胸腔里的气瞬间消散，身形摇晃跌倒在地上，视野也开始发黑，“困...”还没说完，昏了过去。"}
{"time": 1721152979, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "似乎觉得不太放心，又凭空挥剑，把还在空中飞舞的头颅切成了肉沫。"}
{"time": 1721153038, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "在圣娅晕过去之前，隐约感觉到师傅出现在身边，以及师傅温暖的怀抱。"}
{"time": 1721153048, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“做的很好，你让我骄傲。”"}
{"time": 1721153062, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“现在好好休息吧”"}
{"time": 1721153068, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "。log off"}
{"time": 1721233851, "type": "reply", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": 2875548981, "name": "小雅"}, "message": "继续记录乐谱"}
{"time": 1721233868, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "圣娅过个灵感rd100"}
{"time": 1721233875, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "。rd100"}
{"time": 1721233875, "type": "reply", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": 2875548981, "name": "小雅"}, "message": "[菲儿]演奏出: 1D100=65"}
{"time": 1721233883, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "（上来你就感觉不对是吧哈哈）"}
{"time": 1721233899, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "（有没有感觉奇怪为什么要过灵感）"}
{"time": 1721233956, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(不知道)"}
{"time": 1721233961, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(这么神必)"}
{"time": 1721233994, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "冰冷，黑暗，圣娅睁开眼睛，发现自己在漆黑的海底"}
{"time": 1721234062, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "“...这里是哪里?”保持躺着的状态"}
{"time": 1721234087, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "海里没有一丝光亮，只能听到海水朦胧的气泡声。"}
{"time": 1721234110, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "突然圣娅看到一丝光亮"}
{"time": 1721234143, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "那光亮如同幻影，在海里摇摇欲坠。"}
{"time": 1721234157, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "揉揉眼睛，往光亮处走"}
{"time": 1721234196, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "（应该是游）"}
{"time": 1721234223, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "即使在海里，圣娅也并不感觉到窒息或者难受。"}
{"time": 1721234239, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "“好奇怪的地方...应该是梦吧”"}
{"time": 1721234250, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "在圣娅游向那光亮的同时，光亮也在贴近圣娅。"}
{"time": 1721234288, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "在接触到光亮的一瞬间，圣娅如同被拉进了一面镜子，周围的空间破碎又再次组合"}
{"time": 1721234338, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "在一阵眼花缭乱的变化之后，圣娅感觉到自己出现在了一个昏暗的房间中央，但是不能动弹。"}
{"time": 1721234364, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "“啊！”头晕眼花，缓和一阵后看看四周"}
{"time": 1721234406, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "随后房间门口的蜡烛火光晃动，一个人影由远及近，进入屋内。"}
{"time": 1721234439, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "逐渐走到圣娅眼前。"}
{"time": 1721234451, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "张大眼睛看他"}
{"time": 1721234486, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "那人揭开兜帽，赫然露出一张挂着枯死脸皮的骷髅脸"}
{"time": 1721234530, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“谁？是谁在看我！”"}
{"time": 1721234569, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "正当那个骷髅脸凑近房间中央，和圣娅对视时，他突然惊慌失措，面露恐惧。"}
{"time": 1721234581, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "“......”沉默着看着他"}
{"time": 1721234590, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "然后圣娅的视角一震天翻地覆，空间又破碎重组。"}
{"time": 1721234606, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "圣娅又回到了漆黑的海底"}
{"time": 1721234667, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "“巫妖?”躺在海底"}
{"time": 1721234668, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "但是圣娅这时突然感觉呼吸困难，吐出的气泡往海面上浮"}
{"time": 1721234715, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "“咳咳。”尝试往海面上游"}
{"time": 1721234943, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "圣娅在氧气耗尽前终于游出了海面，大口大口的呼吸着新鲜空气"}
{"time": 1721234962, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "这时圣娅才发现，眼前是陌生的天花板"}
{"time": 1721235015, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "“还在梦里吗？”低声吐槽，然后看看四周"}
{"time": 1721235102, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "圣娅看到自己的左手被蓝色的毛团紧紧抓住，动弹不得，右手被粉色的毛团包裹其中，也动弹不得。"}
{"time": 1721235142, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "而自己是身处一张豪华的大床上"}
{"time": 1721235172, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "房间的内饰跟皇宫内自己的房间比都不遑多让"}
{"time": 1721235220, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "“......”闭上眼睛，尝试睡着"}
{"time": 1721235357, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "。rd100梅妮的察觉"}
{"time": 1721235357, "type": "reply", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": 2875548981, "name": "小雅"}, "message": "[我叫五个五]使用[梅妮的察觉]演奏出:[1D100=97]"}
{"time": 1721235369, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "。rd100苏茜的察觉"}
{"time": 1721235369, "type": "reply", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": 2875548981, "name": "小雅"}, "message": "[我叫五个五]使用[苏茜的察觉]演奏出:[1D100=52]"}
{"time": 1721235390, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(97)"}
{"time": 1721235403, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:mface,summary=&#91;升天&#93;,url=https://gxh.vip.qq.com/club/item/parcel/item/e0/e0e72b848f54de5ccffacb660b2f57aa/raw300.gif,emoji_id=e0e72b848f54de5ccffacb660b2f57aa,emoji_package_id=235847,key=9bd6ed197ad677e3]"}
{"time": 1721235426, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "那么圣娅看到梅妮的耳朵抖了抖，随后她抬起头，眼睛正对着圣娅的眼睛"}
{"time": 1721235453, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "苏茜也稍微起身，看向圣娅"}
{"time": 1721235460, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "随后"}
{"time": 1721235477, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“圣娅姐/小姐！你终于醒了！”"}
{"time": 1721235502, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "两道巨大的惊喜声在圣娅左右耳旁响起"}
{"time": 1721235516, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "“啊...”叹了口气，“我睡了多久?”"}
{"time": 1721235542, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "尝试把双手抽出来"}
{"time": 1721235573, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“已经三天了！我还以为圣娅姐要醒不来了呢！”苏茜握紧了你的手腕。"}
{"time": 1721235653, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“对啊，医生说圣娅小姐身体没有受伤，但是就是醒不过来，真是吓死我了！”梅妮察觉到圣娅的动作，也用将圣娅的手臂抱紧在自己的胸口"}
{"time": 1721235692, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "“唉唉，这不是醒过来了吗？”有些哭笑不得，用轻快的语气，“好了，让我起来吧。”"}
{"time": 1721235812, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "准备起床换身衣服"}
{"time": 1721235993, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "那么两只小猫也恋恋不舍的放开圣娅的胳膊"}
{"time": 1721236058, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "“好像是闹出了很大的事啊。”"}
{"time": 1721236068, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“圣娅小姐，你三天没吃饭了，身体难免有些虚弱，让我帮你换吧。”梅妮如影随形的跟着你过来"}
{"time": 1721236102, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“梅妮你作为客人，怎么能做这种事呢？应该让我帮圣娅姐姐换衣服！”"}
{"time": 1721236115, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "苏茜也从另一边跟上，不服气的说。"}
{"time": 1721236141, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“圣娅姐姐作为客人，我会服务周到的！”"}
{"time": 1721236166, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "苏茜抬起双手握了握小拳头。"}
{"time": 1721236182, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "“呃...那就麻烦小苏茜了？”把衣服递给苏茜，“这几天王都那边有什么消息吗？“"}
{"time": 1721236231, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "“那一天你们都没有受伤吧。”打量着她们的状态。"}
{"time": 1721236266, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "苏茜一面开心的辅助圣娅换起了衣服，而梅妮听到圣娅的话愣在一旁，低下头不知道在想什么。"}
{"time": 1721236335, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“没有没有，多亏了圣娅姐姐，我当时可是真的吓死了，我第一次这么近见到流血事件。”"}
{"time": 1721236349, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "苏茜回想起当时的事，有些后怕。"}
{"time": 1721236390, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“圣娅姐姐真的太帅了！要不是圣娅姐姐在我旁边，我说不定早就躺在墓地了。”"}
{"time": 1721236408, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "“果然还是给你们带来不好的影响了。”叹气，“这件事情估计动静不小吧。”"}
{"time": 1721236452, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“我也没有受伤的，我当时接到苏茜小姐，就和教会的人快速撤走了。”"}
{"time": 1721236512, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“但是我们还是在远处看到了那个巨大的怪物，果然…圣娅小姐付出了不少代价才打赢的吧，要不然也不会一睡这么长时间…”"}
{"time": 1721236527, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "梅妮也抬起头语气激动的说"}
{"time": 1721236552, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“要是我能帮上什么忙就好了…”"}
{"time": 1721236563, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "“辛苦小梅妮了。”摸摸梅妮的脑袋，“我啊？其实也没有怎么出力啦，都是靠师傅女仆长和骑士团的大家啦。”"}
{"time": 1721236592, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "“不过，还有有点在意，王都那边没有消息传过来吗？”"}
{"time": 1721236626, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "“我担心老爹听到这消息会坐不住，我的自由也跟着泡汤。”愁眉苦脸"}
{"time": 1721236634, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "圣娅在苏茜的帮助下很快换好了衣服，梅妮在一旁羡慕的看着。"}
{"time": 1721236739, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“事情发生之后，第一时间就通知了王都那边，但是此次事件性质太过恶劣，所以保密工作做的很好。民众们只知道发生了刺杀事件。”"}
{"time": 1721236748, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "苏茜点头说到"}
{"time": 1721236787, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "“确实是麻烦的事情，一切都太巧了。”拉开门准备出房间"}
{"time": 1721236790, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“好像我听雷德叔叔说，王室那边有人乘坐专线要过来。”"}
{"time": 1721236820, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "“也许背后有什么人在主导也说不定。”出门，“走吧，不能让其他人一直担心了。”"}
{"time": 1721236874, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“嗯，先跟大家都见个面吧，白狼先生也在我家里住着呢！”"}
{"time": 1721236884, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "苏茜在前面蹦蹦跳跳的带路"}
{"time": 1721236906, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "梅妮低着头走在圣娅身旁，眼睛时不时斜视圣娅。"}
{"time": 1721236915, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "。log off"}
{"time": 1721578696, "type": "reply", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": 2875548981, "name": "小雅"}, "message": "继续记录乐谱"}
{"time": 1721578749, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "圣娅梅妮跟着苏茜前往会客厅，同时苏茜苏茜也在路上吩咐女仆把人都叫过来。"}
{"time": 1721578815, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "“唉，真是棘手啊。”一路上一直叹气，“苏茜可要帮我掩护，小梅妮也是，我可不想就被抓回王都。”"}
{"time": 1721578883, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "位于一楼的会客厅有着两排对放的大沙发和几个小沙发，用的不知名的高级动物皮缝制，沙发之间是个木质茶几，上面已经准备好了红茶和一些点心。"}
{"time": 1721578939, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“那圣娅小姐我们马上就离开岛上吧！”梅妮两眼放光的说。"}
{"time": 1721578997, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“可是这件事惊动了王都，那边派了很重要的客人过来，我父亲还特意吩咐我要照顾好圣娅姐姐。”"}
{"time": 1721579006, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "苏茜有些苦恼的挠头"}
{"time": 1721579018, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "圣娅过个r100肚子饿"}
{"time": 1721579022, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "“好主意，我们跟他们报声平安就跑吧。”"}
{"time": 1721579024, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "。rd100"}
{"time": 1721579024, "type": "reply", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": 2875548981, "name": "小雅"}, "message": "[菲儿]演奏出: 1D100=36"}
{"time": 1721579051, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "“赶在王都的人来之前，就没问题。”"}
{"time": 1721579124, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "那么圣娅肚子不合时宜的发出了咕噜声"}
{"time": 1721579170, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "“嗯...”看着点心再看看苏茜，“可以尝一点么?“"}
{"time": 1721579179, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "”哦，我都忘了圣娅姐姐三天没吃东西了，我这就吩咐厨师做饭，圣娅姐姐想吃什么？”苏茜说到。"}
{"time": 1721579232, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "“能方便快速解决的吧？炒饭就不错。”"}
{"time": 1721579236, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“圣娅小姐还是吃点粥之类的比较好吸收的食物为好，毕竟昏迷了三天。”梅妮在旁边微笑的看着圣娅。"}
{"time": 1721579258, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "“我们还要随时逃跑呢！”拉着梅妮"}
{"time": 1721579262, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "（我预判你说的话）"}
{"time": 1721579267, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "（我狠不狠）"}
{"time": 1721579282, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "（我就知道你这个B要吃这种东西）"}
{"time": 1721579287, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(唉)"}
{"time": 1721579292, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(我是炒饭高手)"}
{"time": 1721579304, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "“粥的话...感觉好慢哦”"}
{"time": 1721579537, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“为了圣娅姐姐身体着想，还是就吃粥吧。”苏茜露出坚毅的表情，吩咐女仆去通知厨师。"}
{"time": 1721579593, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“不过圣娅小姐也应该很渴了，喝点茶水还是可以的。”梅妮拉着圣娅一起入座沙发。"}
{"time": 1721579621, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "“唉，万一在这会被逮住了就麻烦了。”拿起红茶，“算了，待会再想吧。”"}
{"time": 1721579630, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "苏茜看到微微皱了皱眉，赶忙在圣娅身旁坐下。"}
{"time": 1721579639, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "苏茜看到微微皱了皱眉，赶忙在圣娅身另一旁坐下。"}
{"time": 1721579707, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“哟！圣娅殿下已经醒了。身体怎么样，没有什么大碍吧。”"}
{"time": 1721579710, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "一边喝茶一边吃点心，放松地躺在沙发靠背上"}
{"time": 1721579715, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "圣娅随着声音来源看去"}
{"time": 1721579745, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "是脸上贴了一块纱布的白狼"}
{"time": 1721579767, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "白狼也走过来在茶几对面的沙发上坐下。"}
{"time": 1721579789, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "他似乎因为沙发过于高档而显得有点束手束脚。"}
{"time": 1721579789, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "朝他挥挥手，“辛苦你帮我挡那怪物了。”"}
{"time": 1721579811, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "“感觉应该没什么事?就做了个挺长的梦的。”"}
{"time": 1721579859, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“那就好，话说回来，那群邪教徒的尸体都变成干尸了，难以辨认身份。”"}
{"time": 1721579888, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“但是还是调查出来他们的一些情报了。”"}
{"time": 1721579918, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "白狼拿起一杯茶，一口就喝干了一杯，毕竟杯子对他来说太小了。"}
{"time": 1721579931, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“具体情报就由我来说明吧。”"}
{"time": 1721579935, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "“说来听听?”放下茶盏"}
{"time": 1721579957, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "女仆长不知何时出现在苏茜身后。"}
{"time": 1721579976, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "她身上似乎没有什么伤的样子？"}
{"time": 1721580007, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "打量她一会，但是最终没开口询问，“那就麻烦您了。”"}
{"time": 1721580169, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“您是在关心我的身体吗？当天我就被教会的牧师治疗，再加上歇息了几天，已经没有大碍了。”"}
{"time": 1721580179, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“谢谢关心。”"}
{"time": 1721580199, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "点点头，“那最好不过了。”"}
{"time": 1721580212, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "女仆长发现了圣娅的目光，并且对圣娅微微鞠了个恭"}
{"time": 1721580241, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“哎，那些牧师说我是什么小伤，就没给我治疗，我可是脸受伤啊。”"}
{"time": 1721580258, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "白狼发出略带抱怨的声音掺合进来。"}
{"time": 1721580290, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "“可是我听说战士的伤疤可是荣誉呢。”笑着回复白狼"}
{"time": 1721580481, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“还是说回正题，那群刺杀大小姐和公主殿下的邪教徒是早有预谋，他们趁着丰渔节人流量过多，混进人群就不说了，但是大小姐今年上去主持可是伯爵家和教会内部商量的。”"}
{"time": 1721580524, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "看着女仆长示意她继续"}
{"time": 1721580582, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“这群邪教徒最后死亡之后都变成干尸，这与30年前在西部帝国边境的一个小村子发生的事有些相似。”"}
{"time": 1721580608, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“据调查，那个村子几百号人一夜之间全部死亡变成了干尸。”"}
{"time": 1721580651, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“并且现场也有穿着打扮类似这群邪教徒的尸体。”"}
{"time": 1721580695, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "“啧，把手伸到公国来了啊。”"}
{"time": 1721580865, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "。log off"}
{"time": 1722267917, "type": "reply", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": 2875548981, "name": "小雅"}, "message": "继续记录乐谱"}
{"time": 1722268015, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "（你在？）"}
{"time": 1722268031, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(在啊)"}
{"time": 1722268134, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "女仆长接着叙述着几十年前那场惨案记录"}
{"time": 1722268213, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“除此之外，村庄中心发现了魔法阵以及巨大的脚印和破坏痕迹，跟这次的非常相似。”"}
{"time": 1722268223, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "默默听着"}
{"time": 1722268258, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“魔法阵后来据阵法专家鉴定是封锁结界，于是帝国方面得出结论是村庄被结界封锁了，无人生还。”"}
{"time": 1722268414, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "“结界?”诧异地听着"}
{"time": 1722268428, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“但是后来有记载，当时附近的森林里有猎户，听到了奇怪的吼叫声以及大量鸟类离奇飞起的事件，除此还有沿着树丛延伸一路的血迹，最后血迹不知所踪。”"}
{"time": 1722268614, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“大概事发5年后，有调查员找这名猎户考证，发现猎户不知所踪，只留下了几年无人居住的小木屋。”"}
{"time": 1722268747, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“这时我托人在我国档案记录处调查得到的结果，可能详细的记录在帝国有留存。”"}
{"time": 1722268835, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "“有什么关联么？”一边吃糕点一边开口"}
{"time": 1722268973, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“能关联到的地方就是村庄中心有几具干尸的服装与这次袭击者相似，并且这些人尸体上有一个相同样式的六芒星魔法阵刻印。”"}
{"time": 1722269046, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "“嗯....要说的话，那可能是邪神一类的东西吧。”"}
{"time": 1722269059, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“但是几十年前那场事件里并没有提到可以封锁魔法的死灵术道具，就是那个骷髅头，我认为很可能是针对伯爵千金身上的魔法道具才准备的。”"}
{"time": 1722269064, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "“我与他对峙的时候被拉到过某个幻境里。”"}
{"time": 1722269093, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“啊？我是被邪神盯上了？”"}
{"time": 1722269110, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "苏茜有些害怕的缩到圣娅身旁"}
{"time": 1722269159, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“难以下定结论，公主殿下能说说那个幻境吗？”"}
{"time": 1722269189, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "女仆长从裙子底下掏出了一个小笔记本和笔。"}
{"time": 1722269221, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "“大概就是有个自称邪神的东西，跟我说这是个解除封印的仪式吧。”"}
{"time": 1722269236, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "“小苏茜因为血统被选为目标了。”"}
{"time": 1722269329, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "“具体是什么我也不知道了，但确确实实，可能是某种邪恶的强大生物。”"}
{"time": 1722269542, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=-2147387639]（[CQ:at,qq=1252219916] 你是怎么知道的）"}
{"time": 1722269551, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "（你神志不清了？）"}
{"time": 1722269555, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(啊？)"}
{"time": 1722269563, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(我居然是不知道的吗)"}
{"time": 1722269563, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "（这不是我剧透给你的）"}
{"time": 1722269566, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(场外太多了)"}
{"time": 1722269569, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(记混了)"}
{"time": 1722269702, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "“更多的我也不知道了，也许首都那边会有一些线索。”"}
{"time": 1722269786, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "[CQ:image,file=9E10F73B771BF2AF14CCA59BCFBF2E51.jpg,url=https://multimedia.nt.qq.com.cn/download?appid=1407&amp;fileid=CgoyMzg4OTIxODE4EhTMNjUJTeKSW3RjlD5RiZky8D1ZWhimk3Mg_woohseo79LMhwNQgL2jAQ&amp;spec=0&amp;rkey=CAQSKAB6JWENi5LMkBYoD6tvItNJq4LFBmsyIEh_2c4K6xHv6v3wvT0sH8c,file_size=1886630]"}
{"time": 1722269801, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(什么p5r改编)"}
{"time": 1722269867, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“如果是这样事情就很严重了，必须通知国内重点注意这件事，以及通知邻国，让他们也一起防范。”"}
{"time": 1722269908, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "“嗯嗯。”吃下最后一块糕点，拉起梅妮起身，“我们准备离开了。”"}
{"time": 1722269977, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“还有，就是他们对这次袭击准备的太过于充分了，针对大小姐的魔法道具，以及在祷告仪式上大小姐和公主殿下身边没有护卫的情况行突然袭击。”"}
{"time": 1722270023, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“你是想说有人泄露了大小姐的情报？”"}
{"time": 1722270039, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "“这倒也是个问题，内部确实不太干净呢。”"}
{"time": 1722270041, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "白狼双手交叉撑在下巴上"}
{"time": 1722270088, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“当然也考虑到了这件事，雷德已经在秘密组织人手查找了。”"}
{"time": 1722270135, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“我就只是一个普普通通大小姐，怎么会被邪神盯上的啊？”"}
{"time": 1722270136, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "“那么剩下的时间我就不多叨扰了。”往门外走，“师傅肯定跟得上来啦。白狼先生要一起吗？”"}
{"time": 1722270182, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "“小苏茜可是很有潜力的，这一点我深信不疑。”笑着摆摆手，另一只手牵着梅妮往外走"}
{"time": 1722270208, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "在圣娅即将碰到会客厅门把手的时候"}
{"time": 1722270220, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "大门彭的一声自己打开了"}
{"time": 1722270280, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“我的好妹妹你是要去哪？不是刚刚从昏迷中醒过来，就又要劳累？不好好休息一下？”"}
{"time": 1722270327, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "映入眼帘的是圣娅熟悉的两个身影"}
{"time": 1722270342, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "“啊？”后退几步看着来人"}
{"time": 1722270378, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "比圣娅高了一个头的金发御姐狐狸，以及戴眼镜的金发瘦弱帅哥。"}
{"time": 1722270424, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“二妹，你身体如何了，听说你昏迷了三天。”"}
{"time": 1722270435, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "“姐姐，还有二哥?”继续后退，“呃呃，没事没事，我这不是精神很好吗？”"}
{"time": 1722270441, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "二哥从大姐的身后走出，推了推眼镜"}
{"time": 1722270463, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "偷偷瞟瞟周围有没有窗户"}
{"time": 1722270483, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "过个rd100侦查"}
{"time": 1722270497, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "。rd100"}
{"time": 1722270497, "type": "reply", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": 2875548981, "name": "小雅"}, "message": "[菲儿]演奏出: 1D100=22"}
{"time": 1722270566, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "那么圣娅发现整个会客厅可能是出于私密性的着想，使用的都是在天花板附近的小型格栅窗"}
{"time": 1722270608, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "在圣娅目光左右瞟都时候"}
{"time": 1722270614, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "“唉...”微微叹气"}
{"time": 1722270620, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "大姐已经走上前来抱住了圣娅"}
{"time": 1722270642, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "于此同时圣娅听到了微微地啜泣声"}
{"time": 1722270663, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“没事就好，没事就好。我还以为，你再也醒不过来了”"}
{"time": 1722270726, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "“诶?诶?”回抱住大姐，拍拍她的背小声“对不起，让你们担心了。”"}
{"time": 1722270727, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "大姐的柔顺金发与圣娅的金发交织在一起，反射窗外阳光闪出一抹金色"}
{"time": 1722270776, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "苏茜白狼和身后的梅妮也都看着这一幕，露出了微笑。"}
{"time": 1722270794, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "二人就这样站着温存了一段时间"}
{"time": 1722270832, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "然后圣娅发现由于身高差，自己的脸完全埋在大姐成熟的象征里，喘不过气"}
{"time": 1722270872, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "大口吸气，“姐...姐..姐姐，喘...喘不过来了。”"}
{"time": 1722270926, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“大姐，这样站着也不合适，还是先坐下来慢慢说吧。”二哥注意到了圣娅的窘况，出声提醒"}
{"time": 1722270961, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“好，妹妹你突然出走，可把我们家里几个吓坏了。”"}
{"time": 1722270986, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "大姐就这样直接抱起你，把你放到沙发上"}
{"time": 1722270999, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "“我明明跟父皇说过了啦。”红着脸低头解释"}
{"time": 1722271023, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "“我想出去玩玩嘛，一天到晚待在宫里好无聊的。”"}
{"time": 1722271142, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "“姐姐和二哥这次不会是来抓我回去的吧，不要嘛好不好。”抱着大姐手臂撒娇"}
{"time": 1722271145, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "二哥在你们对面坐下来，“那也要通知家里人吧，多准备点魔法道具和护卫啊，万一要是出了什么事…”"}
{"time": 1722271176, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“不行，这次不仅要把你带回去，而且小苏茜也要一起。”"}
{"time": 1722271194, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“难说邪教徒会不会再来一次袭击。”"}
{"time": 1722271232, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“只要在皇宫里就不会遇袭了，起码比现在这里安全。”"}
{"time": 1722271238, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "“没事的啦二哥，你太操心了，我现在不是完好无损地站在这里吗？”"}
{"time": 1722271261, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "“圣娅很强的哦，而且还有师傅，不会出事的。”"}
{"time": 1722271308, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“你不是昏迷了三天？我听说伯爵家最好的医生以及教会的人都来看了情况，各种方法都试了都没办法唤醒。”"}
{"time": 1722271355, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“再说了，恕我直言，你的师傅大人好像对那个召唤出来的怪物无法造成伤害。”"}
{"time": 1722271368, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "“意外情况啦”"}
{"time": 1722271385, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "一直站在圣娅身后的师傅皱了皱眉，开口"}
{"time": 1722271422, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“这次确实是我的责任，我当时应该带着圣娅直接撤离到安全地点再回来阻击。”"}
{"time": 1722271444, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "“师傅很强的，姐姐和二哥不要怀疑啦。”"}
{"time": 1722271451, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "说着师傅突然出现在你们身旁"}
{"time": 1722271465, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "然后对着圣娅单膝跪地"}
{"time": 1722271473, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“请恕罪。”"}
{"time": 1722271582, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "“诶?”立刻扶起师傅，“师傅不用这样的，这次的事都是我的错。”"}
{"time": 1722311658, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "。rd5"}
