{"time": 1723396160, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "。rd100梅妮的幸运"}
{"time": 1723396160, "type": "reply", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": 2875548981, "name": "小雅"}, "message": "[我叫五个五]使用[梅妮的幸运]演奏出:[1D100=60]"}
{"time": 1723396167, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "。rd100大姐的幸运"}
{"time": 1723396167, "type": "reply", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": 2875548981, "name": "小雅"}, "message": "[我叫五个五]使用[大姐的幸运]演奏出:[1D100=21]"}
{"time": 1723396180, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "（我靠，梅妮还真）"}
{"time": 1723396190, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(这么拉胯啊幸运)"}
{"time": 1723396229, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "梅妮一边走一边细心用脚感受着沙子，仿佛这样就能不错过宝藏。"}
{"time": 1723396304, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "然后她感觉脚上踩到了一个硬硬的东西，但是没受伤，挖出来一看，竟然是一枚金币。"}
{"time": 1723396317, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“(⊙o⊙)哇，传说是真的！”"}
{"time": 1723396333, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "眨着眼睛凑上去，“诶?真的有金币吗？”"}
{"time": 1723396342, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "梅妮兴奋地跳了起来，就差跳一段舞蹈庆祝了。"}
{"time": 1723396356, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "梅妮把金币举起让大家都能看到。"}
{"time": 1723396399, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "金币在阳光照射下泛起金光，两面都有些模糊的图案难以辨认。"}
{"time": 1723396449, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "凑上去看看是什么图案，“这是什么金币啦？好像不是现在发行的?”"}
{"time": 1723396456, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“这…，我记得那传说之后几百年就没人捡到过金币了啊，梅妮小姐运气这么好？”"}
{"time": 1723396476, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "苏茜凑过来有些怀疑人生地嘟囔。"}
{"time": 1723396526, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“确实，这不是大陆上现在任何一个国家的金币。”二哥推了推眼镜，仔细看了看。"}
{"time": 1723396548, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "“嘛，苏茜难道不够幸运吗？”轻轻笑一笑，“梅妮，能把金币给我看看吗？”"}
{"time": 1723396580, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“而且虽然图案难以辨认，但是它上面的图案是用魔法铭刻上去的，我没看错的话。”"}
{"time": 1723396627, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“真奇怪，铸币也要动用魔法吗，只有制作魔法道具才会用到铭刻才对。”"}
{"time": 1723396665, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“好，给你。”梅妮将金币交到你的手里。"}
{"time": 1723396702, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "拿起金币仔细看看"}
{"time": 1723396823, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "r侦查"}
{"time": 1723396926, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "。rd100"}
{"time": 1723396926, "type": "reply", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": 2875548981, "name": "小雅"}, "message": "[菲儿]演奏出: 1D100=26"}
{"time": 1723396982, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(什么情况啊)"}
{"time": 1723396993, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(跑coc团的时候一直大失败)"}
{"time": 1723397000, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "那么圣娅发现图案模糊不清难以辨认，只是觉得确实是件古老的金币。"}
{"time": 1723397005, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(这会又开始低出目)"}
{"time": 1723397059, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "“这可是梅妮的幸运金币。”放回到梅妮手中，“要好好留着哦。”"}
{"time": 1723397070, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "说着继续沿着海岸线往前走"}
{"time": 1723397267, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“肯定会的…”梅妮好好接过金币，找到一块布包起来收了起来。"}
{"time": 1723397362, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "一行人接着沿着海岸线走，白沙，海浪，路上的椰子树，海边礁石，飞过的一排排海鸟，构成了海岛独特的风景"}
{"time": 1723397402, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "偷偷打量有没有即将出港的船只"}
{"time": 1723397417, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "一行人来到了码头和沙滩的交界处，这时太阳也不在天空正中。"}
{"time": 1723397458, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "这个交界处有不少游客，甚至有着买卖椰子，宝石和各种饮料水果的小贩。"}
{"time": 1723397519, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“要不要买点饮料休息一下，都走了这么久了。”苏茜看着这些摊贩。"}
{"time": 1723397556, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“好啊，我请大家喝吧！圣娅想喝什么？”大姐豪爽地请客。"}
{"time": 1723397567, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=-2147341859]r侦查"}
{"time": 1723397605, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "。rd100"}
{"time": 1723397605, "type": "reply", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": 2875548981, "name": "小雅"}, "message": "[菲儿]演奏出: 1D100=47"}
{"time": 1723397637, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "“我的话，喝一些冰葡萄汁吧。梅妮和苏茜要什么?这可是长公主请客，机会难得呢”"}
{"time": 1723398015, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "那么圣娅只发现了一些出海钓鱼打渔的小舢板，码头那边有一艘好像是货船的船入港。"}
{"time": 1723398087, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“啊，谢谢长公主殿下，我的话一杯柠檬水就行。”梅妮低头感谢大姐。"}
{"time": 1723398107, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“那我和圣娅姐姐喝一样的吧。”"}
{"time": 1723398119, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "叹气，摇摇头"}
{"time": 1723398198, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "接过葡萄汁小口啜饮"}
{"time": 1723398224, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "众人找了个地方就座，圣娅发现白狼似乎没点饮料就离开了，不一会儿白狼带着两个西瓜过来。"}
{"time": 1723398249, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“夏天还是要吃西瓜啊，我来切吧。”"}
{"time": 1723398313, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "白狼没用他那个大曲刀，而是掏出来一把擦的干净的小刀熟练地均匀切好西瓜。"}
{"time": 1723398322, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "“辛苦啦。”"}
{"time": 1723398333, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "此时再悄悄抬头看看港口"}
{"time": 1723398350, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "白狼一口就吃完了一瓣西瓜。"}
{"time": 1723398381, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "梅妮也开心的小口吃着。"}
{"time": 1723398443, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "陪着冰葡萄汁吃西瓜"}
{"time": 1723398453, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "“唉，就这么回去吗？”"}
{"time": 1723398461, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "一个人小声喃喃自语"}
{"time": 1723398510, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“圣娅，怎么一直看着码头，想回皇宫了？”二哥发现了圣娅时不时转头的动作。"}
{"time": 1723398553, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "“嗯...”"}
{"time": 1723398571, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "“就这么回去的话，下次什么时候才能出来啦。”闷闷不乐"}
{"time": 1723398661, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“好了好了，别不开心了，我回去跟父王说说，下次多带点护卫带圣娅一起出来玩。”大姐摸了摸圣娅的耳朵安慰到。"}
{"time": 1723398678, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "这时圣娅发现梅妮的脸色有些不对。"}
{"time": 1723398704, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "“梅妮?”第一时间想到了金币，“把金币拿出来。”"}
{"time": 1723398724, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“我…我去方便一下。”梅妮有些害羞地捂住了脸离开。"}
{"time": 1723398774, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "（其实是上厕所）"}
{"time": 1723398817, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "“哦。”有些无语地坐了回来，感觉自己有些过于敏感了"}
{"time": 1723398825, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "“什么时候回去?”"}
{"time": 1723399309, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“今晚还是先到苏茜家休息一晚吧。你二哥船舱躲了好几天都没休息好呢。”"}
{"time": 1723399327, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "大姐带着些笑意看着二哥。"}
{"time": 1723399353, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“我这不都是想来看圣娅，确保我妹妹的安全吗。”"}
{"time": 1723399365, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "二哥有些义愤填膺的嘴硬。"}
{"time": 1723399369, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "“有这么想见我吗？”跟着大姐一起笑吟吟得看着二哥"}
{"time": 1723399453, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“圣娅你是不知道，你二哥半夜偷偷到船上厨房偷吃，差点被当成老鼠…”大姐捂着嘴都快笑出声了。"}
{"time": 1723399486, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "“二哥好歹是王子呢？大姐也给他留点面子吧。”捂着嘴忍住笑"}
{"time": 1723399508, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "那二哥便涨红了脸，“吃饭…我自己家的船，怎么能算作偷？”"}
{"time": 1723399541, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "周围里充满了快活的空气。"}
{"time": 1723399549, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "“都做到这份上了，我也只能跟着回去了吧。”最后看一眼港口，“真是的，我会乖乖的啦。”"}
{"time": 1723399560, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "过了一时半会儿，梅妮还是没回来。"}
{"time": 1723399587, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "“梅妮还没回来?”展开心灵领域搜索梅妮的位置。"}
{"time": 1723399653, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "圣娅感觉到这附近人员密度较大，心声都较为混乱。"}
{"time": 1723399666, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "r100心灵能力"}
{"time": 1723399694, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "。rd100"}
{"time": 1723399694, "type": "reply", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": 2875548981, "name": "小雅"}, "message": "[菲儿]演奏出: 1D100=54"}
{"time": 1723399776, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "但是圣娅和梅妮多日相处，早已经记住梅妮独特的心灵频率。"}
{"time": 1723399811, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "“在这里。”起身用空间魔法传送到附近，“我去看看。”"}
{"time": 1723399813, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "她集中注意力，就感知道梅妮在不远的码头边缘，停住不动。"}
{"time": 1723399862, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "（不是，信息不是共享的，你咋不和大姐他们说说，引出话题啊）"}
{"time": 1723399866, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "（你这rp）"}
{"time": 1723399882, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "（怎么没有跑团的时候认真）"}
{"time": 1723399969, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(我说了啊)"}
{"time": 1723399981, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(改一下顺序)"}
{"time": 1723400026, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "“找到梅妮了，大姐，二哥，我先过去看看，有些担心。”起身用空间魔法传送到附近"}
{"time": 1723400148, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“唉，这孩子怎么找到的，也不说一下位置。”圣娅只听到大姐的余音。"}
{"time": 1723400207, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "（对了，你那个短距离空间传送只能传送到看到的地方）"}
{"time": 1723400221, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(那就几次跃迁嘛)"}
{"time": 1723400232, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "（那差不多）"}
{"time": 1723400241, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "一声轻响，出现在梅妮身后"}
{"time": 1723400253, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "（差不多白井黑子那种的，最多50米）"}
{"time": 1723400325, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“啊，怎么突然有人出现在泥身后了。”"}
{"time": 1723400362, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "圣娅首先听到了蹩脚的本国语言"}
{"time": 1723400372, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "圣娅首先听到了蹩脚的大路语"}
{"time": 1723400379, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "圣娅首先听到了蹩脚的大陆语"}
{"time": 1723400401, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "停稳身形，定睛看向声音来源"}
{"time": 1723400441, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“啊，是圣娅小姐，你是来找我吗。她只是找我问路的。”"}
{"time": 1723400450, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "梅妮转过身面向圣娅。"}
{"time": 1723400548, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "把梅妮拉到自己身边"}
{"time": 1723400561, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "看着眼前的另一个人，“这位是?”"}
{"time": 1723400566, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "那么圣娅看到了白发金瞳的一个娇小少女，身高在1m5上下，瞳孔还闪了两下光。"}
{"time": 1723400621, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“啊，我就是找她问个路，这里是不是龙国港口啊？”"}
{"time": 1723400675, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "白发金瞳的少女身上穿的是旧抹布斗篷，里面能隐约看到黑色的奇艺服装。"}
{"time": 1723400703, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "“诶?这里是公国境内了。”"}
{"time": 1723400711, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“话说泥刚才，是怎么突然出现的，空间传送吗？”"}
{"time": 1723400730, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "“你从哪里来?”迟疑了一下点点头，“空间转移啦。”"}
{"time": 1723400757, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“这里是龙国港口？她刚才还跟我说不是啊？”白发少女歪了歪头有些疑惑地看着梅妮"}
{"time": 1723400828, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "“不是啦，这里是公国。”"}
{"time": 1723400843, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "“龙国，你要去龙国吗？”一字一句慢慢解释"}
{"time": 1723400956, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“唉？我坐错船了！！！”"}
{"time": 1723400979, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "少女的喊声在码头间回荡。"}
{"time": 1723400984, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "。log off"}
{"time": 1725294235, "type": "reply", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": 2875548981, "name": "小雅"}, "message": "继续记录乐谱"}
{"time": 1725294246, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "（他这个记录的是哪个）"}
{"time": 1725294269, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(以前那个)"}
{"time": 1725294278, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(中间不是妙音接了一部分)"}
{"time": 1725294461, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "三人边走边聊，慢慢向沙滩方向走去。"}
{"time": 1725294485, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "路上有什么事情发生吗？\nrd100 大于50为有"}
{"time": 1725294498, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "。rd100"}
{"time": 1725294498, "type": "reply", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": 2875548981, "name": "小雅"}, "message": "[菲儿]演奏出: 1D100=45"}
{"time": 1725294752, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "那么三人回到之前的沙滩座椅旁，大姐用责怪的眼神看了看圣娅，同时也好奇的望向旁边这个新人物。"}
{"time": 1725294829, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"什么时候回去?\""}
{"time": 1725294860, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“boss，这些都是你的手下吗？”"}
{"time": 1725294913, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"呃...这位是我姐姐，这位是我哥。\""}
{"time": 1725294916, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“今晚在小苏茜家歇息一晚，明天早上就出发，你二哥这几天都没休息好，今晚好好休息一下吧。”"}
{"time": 1725294929, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "大姐回应到。"}
{"time": 1725294954, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"刚刚捡的。\"对大姐说，\"招来当侍从了。\""}
{"time": 1725294978, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "*鞠了一躬行礼，“既然是boss的哥哥姐姐，那就是我的大哥大姐了，有什么事尽管吩咐，我也不是吃干饭的！”"}
{"time": 1725295049, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“圣娅是这种会到处捡人的体质吗，以前在皇宫里待着都没看出来呢。”大姐微笑的看着圣娅和旁边的白发少女。"}
{"time": 1725295065, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“大哥大姐，还有各位，叫我伊芙就好！”"}
{"time": 1725295105, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "*然后看到白狼，眼睛闪烁了两下"}
{"time": 1725295135, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"嗯...仔细想一想，好像确实是。\"思考"}
{"time": 1725295170, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“怎么了，怎么突然看我，你可以叫我白狼，我也是圣娅小姐的侍从，我们算是同事吧。”"}
{"time": 1725295223, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“白狼吗，确实是白色的，白狼前辈你长的真的很帅！”"}
{"time": 1725295248, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“能让我摸一摸毛皮吗”"}
{"time": 1725295263, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“咳咳，这个嘛，也不是不可以…”"}
{"time": 1725295290, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "圣娅竟然能不用心灵能力感受到白狼的害羞情绪。"}
{"time": 1725295303, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "*那我伊芙不客气了，直接上去rua"}
{"time": 1725295305, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "心情不错，\"既然决定了，那就先回小苏茜家吧，不想晒太阳了。\""}
{"time": 1725295405, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“那好，我们先回稍做歇息然后吃饭吧。”\n苏茜一口饮尽剩下的果汁，蹦跳着起身往回走。"}
{"time": 1725295476, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“我会为各位，还有这位伊芙小姐也安排好客房的，有什么要求可以路上说出来。”\n女仆长略退一步，跟着苏茜。"}
{"time": 1725295496, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "*从白狼身上下来"}
{"time": 1725295519, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“终于能吃饭了，我都好几天没吃东西了。”"}
{"time": 1725295527, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"嗯。\"跟着苏茜往回走，\"苏茜有空要去王都玩。\""}
{"time": 1725295652, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“boss明天要回这个国家的首都吗？家在首都啊，真有钱。”"}
{"time": 1725295723, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“嗯，我会的，说不定过几天就要被父亲接过去了，毕竟这次事件还是被不少民众看到了。”"}
{"time": 1725295741, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "苏茜微微调整步伐走到圣娅身边。"}
{"time": 1725295929, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"苏茜直接入宫来吧。\"摸摸头，\"没有你会寂寞的。\""}
{"time": 1725295936, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“不好意思请问一下，什么事件？”"}
{"time": 1725295944, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=-2147258038][CQ:at,qq=2388921818] \"是的哦?不然怎么会雇佣侍从呢。\""}
{"time": 1725295982, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“伊芙小姐是刚来岛上吗？而且应该不是本地人吧。”\n苏茜回应"}
{"time": 1725296021, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“对啊，苏茜小姐看人真准，我从龙国那边坐船坐错了坐到这的。”"}
{"time": 1725296272, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“多谢夸奖了，那个事件指的是前几天邪教徒刺杀我和圣娅姐啦，不过看我们现在这样就知道他们没成功。”"}
{"time": 1725296338, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“邪教徒？刺杀？这么危险吗，boss，我跟着你以后也会碰到这种事？”"}
{"time": 1725296422, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"应该不会吧？\""}
{"time": 1725296435, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "有些心虚，\"在首都肯定不会啦。\""}
{"time": 1725296505, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“只要小圣娅能好好呆在宫里，肯定不会出事的。”\n二哥突然插了一句。"}
{"time": 1725296565, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"唉。\"责怪地看了一眼二哥，\"什么时候才能出去啦。\""}
{"time": 1725296567, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“这次小圣娅还昏迷了好几天，之前从来没受过这种伤的。都是你乱跑。”"}
{"time": 1725296676, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“好了好了，等小圣娅回去再检查检查身体，等国内把邪教徒的事查清楚清理干净，然后多带点护卫，父王他应该会同意的。”\n大姐出来打圆场。"}
{"time": 1725296707, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“你们一家人感情还真是不错呢。”"}
{"time": 1725296719, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "*伊芙感慨到"}
{"time": 1725296750, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“话说boss，又是什么皇宫又是父王的，你难道是公主吗？”"}
{"time": 1725296784, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"可是在宫里好无聊哦，带护卫又好麻烦，有师傅就挺好的啦。\""}
{"time": 1725296832, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "点点头，\"小女子不才，确实是二公主的说。\""}
{"time": 1725296862, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“唉？”"}
{"time": 1725296875, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“那他们呢？”"}
{"time": 1725296901, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "*看向高调的金发美人和戴眼镜的二哥"}
{"time": 1725296929, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"说过了哦，我大姐和我二哥。\""}
{"time": 1725297030, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": " “唉唉唉！”"}
{"time": 1725297064, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“那个，我是伯爵家女儿来着的。”苏茜苦笑着小声说到。"}
{"time": 1725297117, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "啪叽…伊芙眼神失去高光倒在地上。"}
{"time": 1725297123, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"皇家侍从哦?还吃得起饭吗？\""}
{"time": 1725297137, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "。log off"}
{"time": 1731688921, "type": "reply", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": 2875548981, "name": "小雅"}, "message": "继续记录乐谱"}
{"time": 1731689092, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "天色渐晚，魔力透支还未痊愈的圣娅，加上抬鲸鱼的一通折腾，大家享用过美餐，都各自回房间睡觉了。在圣娅回房间的路上，大姐和二哥一左一右，盯着圣娅进了房间，才离开。"}
{"time": 1731689100, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "那么圣娅要做什么呢？"}
{"time": 1731689221, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "（又开了一把？）"}
{"time": 1731689227, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(没啊)"}
{"time": 1731689235, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "在房间休息"}
{"time": 1731689241, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(这我能干嘛)"}
{"time": 1731689441, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "那么圣娅躺上了床，由于魔力透支的副作用，很快就进入了梦乡"}
{"time": 1731689445, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "过个灵感"}
{"time": 1731689459, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "()"}
{"time": 1731689463, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(怎么过"}
{"time": 1731689478, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(d20+几，多少以上是过)"}
{"time": 1731689506, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "（rd100）"}
{"time": 1731689527, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "（数值越大越算成功）"}
{"time": 1731689553, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "（只有战斗的时候，你打人才是rd20）"}
{"time": 1731689584, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "。rd100"}
{"time": 1731689584, "type": "reply", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": 2875548981, "name": "小雅"}, "message": "[月篝]演奏出: 1D100=7"}
{"time": 1731689592, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(?)"}
{"time": 1731689732, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "那么圣娅一夜无梦，休息的非常好，早起的时候，魔力透支的症状减轻了"}
{"time": 1731689768, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"嗯..好多了。\"起床"}
{"time": 1731689778, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"之后要当个好孩子啊..\"叹气"}
{"time": 1731689853, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "圣娅从床上坐起身之后，就听到门口传来了敲门声"}
{"time": 1731689927, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "那么门外的是？\n1伊芙\n2女仆长\n3苏茜\n4大姐"}
{"time": 1731689991, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "。rd4"}
{"time": 1731689991, "type": "reply", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": 2875548981, "name": "小雅"}, "message": "[月篝]演奏出: 1D4=1"}
{"time": 1731690032, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "（？）"}
{"time": 1731690040, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "（最搞的选项）"}
{"time": 1731690103, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(还行吧)"}
{"time": 1731690105, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“起床了，boss，太阳晒屁股了！”\n敲门声没响两下，房门就被碰的一声推开，撞到墙上。"}
{"time": 1731690136, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "伊芙大摇大摆的走进来，身上穿着新衣服"}
{"time": 1731690175, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“boss，今天早上女仆长就把我的新衣服送来了，效率太高了。”"}
{"time": 1731690185, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "那么是什么款式的衣服？"}
{"time": 1731690192, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "（你给几个选项？）"}
{"time": 1731690259, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(?)"}
{"time": 1731690326, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "1.女仆装\n2.普通的衬衫和下装\n3.泡泡裙\n4."}
{"time": 1731690329, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(想不到了)"}
{"time": 1731690333, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "（行）"}
{"time": 1731690334, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(我对女装没有造诣)"}
{"time": 1731690385, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "1.女仆装\n2.普通的衬衫和下装\n3.泡泡裙\n4.执事服"}
{"time": 1731690388, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "。rd4"}
{"time": 1731690388, "type": "reply", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": 2875548981, "name": "小雅"}, "message": "[乌露露]演奏出: 1D4=4"}
{"time": 1731690393, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "（？）"}
{"time": 1731690402, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "（我感觉这骰子被我操纵了）"}
{"time": 1731690412, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "（每次都是我最想要的选项）"}
{"time": 1731690585, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "来者正是穿着崭新执事服的伊芙，除了个子矮了一点之外，伊芙脸上挂着的笑容与新衣服搭配起来别有风采"}
{"time": 1731690653, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "圣娅还处于穿着睡裙在床上的状态"}
{"time": 1731690697, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“需要我服侍boss你换衣服吗？”伊芙鞠了一躬，摆出一副正经脸"}
{"time": 1731690768, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"不需要，我不是boss吗？\""}
{"time": 1731690932, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"而且，你也不擅长这种事吧。\"笑"}
{"time": 1731690979, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“这种事不试试怎么知道呢？”\n说着伊芙拿起圣娅的衣服就要尝试一下。\n“boss你先把睡裙脱了！”"}
{"time": 1731691131, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"诶?\""}
{"time": 1731691137, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"不要不要，我自己来。\""}
{"time": 1731691267, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "坐在床上，一时间都有些没反应过来"}
{"time": 1731691276, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“那好吧，boss，我先去楼下等你吃饭了。”"}
{"time": 1731691290, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"嗯嗯，我马上下来。\""}
{"time": 1731691347, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "不一会儿，圣娅整理好着装，下楼前往餐厅。"}
{"time": 1731691350, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "看伊芙出去，从床上起来换衣服"}
{"time": 1731691443, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "餐厅里各位客人都已入座，经过这些天的相处，白狼和梅妮都不那么拘谨了，只是当然，圣娅的位置旁边是大姐和二哥"}
{"time": 1731691470, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"嗯...大家，早上好。\"坐在留给自己的位置上"}
{"time": 1731691471, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“好些了吗？”大姐看着圣娅入座，关切地询问到。"}
{"time": 1731691518, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"嗯，今天起来好多了。\""}
{"time": 1731691535, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“那么事不宜迟，吃完早饭就告别苏茜吧，这两天也多加叨扰了。”\n二哥推了推眼镜说到。"}
{"time": 1731691590, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"嗯...听姐姐和哥哥的。\""}
{"time": 1731691661, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "坐下来安安静静地吃东西"}
{"time": 1731691677, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "圣娅能注意到苏茜有些闷闷不乐"}
{"time": 1731691714, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "苏茜低头小口小口吃着有果酱的面包，胃口也不太好"}
{"time": 1731691803, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"苏茜，要不一起回去?\""}
{"time": 1731691883, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“对啊，小苏茜也一起回去，住皇宫里也安全些。”\n大姐看到圣娅主动出击治愈苏茜，也打助攻附和"}
{"time": 1731691904, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"嗯嗯，姐姐都这么说了。\""}
{"time": 1731691934, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“我…这个岛上事物还需要有人处理。”\n苏茜抬起头，欲言又止。"}
{"time": 1731691970, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"女仆长女士?\""}
{"time": 1731691975, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "看着女仆长"}
{"time": 1731692019, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“……丰渔节已经结束了，剩下的事物可以交给其他人处理了，大小姐。”"}
{"time": 1731692037, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "女仆长低下头在苏茜耳边说。"}
{"time": 1731692100, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "苏茜挣大了双眼\n“那…我就跟他们一起去王都！”\n声音里都散发了喜悦之情。"}
{"time": 1731692235, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"小苏茜的话，可以跟我住一起呢\""}
{"time": 1731692294, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“不行，我的妹妹还是需要静养呢。”大姐宠溺的摸了摸圣娅的头\n“不过安排一下住隔壁还是可以的。”"}
{"time": 1731692396, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“那就这么说定了？”\n苏茜尾巴都翘起来晃了晃，似乎有些迫不及待地想收拾行李了，但是女仆长眼神暗示苏茜把早饭好好吃完。"}
{"time": 1731692481, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"嗯嗯，过一段时间就好了。\""}
{"time": 1731692541, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "在此对话发生的同时，伊芙已经飞速炫了好多吃的了，再不吃圣娅就没得吃了"}
{"time": 1731692683, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "本来也没打算吃多少，吃一些自己面前的食物"}
{"time": 1731692937, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "那么吃完了各位就暂时回房间休整，因为圣娅有空间戒指所以不用整理，等苏茜整理完行李，大家集合坐上了马车前往码头。"}
{"time": 1731693010, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "在码头驻扎的士兵带领下，大家从贵宾通道准备上皇室快速豪华游艇。"}
{"time": 1731693065, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "说是快速通道，实际上离传统的客运码头通道不远，依稀能听到那边人群的说话声。"}
{"time": 1731693072, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "过个聆听rd100"}
{"time": 1731693140, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "。rd100"}
{"time": 1731693140, "type": "reply", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": 2875548981, "name": "小雅"}, "message": "[月篝]演奏出: 1D100=94"}
{"time": 1731693216, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "（？）"}
{"time": 1731693222, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "（你是真行啊）"}
{"time": 1731693230, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(偶尔偶尔)"}
{"time": 1731693416, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“你知道吗…昨天我喝多了夜里在甲板上厕所，上着上着就突然起好大的雾气，雾里隐约还有比船帆还巨大的怪异黑影，吓得我差点掉海里！”\n一名水手正在一个拐角和另一名水手聊天摸鱼。"}
{"time": 1731693454, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"大姐，二哥，你们听见了吗？\"询问左右两人"}
{"time": 1731693460, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“得了吧，要真遇到了这种事情，那你们船是怎么开回来的，我看是你这小子喝多了梦游。”"}
{"time": 1731693478, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "。rd100伊芙聆听"}
{"time": 1731693478, "type": "reply", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": 2875548981, "name": "小雅"}, "message": "[乌露露]使用[伊芙聆听]演奏出:[1D100=83]"}
{"time": 1731693487, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "。rd100大姐二哥聆听"}
{"time": 1731693487, "type": "reply", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": 2875548981, "name": "小雅"}, "message": "[乌露露]使用[大姐二哥聆听]演奏出:[1D100=79]"}
{"time": 1731693505, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "（好嘞，二哥大姐刚好没过）"}
{"time": 1731693543, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"伊芙，听见了吗？\""}
{"time": 1731693544, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“听到什么，小圣娅？”大姐用手蹭了一下你的脸颊。"}
{"time": 1731693581, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“听见了boss！我想他们说的应该是，什么大雾，海怪之类的。”"}
{"time": 1731693657, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"海上好像有海怪。\"指着那边的水手"}
{"time": 1731693668, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“海怪吗，我记得之前确实有这个童谣故事，不过还没人真正见过呢。”二哥回忆了一下自己阅读的书籍。"}
{"time": 1731693740, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“是那些水手说的吗？过去问问吧。”大姐神情严肃了起来。"}
{"time": 1731693824, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"嗯\""}
{"time": 1731693859, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "走过去问问水手遭遇了什么"}
{"time": 1731693903, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "看到一大帮子气质和衣着明显不凡的人走过来，吓得那两名水手马上立正了。"}
{"time": 1731693927, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“报告长官，我们没有偷懒，只是在检查货物数量！”"}
{"time": 1731693997, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"各位先生，请问刚刚所说的海怪和大雾?\""}
{"time": 1731694185, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“哦，这个嘛…这位小姐，也可能只是我看错了，比较当时我喝醉了，也许你可以问问船长或者船上其他人？”\n说完，这名水手指了指不远处的一艘运货帆船，\n“我就是那艘船的水手，船长应该还在船上的”"}
{"time": 1731694242, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"大姐?\"询问大姐的意见"}
{"time": 1731694512, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“小圣娅你觉得呢，其实我觉得没有必要，毕竟我们船的速度很快的。上面也有各种魔法防护。”"}
{"time": 1731694539, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“而且也不知道到底是不是真的，不如快些回去，避免夜长梦多。”"}
{"time": 1731694604, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"嗯...我倒是觉得先问一下比较好。\""}
{"time": 1731694804, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“那就去问一下吧，感觉海怪什么的，超酷的！”\n伊芙乐呵呵地说。"}
{"time": 1731694823, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"诶?我还是不想遇见那么麻烦的东西\""}
{"time": 1731694840, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "往那边的船走，找到船长问问情况"}
{"time": 1731694840, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“没事，我会保护好boss的。”"}
{"time": 1731694931, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "那么4人在帆船货物入口处见到了船长，苏茜等其他几人刚才被二哥安排已经上船了。"}
{"time": 1731695026, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "在询问一番后得知，船长说确实夜晚值班的人员报告遇到了大雾，为了防止触礁和搁浅他也起来坐镇了，但是大雾很快就散了，也没见到什么巨大黑影。"}
{"time": 1731695070, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"嗯..总感觉会有不好的事发生。\""}
{"time": 1731695082, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“哦，对了昨晚双月还挺漂亮的。雾里依稀都看得到。”"}
{"time": 1731695092, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "船长补充了一句。"}
{"time": 1731695181, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“好了好了，别担心了，相信我们船只的防御力吧，小圣娅可能就是之前遇到那个恶魔一样的东西有后遗症了，这可得回家之后好好让姐姐安慰一下消除恐惧。”"}
{"time": 1731695193, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“回去之后要和姐姐一起睡吗？”"}
{"time": 1731695323, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"嗯，如果姐姐想和圣娅一起睡的话。\""}
{"time": 1731695332, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"走吧，回家。\""}
{"time": 1731695695, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "那么4人上了船。随着一声声钟声和号角响起，船驶离了虹云岛，向着家的方向驶去，圣娅站在船舷上，看着这座小岛逐渐变小，直至消失。回过头，望着正在甲板上的大家，其中有家人旧友也有新认识的朋友，大家似乎被什么事情逗乐了笑的很开心。"}
{"time": 1731695778, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "（差不多了，你说句话今天就结束）"}
{"time": 1731695925, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"真好啊。\"站在甲板上，看着小岛逐渐从视野里消失，转过头看着其他人 \"希望未来也一切顺利。\"带着恬静的笑容。"}
{"time": 1731695955, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "。log off"}
{"time": 1735313925, "type": "reply", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": 2875548981, "name": "小雅"}, "message": "继续记录乐谱"}
{"time": 1735314177, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "离开虹云岛后，皇家快艇有魔法加持，比来时行驶的更加快速但是更加平稳，船上的设施也很齐全豪华，图书室、健身房、酒吧等娱乐场所一应俱全，甚至还附带一个较小的泳池"}
{"time": 1735314219, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "船长带着圣娅和她的朋友们一起参观船上各处。"}
{"time": 1735314306, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“这也太豪华了，万恶的资本…呕不，封建主义…”\n伊芙小声的嘀咕。"}
{"time": 1735314357, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"...\"装作疑惑，\"那是什么?\""}
{"time": 1735314527, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“老板，你看我干什么？”"}
{"time": 1735314563, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"我是说，那什么资本啦封建啦\""}
{"time": 1735314566, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"都是些什么\""}
{"time": 1735314607, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“晚上在船的桅杆瞭望台上看星星，肯定别有一番风味，我还没做过这么大的船呢。”\n梅妮对晚上到来很期待。"}
{"time": 1735314681, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“？”\n伊芙很疑惑，她不明白这个本地兽耳娘能轻松说出这两个词语，明明她只是小声地说过一遍。"}
{"time": 1735314689, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "。rd100梅妮的灵感"}
{"time": 1735314689, "type": "reply", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": 2875548981, "name": "小雅"}, "message": "[乌露露]使用[梅妮的灵感]演奏出:[1D100=73]"}
{"time": 1735314699, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“！”"}
{"time": 1735314728, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "伊芙眼睛里闪过一道光芒，似乎明白了什么"}
{"time": 1735314741, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"什么?\""}
{"time": 1735314806, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“没什么没什么，我听镇子上一个大叔说的，我也不懂什么意思啦，就只知道他骂那些贵族是这么骂的（小声）”"}
{"time": 1735314825, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“老板不会怪我吧，我不是骂你的，我只是感慨一下。”"}
{"time": 1735314906, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"嗯?为什么是骂人的话?\"歪歪头，\"不太懂呢。\""}
{"time": 1735315089, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“圣娅和你的新朋友们就自由在船上行动吧，我已经跟护卫们吩咐了要以对待贵客的礼节对待你们。”\n大姐转头对大家吩咐到。\n“圣娅如果还难受可以先来我房间休息一会儿哦。”"}
{"time": 1735315153, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“等下中午就在餐厅集合用餐吧，用完餐我会安排人带大家去各自的房间的。”"}
{"time": 1735315197, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"嗯。\"摆出贵族礼仪回应，下一秒泄气，\"好了，随便逛逛吧。\""}
{"time": 1735315323, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "船上有以下地点：餐厅、健身房、酒吧、图书馆、仓库、皇家客房、游泳池等地点"}
{"time": 1735315369, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "。rd7"}
{"time": 1735315369, "type": "reply", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": 2875548981, "name": "小雅"}, "message": "[月篝]演奏出: 1D7=3"}
{"time": 1735315378, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "那么去酒吧坐一会"}
{"time": 1735315393, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“我比较想去酒吧和健身房看看，比较我一个大男人跟你们三个小姑娘一起也不太好，那我先走一步了。”\n白狼点头回礼后独自离开"}
{"time": 1735315402, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "（不是，这个是让你选）"}
{"time": 1735315410, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "（不是随机事件）"}
{"time": 1735315459, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "（你选一个）"}
{"time": 1735315497, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "那就去图书馆"}
{"time": 1735315501, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(气质符合)"}
{"time": 1735315580, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "梅妮和伊芙跟着你一起前往了靠近船尾的图书馆"}
{"time": 1735315681, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "这是一个小型图书馆，仅有五六排4m多高的书架，在图书馆深处还有三个附带有小桌椅和魔法灯的小隔间。"}
{"time": 1735315772, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "随便选一本书坐到桌边点起小灯阅读"}
{"time": 1735315780, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "内部铺着一看就很贵的带有花纹的地毯，能最大的吸收噪音，里面没有人静悄悄的。"}
{"time": 1735315808, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "梅妮选了一本航海用星象学的书坐到你对面。"}
{"time": 1735315898, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "伊芙大字不识一个，一遍用手指点来点去一遍嘴里小声念诵什么东西，最终选到一本书也凑了过来。"}
{"time": 1735315902, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "静心读书，偶尔听一听海浪涌向船体的声音"}
{"time": 1735315915, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "。rd100伊芙幸运"}
{"time": 1735315915, "type": "reply", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": 2875548981, "name": "小雅"}, "message": "[乌露露]使用[伊芙幸运]演奏出:[1D100=74]"}
{"time": 1735315964, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "圣娅撇了一下伊芙的封面，发现是一本教学初级火系魔法的书籍"}
{"time": 1735316003, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "但是伊芙的识字只能用悲剧形容，只是看着里面的法阵觉得好看"}
{"time": 1735316015, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "。rd100伊芙的领悟"}
{"time": 1735316015, "type": "reply", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": 2875548981, "name": "小雅"}, "message": "[乌露露]使用[伊芙的领悟]演奏出:[1D100=58]"}
{"time": 1735316037, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "轻轻叹口气，把自己的书合上，凑到她身边教她认字。"}
{"time": 1735316156, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“谢谢boss！”伊芙小声地说了一句。"}
{"time": 1735316171, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "梅妮不一会儿也加入了进来"}
{"time": 1735316181, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "一上午就在学习中度过"}
{"time": 1735316225, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "（那个coc的成长）"}
