{"time": 1735316328, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "（害得我自己来）"}
{"time": 1735316373, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "伊芙勉强能认清平日使用口语的文字了。"}
{"time": 1735316485, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "中午餐厅集合后，享用完专业级厨师做的美味饭菜，大姐拍了拍手身后的燕尾服老头子便带领各位前往各自的房间。"}
{"time": 1735316507, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"嗯...这几天每天上午都过来吧。\"指了指书本，午餐后跟着去自己的房间"}
{"time": 1735316577, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "大姐和二哥是走廊入口的对门两间，圣娅的房间在大姐隔壁，梅妮住在圣娅对面，圣娅隔壁是伊芙，梅妮隔壁是白狼。"}
{"time": 1735316623, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "回房间休息，享受一下柔软的大床"}
{"time": 1735316624, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "师傅大人的房间在最里面，但是师傅表明她不需要房间。"}
{"time": 1735316652, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "但是还是盛情难却的进去坐下了。"}
{"time": 1735316952, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "圣娅地睡了午觉，因为之前魔力透支还没完全好的原因，醒来时窗外的太阳已经离开了高空，在天空与大地的二分之一，散发出温暖的柔和光芒"}
{"time": 1735316963, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "圣娅美美地睡了午觉，因为之前魔力透支还没完全好的原因，醒来时窗外的太阳已经离开了高空，在天空与大地的二分之一，散发出温暖的柔和光芒"}
{"time": 1735317074, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "靠着床背坐着，闲适地看着窗外的夕阳，难得有几分惬意"}
{"time": 1735317154, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "砰砰砰，传来敲门声"}
{"time": 1735317239, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"请进。\""}
{"time": 1735317355, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "门啪的一下打开，弹到墙上，“boss，要不要一起去后面泳池玩，好热的现在。”\n伊芙的身后跟着梅妮和大姐，梅妮似乎已经不怎么介意皇族的身份了，能泰然处之，而伊芙刚开始就完全没在意"}
{"time": 1735317421, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"嗯...可以哦。\"点点头，\"不过，我现在只能看你们玩啦。\""}
{"time": 1735317449, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“为什么boss不一起玩嘛？”"}
{"time": 1735317564, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"暂时不想下水。\"看向大姐"}
{"time": 1735317730, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“好了好了，圣娅她可能还没休息好，在旁边晒晒太阳喝喝饮料就好。”"}
{"time": 1735317754, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "大姐get到你的意思了。"}
{"time": 1735317774, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"嗯嗯。\"点点头，\"走吧\""}
{"time": 1735317814, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "大姐带着圣娅、梅妮和伊芙去泳池甲板下的更衣室换衣服"}
{"time": 1735317881, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "换好衣服，挑一个晒着太阳的地方坐下，相当于换个地方休息。"}
{"time": 1735318118, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "大姐和伊芙正带着梅妮学游泳，这孩子呛水好几次，但是一直没放弃，顺带一提，梅妮的耳朵在游泳的时候会下意识贴在头皮上，防止进水。"}
{"time": 1735318223, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "圣娅一边晒太阳享受日光，一边喝饮料。"}
{"time": 1735318227, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "过个侦查"}
{"time": 1735318229, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "带着笑静静看着“...偶尔这样停下来，也不错呢...”"}
{"time": 1735318235, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "。rd100"}
{"time": 1735318235, "type": "reply", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": 2875548981, "name": "小雅"}, "message": "[月篝]演奏出: 1D100=52"}
{"time": 1735318635, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "圣娅看到远处似乎有什么反光"}
{"time": 1735318666, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "顺着反光走过去看看"}
{"time": 1735318822, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "反光是在大海远处，圣娅靠近船舷旁边想看的更清楚些。"}
{"time": 1735318838, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "再过个侦查（大于之前数值就是成功）"}
{"time": 1735318899, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "。rd100"}
{"time": 1735318899, "type": "reply", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": 2875548981, "name": "小雅"}, "message": "[月篝]演奏出: 1D100=5"}
{"time": 1735318905, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(如何呢)"}
{"time": 1735318954, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "（寄了）"}
{"time": 1735319004, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "圣娅什么也没看到，只有大海的粼粼波光和船快速行驶带起的浪花。"}
{"time": 1735319019, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“怎么了圣娅？”\n大姐凑过来询问。"}
{"time": 1735319120, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"刚刚那边好像看见了反光。\"指着最开始看着的反向揉揉眼睛"}
{"time": 1735319253, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "大姐也顺着圣娅望去的方向瞭望，什么也没有看到\n“也许是什么鱼类带起的浪花吧。”"}
{"time": 1735319393, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"嗯...也许吧。\"打着哈欠，揉揉自己的头发。"}
{"time": 1735319454, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“圣娅还没休息够吗？但是现在还是不要睡觉了，等到晚上别睡不着哦。”"}
{"time": 1735319464, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "大姐眯着眼摸了摸圣娅的头"}
{"time": 1735319598, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "（你是不是睡着了）"}
{"time": 1735319609, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "（睡着了就明天再搞吧）"}
{"time": 1735319643, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(明天吧)"}
{"time": 1735319647, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(我好困)"}
{"time": 1735397103, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "太绝望了"}
{"time": 1735397378, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "（啥时候开始"}
{"time": 1735397399, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "随便"}
{"time": 1735397410, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "你不是要通？"}
{"time": 1735397431, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "先开"}
{"time": 1735403854, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "怎么说"}
{"time": 1735403905, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "开"}
{"time": 1735403950, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "[CQ:image,file=4b7424d83dc3cf6dcc431639204ad286.image,subType=0,url=https://gchat.qpic.cn/gchatpic_new/2388921818/2064735290-2808664348-4B7424D83DC3CF6DCC431639204AD286/0?term=2&amp;is_origin=0]"}
{"time": 1735403959, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "[CQ:image,file=6cf88ee7a482b495d99d972412fa9e16.image,subType=0,url=https://gchat.qpic.cn/gchatpic_new/2388921818/2064735290-3113411748-6CF88EE7A482B495D99D972412FA9E16/0?term=2&amp;is_origin=0]"}
{"time": 1735403967, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "[CQ:image,file=f592a8c1d69fad95b72b351a11c3cca5.image,subType=0,url=https://gchat.qpic.cn/gchatpic_new/2388921818/2064735290-2413136656-F592A8C1D69FAD95B72B351A11C3CCA5/0?term=2&amp;is_origin=0]"}
{"time": 1735403980, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "（开）"}
{"time": 1735404013, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(开)"}
{"time": 1735404019, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "下午剩下的时光就在阳光中嬉戏打闹声中度过了"}
{"time": 1735404063, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "晚餐时，梅妮看到第一道菜是用来开胃的汤，脸上露出了有些恶心的表情。"}
{"time": 1735404182, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“不就是喝多了吗，这是学游泳必经之事罢了，你不喝给我喝喽。”\n坐在旁边的伊芙一把揽过梅妮的碗，两口就喝了下去。"}
{"time": 1735404230, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "大姐扶着额头，圣娅能感觉到这是对伊芙的礼仪感到无语。"}
{"time": 1735404410, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "（人呢）"}
{"time": 1735404466, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(来了)"}
{"time": 1735404470, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "用完晚餐之后，梅妮提出要出去看看星空"}
{"time": 1735404510, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "跟着一起"}
{"time": 1735404529, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“早点回来，早点休息，别着凉了哦。”\n大姐一脸温柔的嘱咐到。"}
{"time": 1735404576, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "还是三人组，她们一起来到甲板上"}
{"time": 1735404624, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"嗯，没事。\""}
{"time": 1735404646, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "今夜的天气怎么样？\n1晴朗无云\n2多云\n3乌云蔽日\n4下小雨\n5开始起雾"}
{"time": 1735404748, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "（你们在网鱼干什么）"}
{"time": 1735404839, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "。rd5"}
{"time": 1735404839, "type": "reply", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": 2875548981, "name": "小雅"}, "message": "[月篝]演奏出: 1D5=5"}
{"time": 1735404849, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(没，我在上洗手间)"}
{"time": 1735404879, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "（你上的网鱼洗手间？）"}
{"time": 1735404887, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(对的)"}
{"time": 1735404910, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "走上甲板，裹紧衣服，\"其实有点冷...\""}
{"time": 1735404987, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "圣娅注意到海面上泛着层层薄雾，船舷魔法灯光照射下还算能看清周围的海面，但是远处的海平面就漆黑无比，仿佛一头择人而噬的猛兽巨口，令人看久了就心里发怵。"}
{"time": 1735405050, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "但是雾气只是分布在海面上，爬上眺望台之后，还是能看清繁星"}
{"time": 1735405111, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "今天只有一只残月🌙挂在天空，稍显黯淡的月光没有盖住繁星。"}
{"time": 1735405137, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"...\"看着星空和大雾，\"嗯..\""}
{"time": 1735405175, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "梅妮看着星空，开始为其余两人讲解起星座和其名称的由来，并夹带了一些占卜学的知识。"}
{"time": 1735405228, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "伊芙勉强能听懂，但听了一会儿就露出了一个稍显寂寞的表情。"}
{"time": 1735405244, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "帮他们注意一下海面。"}
{"time": 1735405388, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "过个rd100"}
