{"time": 1735405910, "type": "reply", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": 2875548981, "name": "小雅"}, "message": "[月篝]演奏出: 1D100=48"}
{"time": 1735406202, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "圣娅似乎听到了一声海浪声，就像在海滩边浪击打礁石的声音，但是想仔细辨认时只听到海浪击打船底的浪潮声。"}
{"time": 1735406281, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "（想玩奎桑提了）"}
{"time": 1735406341, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "（你这是上完厕所了？）"}
{"time": 1735406691, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "（我想到一个，等回到皇宫有一个圣娅生日的剧情）"}
{"time": 1735406792, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "（你要是忙就白天再跑）"}
{"time": 1735406940, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "（？掉厕所了？）"}
{"time": 1735407037, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(肚子痛)"}
{"time": 1735407038, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(复活了)"}
{"time": 1735407131, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "（这么痛？）"}
{"time": 1735407154, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "（那还来吗，快速过掉这段回到家里？）"}
{"time": 1735407155, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(活了)"}
{"time": 1735407159, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(来)"}
{"time": 1735407283, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=-435305620][CQ:at,qq=2388921818] [CQ:at,qq=2388921818] \"嗯?\""}
{"time": 1735407306, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"这是什么?\"施展强化听力的魔法，具体听一听"}
{"time": 1735407441, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "圣娅操纵魔力流动至头顶的耳朵处，听觉也跟着劲增，狂曾。"}
{"time": 1735407488, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "侧耳听一听"}
{"time": 1735407567, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "耳边传来海风吹过风帆的声音，海浪拍打船舷的声音，梅妮的讲解，伊芙的小声嘀咕“果然不是我熟悉的天空啊…”"}
{"time": 1735407570, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "。rd100"}
{"time": 1735407570, "type": "reply", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": 2875548981, "name": "小雅"}, "message": "[乌露露]演奏出: 1D100=54"}
{"time": 1735407601, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "以及似乎什么巨大的东西划过海面的声音。"}
{"time": 1735407645, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "耳朵一抖，立刻消耗魔力传音给船上所有人"}
{"time": 1735407675, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"所有人小心！有巨大的生物在船附近\""}
{"time": 1735407809, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“啥玩意儿？”\n伊芙听到圣娅的声音，一时间都有些呆着了。"}
{"time": 1735407873, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "船上也热闹起来，卫兵各自到自己的岗位上做好警戒态势。"}
{"time": 1735407903, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "大姐也从船舱出来来到甲板上。"}
{"time": 1735407923, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "你们还位于瞭望台上"}
{"time": 1735407946, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "捂着脑袋，继续消耗魔力"}
{"time": 1735407954, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "重复一边"}
{"time": 1735408049, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "然后软软躺下"}
{"time": 1735408053, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "（？）"}
{"time": 1735408068, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(我要无魔了)"}
{"time": 1735408125, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“！”\n伊芙见到你倒下，直接把你捞在怀里确认鼻息。\n“别死啊boss，这个月工资还没发呢！”"}
{"time": 1735408134, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "深呼吸，\"没事没事，只是魔力消耗过度..\""}
{"time": 1735408158, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“我想圣娅小姐可能只是太累了…”\n梅妮紧张地附和到。"}
{"time": 1735408176, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“那我们还是先下去吧，boss你能自己走吗”"}
{"time": 1735408231, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"嗯。\""}
{"time": 1735408354, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "在你们依次爬下梯子也落到甲板上，大姐和船长都凑了过来"}
{"time": 1735408386, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"小心一些。\"收回魔力，有些虚弱，\"有大家伙\""}
{"time": 1735408467, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "看到圣娅这幅样子，大姐心疼的皱起眉头，把圣娅揽到自己怀里抚摸\n“傻妹妹，别再这样透支自己了！”"}
{"time": 1735408519, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"没..没事，还是大家的安全更重要。\""}
{"time": 1735408543, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“阁下的意思是周围有大型鱼类吗？那我叫船员打开船上的大型雾灯确认一下。”\n说着船长就吩咐命令下去。"}
{"time": 1735408655, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“这晚上的雾气也真是烦人，来的时候还没碰上这种天气的。不过好在皇家索里号上有可以把周围照亮如白昼的雾灯，不怕这种情况。”\n船长自豪地说到。"}
{"time": 1735408689, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“根据海图，这附近也没有礁石啥的，这种雾天诸位也不要担心。”"}
{"time": 1735408755, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"嗯。\"弱弱地点头"}
{"time": 1735408758, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"小心一些。\""}
{"time": 1735408782, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "说着船驾驶室四个方向都亮起灯光，如船长所说照亮了周围，穿透雾气直达海面。"}
{"time": 1735408843, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "呜～～～～～\n\n突然一声尖锐悠长的声响出现，同时船体受到了剧烈的撞击，摇晃起来。"}
{"time": 1735408877, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "甲板上的水兵都训练有素，抓住了附近的绳子和扶手什么的，稳住了身形。"}
{"time": 1735408913, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "扶住旁边的东西"}
{"time": 1735408920, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "而梅妮大姐圣娅伊芙她们就没这么专业的反应了。"}
{"time": 1735408925, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "（你旁边只有大姐）"}
{"time": 1735408945, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "（自己过平衡？）"}
{"time": 1735408953, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "（要不然我给你固定剧情）"}
{"time": 1735408958, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "。rd100平衡"}
