{"time": 1735409023, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "。rd100梅妮"}
{"time": 1735409023, "type": "reply", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": 2875548981, "name": "小雅"}, "message": "[乌露露]使用[梅妮]演奏出:[1D100=70]"}
{"time": 1735409027, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "。rd100大姐"}
{"time": 1735409027, "type": "reply", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": 2875548981, "name": "小雅"}, "message": "[乌露露]使用[大姐]演奏出:[1D100=82]"}
{"time": 1735409071, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "好了，大家都很稳，没有因为突入起来的摇晃而磕碰到什么东西。"}
{"time": 1735409082, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "好了，大家都很稳，没有因为突如其来的摇晃而磕碰到什么东西。"}
{"time": 1735409132, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "稳住身形后，圣娅透过明亮的雾灯看到，一只巨大的身影从海面略过。"}
{"time": 1735409141, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "穿过船底。"}
{"time": 1735409156, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "哗～的一声"}
{"time": 1735409183, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "从船另一面穿出水面，带起巨大的水花"}
{"time": 1735409197, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"什么...!\""}
{"time": 1735409258, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "借着亮光仔细看看是什么"}
{"time": 1735409425, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "圣娅看到两个黄澄澄如月亮一般巨大的眼睛，黑色光滑无鳞片的身躯。"}
{"time": 1735409455, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "好几只巨大的触手拍向甲板。"}
{"time": 1735409470, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "其中一只眼看就要落到你们头上。"}
{"time": 1735409497, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "尝试张开魔力护盾"}
{"time": 1735409498, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "。rd100"}
{"time": 1735409498, "type": "reply", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": 2875548981, "name": "小雅"}, "message": "[月篝]演奏出: 1D100=38"}
{"time": 1735409552, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "圣娅透支的魔力无法支撑如此庞大的触手，转瞬之间护盾就碎了，无法阻拦一秒钟。"}
{"time": 1735409565, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "（偶遇巨大触手，拼劲全力无法战胜）"}
{"time": 1735409628, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "这时候，伊芙学着圣娅的样子张开了淡蓝色的圆顶护盾，护住了众人当下了触手的攻击。"}
{"time": 1735409655, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "甚至能通过护盾看到触手密密麻麻的吸盘一张一合。"}
{"time": 1735409696, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"...谢谢啦。\"喘着气，退回来。"}
{"time": 1735409710, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“boss，我干的还不错吧！”\n伊芙单手凌空支撑，游刃有余地冲圣娅笑了笑。"}
{"time": 1735409784, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "不愧是皇家的船，触手的攻击并没有损伤太多，只是砸坏了一部分甲板和栏杆。"}
{"time": 1735409788, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"嗯嗯。\"靠着墙，有些脱力。"}
{"time": 1735409848, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "白狼这时也从船体内钻了出来，拿着他那把曲剑。"}
{"time": 1735409865, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“没事吧？你们。”"}
{"time": 1735409921, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "在众人离开触手下面之后，伊芙快速跳走的同时取消护盾，触手落到甲板上紧紧吸附住。"}
{"time": 1735409951, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"嗯，没事\""}
{"time": 1735409959, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "这一根触手就比圣娅还高，而这样的触手，圣娅粗略望去还有将近十根。"}
{"time": 1735410064, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“这不会是南海巨妖吧，我只在传说中听到过这魔兽的名字！”\n船长拔出弯刀，尝试性地砍向触手。"}
{"time": 1735410083, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"小心一些。\"没有什么魔力了"}
{"time": 1735410148, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "锋利的弯刀砍在触手表皮上只砍出来一道印痕，根本没有破皮见血。"}
{"time": 1735410165, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "（我在想，你是不是还有一些神秘魔法道具）"}
{"time": 1735410224, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "船上的各处护卫也逐渐开始攻击触手。"}
{"time": 1735410239, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "但是没什么起效。"}
{"time": 1735410270, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“不行，船的速度在变慢，我们必须摆脱它！”\n船长大声喊到。"}
{"time": 1735410319, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"有办法吗？\""}
{"time": 1735410330, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "。rd20+20白狼的攻击"}
{"time": 1735410330, "type": "reply", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": 2875548981, "name": "小雅"}, "message": "[乌露露]使用[白狼的攻击]演奏出:[1D20+20={18}+20=38]"}
{"time": 1735410334, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"我没什么魔力了...\""}
{"time": 1735410390, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "叹口气，现在连剑都不太拿得动"}
{"time": 1735410403, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "白狼挥起他巨大的曲剑，一刀斜劈在触手上，也许是武器大小的关系，还真给他劈开了一道口子。"}
{"time": 1735410449, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "但是没等白狼接下来动作，巨妖边又发出一声巨大的吼叫"}
{"time": 1735410476, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "伊呜呜呜～～"}
{"time": 1735410509, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "在场听力灵敏的兽耳种族都感到很难受。"}
{"time": 1735410517, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "伊芙不受影响。"}
{"time": 1735410568, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "捂着耳朵，\"啊..\""}
{"time": 1735410592, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "随后那只白狼砍伤的触手抬起，横向打到二楼船长室的墙壁上，轰隆一声打掉了一盏雾灯。"}
{"time": 1735410670, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "魔法灯在脱离船体之后落到海里。这边因为一方灯光消失的原因，在适应了明亮环境之后突然黑暗，眼睛仍需要适应。"}
{"time": 1735410680, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "过个聆听或侦查"}
{"time": 1735410749, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": ".rd100"}
{"time": 1735410749, "type": "reply", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": 2875548981, "name": "小雅"}, "message": "[月篝]演奏出: 1D100=82"}
{"time": 1735410815, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "（我超，小雅发力了）"}
{"time": 1735410899, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "圣娅在不适中仍然听到，一阵从头顶传来的破空声后，触手拍到海面上，那是仍有光亮的雾灯落下的地方。"}
{"time": 1735411080, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"....\"拿剑，\"我也要战斗。"}
{"time": 1735411331, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "在其他雾灯的照耀下，更多的触手攀上的船舷。"}
{"time": 1735411385, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "圣娅的剑带了吗？\n1带了\n2放在房间里了"}
{"time": 1735411389, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "。rd2"}
{"time": 1735411389, "type": "reply", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": 2875548981, "name": "小雅"}, "message": "[月篝]演奏出: 1D2=2"}
{"time": 1735411401, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "发现没有带剑，\"呃...\""}
{"time": 1735411404, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "（哈哈）"}
{"time": 1735411413, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "只能躲在伙伴身后，恢复魔力"}
{"time": 1735411440, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“在找这个吗？”\n清冷的声音响起，圣娅抬头，发现是师傅。"}
{"time": 1735411478, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "此刻在黯淡的月光，稀薄的雾气照耀下，拿着剑的师傅如遗世独立的仙人。"}
{"time": 1735411532, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "圣娅的佩剑就在师傅手里。"}
{"time": 1735411596, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“静下心来，屏蔽自己的感知。”\n师傅告诉圣娅如何应对这音波。"}
{"time": 1735411684, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "深呼吸 按照师傅教的办法，屏蔽感知，接过剑"}
{"time": 1735411697, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "准备依靠肉身而不是魔力去战斗"}
{"time": 1735411783, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "又一只触手直直冲过来，伊芙连忙张开护盾挡住"}
{"time": 1735411793, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“boss，看你的了！我只会这个！”"}
{"time": 1735411874, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "（你这个是你专精武器吧，那还有加值，专精+1，武器是带魔力的也+1，总共加2点ab）"}
{"time": 1735411962, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "。rd+19"}
{"time": 1735411962, "type": "reply", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": 2875548981, "name": "小雅"}, "message": "[月篝]演奏出: 1D100+19={48}+19=67"}
{"time": 1735411966, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "。rd20+19"}
{"time": 1735411966, "type": "reply", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": 2875548981, "name": "小雅"}, "message": "[月篝]演奏出: 1D20+19={11}+19=30"}
{"time": 1735412037, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "圣娅的剑刺入触手漆黑又滑溜溜的皮肤，使其流出墨绿色的血液。"}
{"time": 1735412064, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "（等下，你不是15点ab来着）"}
{"time": 1735412093, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "（后面再按17算吧）"}
{"time": 1735412139, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "师傅突然从身后抓住圣娅的手，带着她的手动了起来。"}
{"time": 1735412153, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(可以)"}
{"time": 1735412180, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "沿着皮肉筋膜的纹理运动，切开了触手的一小半。"}
{"time": 1735412221, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“记住这手感，沿着剑最适合动的方向行剑。”"}
{"time": 1735412314, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "随后师傅又以手带着圣娅握剑正反挥出两剑，分毫不差似是一剑砍在刚才造成的伤口上。"}
{"time": 1735412323, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "完全切断了这条触手。"}
{"time": 1735412339, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "大片墨绿色的血液飞溅而出。"}
{"time": 1735412352, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"嗯...\"尝试记住那个手感"}
{"time": 1735412376, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“好恶心，还好我护盾能一直开着。”\n伊芙从来没有这么庆幸过。"}
{"time": 1735412419, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=-840053014][CQ:at,qq=1252219916] rd一个100"}
{"time": 1735412437, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "。rd100"}
{"time": 1735412437, "type": "reply", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": 2875548981, "name": "小雅"}, "message": "[月篝]演奏出: 1D100=92"}
{"time": 1735412467, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"我记下了，师傅。\"对着另一只触手抬手挥剑"}
{"time": 1735412495, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "圣娅获得了对巨型敌人+2的ab加值"}
{"time": 1735412508, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "（好了现在是19了）"}
{"time": 1735412511, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "（也没差）"}
