{"time": 1735412632, "type": "reply", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": 2875548981, "name": "小雅"}, "message": "[月篝]演奏出: 1D20+19={9}+19=28"}
{"time": 1735412684, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "圣娅挥剑砍到另一条触手上，只堪堪砍破表皮一点点。"}
{"time": 1735412747, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "同时刚才被断一条触手的疼痛，使得海怪又发出凄厉的号叫，被攻击的那条触手沿着甲板扫向圣娅。"}
{"time": 1735412762, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"嗯...还是差点意思...\"尝试侧面翻滚躲开"}
{"time": 1735412765, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "。rd100"}
{"time": 1735412765, "type": "reply", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": 2875548981, "name": "小雅"}, "message": "[月篝]演奏出: 1D100=95"}
{"time": 1735412994, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "那么圣娅翻滚躲开了。"}
{"time": 1735413025, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "与此同时，有几个倒霉蛋掉海里了，师傅表示她要去救人。"}
{"time": 1735413041, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "同时圣娅过个侦查"}
{"time": 1735413105, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "。rd100"}
{"time": 1735413105, "type": "reply", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": 2875548981, "name": "小雅"}, "message": "[月篝]演奏出: 1D100=78"}
{"time": 1735413146, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "圣娅注意到这些落水的人都是因为身上带了提灯所以被攻击的。"}
{"time": 1735413289, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"关灯关灯!\"迅速放大自己的声音，席卷全船"}
{"time": 1735413461, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "船长听到也意识到了什么，连忙叫人关闭灯光。"}
{"time": 1735413491, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "于此同时触手又打落了一台雾灯落到圣娅面前。"}
{"time": 1735413505, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "从灯旁边闪开"}
{"time": 1735413520, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "触手马上追着灯光拍下。"}
{"time": 1735413543, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "伊芙撑开护盾挡护住了这盏灯。"}
{"time": 1735413570, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“boss，你有没有什么办法能把灯扔远一点！”"}
{"time": 1735413602, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "（想想你的武器属性和你现有的技能）"}
{"time": 1735413632, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(你的意思是)"}
{"time": 1735413646, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "长剑起风，把灯扔远一点"}
{"time": 1735413692, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "伊芙一脚踢在灯上，虽然疼的她直咧嘴，但是还是把灯踢飞到圣娅剑前。"}
{"time": 1735413706, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "（你不是有那个战技）"}
{"time": 1735413717, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "（姨妈大）"}
{"time": 1735413783, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "暴风战技，把灯吹飞"}
{"time": 1735413934, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "一阵气流酝酿缠绕在剑上，当灯飞到剑尖之前，气流螺旋释放而出，将薄雾打出来一道环形波纹，同时魔法灯也一下飞出。"}
{"time": 1735413954, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "这时船上灯光正好在船员的操作下依次熄灭。"}
{"time": 1735413990, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "仅剩下那盏明亮的雾灯划出一道优美的弧线，落入大海。"}
{"time": 1735414008, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "所有人一时间都屏住了呼吸。"}
{"time": 1735414028, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "屏住呼吸看向海面"}
{"time": 1735414076, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "圣娅能听到触手滑动的声音，木材嘎吱作响的声音，在一阵呜呜呜～声之后，传来什么重物入水的声音。"}
{"time": 1735414145, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "反冲带起的浪花砸在船沿，有些许微小的水珠溅到圣娅脸上，让圣娅清醒了不少。"}
{"time": 1735414179, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "又过了一小会儿，海面静悄悄的，雾气也变淡了许多。"}
{"time": 1735414208, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“boss，海怪走了吗？”\n伊芙突然在圣娅背后出声。"}
{"time": 1735414493, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "有些失神，回头看看，\"嗯...应该走了。\"松了口气，然后趴在船栏上，感觉前所未有的累"}
{"time": 1735414687, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "大姐正在指挥诸位收拾残局。\n师傅一手提一个落水的倒霉蛋轻点水面跳上甲板，身上一点都没有湿。\n白狼似乎有些嫌弃，因为刚才有点血液溅到他毛发上了。\n梅妮凑过来打算给圣娅按摩一下。"}
{"time": 1735414768, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“还是缺乏实战经验，回去我带着你锻炼一下。”\n师傅放下两人走过来看望圣娅，发现没有什么大碍之后说到。"}
{"time": 1735415131, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“能不能也锻炼一下我啊，我也想当个boss那样帅气的剑客！”"}
{"time": 1735415158, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“可以。”"}
{"time": 1735415217, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "船长没敢让人接着开灯，就这样收帆减速行驶一直到了日出。"}
{"time": 1735415236, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "圣娅一行人倒是早早就回去洗澡睡觉了。"}
{"time": 1735415289, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "回家，好好休息一番"}
{"time": 1735415291, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "根据事后统计，船体损伤并不多，都是一些皮外上。有一些破损栏杆封上了保护网防止有人落水。"}
{"time": 1735415318, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "船员受伤的也不多万幸无人伤亡。"}
{"time": 1735415333, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "伤的最重的断了两根肋骨。"}
{"time": 1735415355, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"感觉很久都恢复不了魔力了..\""}
{"time": 1735415374, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "圣娅早起吃饭的时候看到大姐有些许黑眼圈，似乎是熬夜安排后续处理工作导致的。"}
{"time": 1735415442, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "二哥因为没什么战斗力昨天一直在结实的船舱里呆着没出来，但是今天表示要去看看昨天砍下来的巨妖触手，看看能不能做成有用的装备和道具。"}
{"time": 1735415474, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“说起来小圣娅也是厉害，这么粗的触手都能砍断。”\n二哥从不吝啬他的夸奖。"}
{"time": 1735415594, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"嗯嗯，不过都是师傅教得好啦。\""}
{"time": 1735415712, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“boss你太谦虚了，明明很厉害，看了一眼就学会了。”"}
{"time": 1735415802, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"不知道为什么，学习的天赋很好呢。\"但是身子有点虚，\"不过身体有点跟不上\""}
{"time": 1735415919, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“小圣娅还是好好休息，昨晚又透支魔力了吧。等回到家，完全修养好，再说锻炼的事情吧。”"}
{"time": 1735415948, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "梅妮暗暗握紧拳头，决定也要变强到时候帮助圣娅。"}
{"time": 1735416006, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"嗯...魔力透支得好厉害，想休息...\""}
{"time": 1735416024, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "在朝阳下，船长命令满帆，这艘皇家最速的船展示出它的速度，在海洋中开出一道道白色的浪涛。"}
{"time": 1735416056, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "上午又教学了一波伊芙文字。"}
{"time": 1735416065, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "。en语言"}
{"time": 1735416065, "type": "reply", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": 2875548981, "name": "小雅"}, "message": "[乌露露]进行技能[语言:18]成长检定: 1D100=54 成功，春风得意马蹄急，一日看尽长安花\n该技能发生了增长: 18+1D10=18+{1}(1)=19"}
{"time": 1735416075, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "（？）"}
{"time": 1735416100, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "（话说这个跟隔壁那个明日方舟应该不会串吧）"}
{"time": 1735416165, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "那么在傍晚，甲板上的众人隐约能看到已经亮起灯火的港口了。"}
{"time": 1735416179, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "。log off"}
{"time": 1735577578, "type": "reply", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": 2875548981, "name": "小雅"}, "message": "继续记录乐谱"}
{"time": 1735577667, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "首都的皇家专用通道在远离码头的一个隐秘处，你们一行人下了船，便在非常多护卫的护送下乘坐马车回到了皇宫。"}
{"time": 1735577706, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "路上的平民都惊叹到这是发生什么事了要出动这么多护卫。"}
{"time": 1735577714, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "一想到要面对父王和母后，顿感头疼。有些闷闷不乐地坐在车里"}
{"time": 1735577789, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“boss，你咋不开心啊？”\n伊芙收回了在豪华的车内装饰上左摸右摸还想顺点纪念品的手，从对面坐到圣娅身边。"}
{"time": 1735577801, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "（其实是河南机器人）"}
{"time": 1735577828, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(好变态的河南机器人)"}
{"time": 1735577833, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(随手豫是吧)"}
{"time": 1735577878, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "掀开帘子看看外面，一边开口，\"肯定要被父王念叨很久啦，母后也不会帮我。\"苦着脸叹气"}
{"time": 1735577966, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“boss的父母很严厉吗？”"}
{"time": 1735578042, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"嗯...倒也不是啦。只是这次做得有点过火了。\""}
{"time": 1735578076, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“没事，boss你不是有那个什么茉莉透支证，你装做一副生病的样子，他们就不敢骂你了。”"}
{"time": 1735578261, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"嗯...嗯嗯。\"点点头，\"就用这个理由，真聪明，伊芙。\"从口袋里掏出糖果递给她"}
{"time": 1735578323, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "正说着，马车就已经行驶到了皇宫内部，伊芙先下车开门，由梅妮扶着圣娅下来，在不远处的皇宫中庭入口下，是圣娅的父亲和母亲。"}
{"time": 1735578353, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "大姐和二哥已经下车，看到你这幅样子，大姐也快速过来摸了摸你额头。"}
{"time": 1735578399, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“还是没有精神吗？没事，我已经提前联系好了皇宫内的最好医生了。”\n大姐有些心疼。"}
{"time": 1735578410, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"唔唔...\"装作很疲劳的样子，软软地靠在梅妮身上，对着大姐眨眨眼睛。"}
{"time": 1735578418, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“走吧，我们先去面见父王和母后。”"}
{"time": 1735578434, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "白狼和师傅跟在你们身后。"}
{"time": 1735578514, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "随着距离愈发接近，圣娅能从父亲微皱的眉头和有些颤抖的胡子上明显感觉到他的愤怒。"}
{"time": 1735578563, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "深呼吸，越走脚步迈得越小，小声跟大姐说话，\"马上是不是要生日了...\""}
{"time": 1735578571, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "当来到父亲面前时，梅妮伊芙白狼他们都行了标准的宫廷礼仪，这是在船上时大姐特意吩咐人教学的。"}
{"time": 1735578611, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "圣娅并没有看到其他兄弟姐妹在这里。"}
{"time": 1735578637, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "当圣娅真正来到父母面前时，父亲开口了。"}
{"time": 1735578655, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "低着头，\"呃..\""}
{"time": 1735578662, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“圣娅，你可知你犯了什么错吗？”"}
{"time": 1735578752, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"呃...\"回答不了，小声喃喃，\"不知道。\""}
{"time": 1735579070, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“唉…”一声长叹之后，“你不该在仅有一个护卫的情况下出行，你不该在面对打不过的敌人时还拼死硬撑，看看你现在的身体吧，要是留下了什么后遗症怎么办，我健康可爱的孩子就变成现在这样了？我们一家人就是要完完整整的，请好好珍惜自己的生命，因为你还有珍视你的家人，还有我们！”"}
{"time": 1735579143, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“好了好了，别生气了，圣娅都这样了，赶紧安排医生看看然后让她好好休息一下。”\n母亲连忙拍拍父亲那有些喘不过气的脊背，安抚情绪。"}
{"time": 1735579207, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"嗯...\"上前扶住父王，\"圣娅知错了...\"耳朵都耷拉下来。"}
{"time": 1735579235, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“不过小圣娅，你这次做的事可太严重了，怎么能不辞而别一走了之呢，虽然你的师傅很厉害，但也不是完全无敌的。虽然你救下了伯爵的千金苏茜，但是也请好好珍惜自己的性命和身体，好吗？”"}
{"time": 1735579261, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“话说这些是你新交的朋友吗？不介绍介绍？”"}
{"time": 1735579336, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "反应过来，连忙顺着台阶给他们介绍带回来的三人。"}
{"time": 1735579367, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"我已经封了白狼先生做骑士了。\"最后以这句话收尾"}
{"time": 1735579463, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "随着你的介绍，你的伙伴们逐一行礼。"}
{"time": 1735579483, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "圣娅的父母也都点头回礼。"}
{"time": 1735579578, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“好了好了，圣娅你先赶紧休息去吧。莉娅，这些圣娅的朋友们就由你安排了。”"}
{"time": 1735579701, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "松了口气，跟着大姐离开"}
{"time": 1735579704, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "（你还有什么要说的吗）"}
{"time": 1735579715, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(没吧，太哈人了。)"}
{"time": 1735579786, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "那么在圣娅回到房间之后，大姐带着其他人去各自安排的房间了。在二哥的陪伴下，不一会儿，宫廷御医来检查了。"}
{"time": 1735579814, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "经过检查圣娅的魔力透支症还要rd20天才能恢复好"}
{"time": 1735579818, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "（来"}
{"time": 1735579886, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "。rd20"}
{"time": 1735579886, "type": "reply", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": 2875548981, "name": "小雅"}, "message": "[月篝]演奏出: 1D20=12"}
{"time": 1735579924, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "得知结果，无奈地叹气，\"好麻烦..\""}
{"time": 1735579989, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“这是必要的休息，毕竟后来迎战海妖的时候圣娅还动用了魔法是吧。”\n二哥推了推眼镜。"}
{"time": 1735580008, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "随后一指头弹在圣娅额头上"}
{"time": 1735580032, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“你倒是给我长点记性啊，明明当时你的师傅大人可以处理的。”"}
{"time": 1735580087, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "捂着额头，\"好痛啊。\"气呼呼地，\"下意识就这么做了嘛\""}
{"time": 1735580120, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“希望你能多多注意自己的身体！给我记好了。”"}
{"time": 1735580163, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“话说回来，那个南海巨妖的触手，已经运送到皇宫了，这种魔物的素材可不多见。”"}
{"time": 1735580184, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“圣娅想要它的素材做成的魔法装备吗？”"}
{"time": 1735580265, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"嗯嗯。\"立刻点点头，\"二哥现在已经可以做这种东西了吗？\""}
{"time": 1735580359, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"说起来，薇娅呢？还有大哥他们，怎么都没见到。\"坐在床沿"}
{"time": 1735580361, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“算是可以吧，我也有师傅带我的。小圣娅想要什么样的装备？”"}
{"time": 1735580510, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“大哥本来在外有自己的事情，但是因为你这次遇到的邪教徒事件紧急召回皇宫了，恐怕还在路上，薇娅和安德斯倒是就在王都内，所以他们都在皇宫里。”"}
{"time": 1735580567, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "（gkdgkd）"}
{"time": 1735580580, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"嗯...减少魔力消耗的器具吧。\""}
{"time": 1735580582, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "（快说完要什么装备，准备睡觉了）"}
{"time": 1735580594, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"我的魔力确实不太足够..\""}
{"time": 1735580616, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "从床上下来，\"我去见见他们?\""}
{"time": 1735580666, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“这个确实，我们兽人本来就是不在魔力储量方面出类拔萃的种族呢。小圣娅都算厉害了。”"}
{"time": 1735580713, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“不用，小圣娅就在房间休息，他们等下会过来看你的。要不是害怕父王，他们估计刚才就来接你了吧。”"}
{"time": 1735580876, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "（OK了吧，顶不住了，睡觉了）"}
{"time": 1735580884, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "。log off"}
{"time": 1735665312, "type": "reply", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": 2875548981, "name": "小雅"}, "message": "继续记录乐谱"}
{"time": 1735665351, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "（来点爆的剧情）"}
{"time": 1735665375, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "不多一会儿，小妹薇娅就来看她的姐姐了。"}
{"time": 1735665409, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“姐姐，身体没事吧？”"}
{"time": 1735665432, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"嗯嗯。\"伸手把薇娅搂到身前，\"快让姐姐抱抱，好久没抱过了。\""}
{"time": 1735665435, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "随后她伸出如玉的小手摸向姐姐额头。"}
{"time": 1735665455, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“看到姐姐这么精神，我就放心了。”"}
{"time": 1735665468, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "薇娅眯起眼享受圣娅的抚摸。"}
{"time": 1735665503, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "真可爱，心里暗想，\"安德斯呢？怎么没一起过来。\""}
{"time": 1735665506, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“不过我听母亲说，圣娅姐姐是调皮的孩子，不告诉家里人自己跑出去玩，还受伤差点死掉。”"}
{"time": 1735665537, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "随后薇娅睁大她的眼睛，眼眶里面似乎有泪珠在打转。"}
{"time": 1735665579, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“答应我，圣娅姐姐，不要抛下我一个人活在世界上好吗，我不想在没有圣娅姐姐的世界生活！”"}
{"time": 1735665609, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "（有点重了）"}
{"time": 1735665635, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "（原来有重力魔法隐藏天赋）"}
{"time": 1735665648, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "。rd100薇娅的重力魔法"}
{"time": 1735665648, "type": "reply", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": 2875548981, "name": "小雅"}, "message": "[乌露露]使用[薇娅的重力魔法]演奏出:[1D100=36]"}
{"time": 1735665656, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "。rd100薇娅的重力魔法天赋"}
{"time": 1735665656, "type": "reply", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": 2875548981, "name": "小雅"}, "message": "[乌露露]使用[薇娅的重力魔法天赋]演奏出:[1D100=92]"}
{"time": 1735665670, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "（✓）"}
{"time": 1735665703, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "（人呢，又去看银色虞姬？）"}
{"time": 1735665753, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(没)"}
{"time": 1735665764, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=-1817762891][CQ:at,qq=2388921818] [CQ:at,qq=2388921818] \"诶诶?\""}
{"time": 1735665788, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"薇娅?\"摇摇她，\"姐姐就在这里，不是很精神吗\""}
{"time": 1735665954, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“嗯嗯，姐姐还在这里，如果没有姐姐的话，我…”\n薇娅双手抓住圣娅的手，上半身趴在圣娅的床上。"}
{"time": 1735666005, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"没有啦，姐姐没受伤，只是稍微有些拼命。\""}
{"time": 1735666086, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“答应我，就算是为了我，姐姐以后不要这么拼命了，好吗？”"}
{"time": 1735666114, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“姐姐拉勾，说谎的人要吞一千根针哦～”"}
{"time": 1735666147, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"姐姐毕竟是第二公主呢..\"摸着薇娅脑袋，ruarua耳朵\"保护臣民..也是一份责任。\""}
{"time": 1735666170, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"不过我答应薇娅就是啦，以后不会再这样了。\"伸手拉勾"}
{"time": 1735666438, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "薇娅拉勾之后破涕为笑，开始跟姐姐聊起最近生活中的一些事，比如学习魔法的问题啊，遇到的可爱小动物啊，好吃的什么的。"}
{"time": 1735666471, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "耐心地一一回复，感觉这样闲适的时光倒也不错。"}
{"time": 1735666484, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "忽然响起了敲门声"}
{"time": 1735666500, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "随后不等圣娅响应，门就自己打开了"}
{"time": 1735666524, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“不好了，boss，白狼大哥被人缠着要决斗啦！”"}
{"time": 1735666552, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "伊芙穿着崭新的女仆装冲了进来。"}
{"time": 1735666611, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“唉，这是boss的妹妹吗？”"}
{"time": 1735666630, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "随即摆正姿势弯腰行礼"}
{"time": 1735666654, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"嗯嗯。\"抱着薇娅正在rua，\"决斗?\"饶有兴趣，\"薇娅，要一起去看看吗？\""}
{"time": 1735666909, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“唉，决斗？不会是哥哥吧…”薇娅小声嘀咕。"}
{"time": 1735666980, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"安德斯?那小子不来看我，看我怎么收拾他\""}
{"time": 1735666987, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“我只是看到一个好像是自称安德斯的，突然冲过来找到白狼，叽里咕噜不知道说了一通什么，就要和白狼大哥决斗。”"}
{"time": 1735667012, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "点点头，从床上下来，牵着薇娅一起去训练场看看，\"伊芙，一起吧。\""}
{"time": 1735667014, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "伊芙挠了挠脸。"}
{"time": 1735667140, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“好的boss！”\n伊芙从裙底掏出来一副墨镜带上，跟在圣娅和薇娅身后。"}
{"time": 1735667197, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"薇娅，待会跟我一起收拾那小子。\"赶到训练场"}
{"time": 1735667199, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“话说boss你这什么茉莉透支症啥时候好啊，我还等你教我魔法呢。”"}
{"time": 1735667260, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"大概两个星期吧。\"边走边说"}
{"time": 1735667275, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "。log off"}
{"time": 1736873645, "type": "reply", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": 2875548981, "name": "小雅"}, "message": "继续记录乐谱"}
{"time": 1736873726, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "由伊芙带路，三人前往了一个皇宫内锻炼用的演武场"}
{"time": 1736873740, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "走得很快"}
{"time": 1736873749, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "几乎是跑到了演武场"}
{"time": 1736873777, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "到达时，白狼和三弟安德斯的战斗情况是？\n1还未开始\n2进行中\n3已经结束嘞"}
{"time": 1736873851, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "（？）"}
{"time": 1736873865, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "（你这反应也太慢了吧，在干什么其他事呢？）"}
{"time": 1736873871, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(没啊)"}
{"time": 1736873877, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "。rd3"}
{"time": 1736873877, "type": "reply", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": 2875548981, "name": "小雅"}, "message": "[月篝]演奏出: 1D3=3"}
{"time": 1736873893, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(因为我在芊神边上刚刚被他拉去选怪)"}
{"time": 1736873898, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(纯搞子)"}
{"time": 1736873907, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "匆匆赶到现场"}
{"time": 1736874040, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "那么白狼的出力是rd100"}
{"time": 1736874043, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "。rd100"}
{"time": 1736874043, "type": "reply", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": 2875548981, "name": "小雅"}, "message": "[乌露露]演奏出: 1D100=61"}
{"time": 1736874054, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "。rd100安德斯出力"}
{"time": 1736874054, "type": "reply", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": 2875548981, "name": "小雅"}, "message": "[乌露露]使用[安德斯出力]演奏出:[1D100=84]"}
{"time": 1736874075, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(这么凶)"}
{"time": 1736874144, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "安德斯似乎抱着很认真的心态对待这次决斗，而白狼只是想切磋试试，并不想伤到这个毛发以及眉眼之间和圣娅有些相似的贵族。"}
{"time": 1736874207, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "于是放了放水让掉了，但是似乎白狼的演技不太好，被安德斯发现了，圣娅赶来时安德斯正拽着白狼崭新执事服的领子对他大吼"}
{"time": 1736874236, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“你是在瞧不起我吗？给我真刀真枪的干一场啊！”"}
{"time": 1736874269, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"够了，安德斯!\"提起裙摆走到现场"}
{"time": 1736874274, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "白狼有些无奈地握着安德斯的双手防止自己的新衣服领子被扯破。"}
{"time": 1736874293, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "虽然有些虚弱，但还是提起嗓音喊了出来"}
{"time": 1736874333, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "。rd50+145安德斯的身高"}
{"time": 1736874333, "type": "reply", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": 2875548981, "name": "小雅"}, "message": "[乌露露]使用[安德斯的身高]演奏出:[1D50+145={49}+145=194]"}
{"time": 1736874339, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "（我靠）"}
{"time": 1736874353, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "（这小子生长期长这么高？）"}
{"time": 1736874409, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(卧槽)"}
{"time": 1736874412, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(这么高)"}
{"time": 1736874467, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "也许是之前在宫中见得多了，这次离开了些许时日，圣娅贴近自己14岁弟弟时，才发现自己的弟弟已经如此高大了"}
{"time": 1736874532, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "这在兽人种族的14岁还算是正常现象，有的熊兽人在15到16岁成年时能长到2米5以上"}
{"time": 1736874563, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "而作为皇族血脉加上各种食物药材滋补和科学的锻炼"}
{"time": 1736874573, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(有点高)"}
{"time": 1736874576, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "弟弟近两年的身高层层猛涨"}
{"time": 1736874600, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "不过马上就要成年的弟弟身高也不会有太大变化了。"}
{"time": 1736874616, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "看着安德斯的身高，对比一下自己感觉差得有些多了"}
{"time": 1736874620, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(我好像就1m6)"}
{"time": 1736874643, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "圣娅这才发现为什么弟弟抓住2米多高白狼的领子的安德斯的动作没有违和感"}
{"time": 1736874715, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "安德斯看到自己带着些许病态脸庞的姐姐，马上九放下了白狼的领子，并询问起姐姐的身体状况。"}
{"time": 1736874764, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "翻了个白眼，\"不第一时间来看我，安德斯，你小子，我这些年真是白疼你了。\""}
{"time": 1736874773, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "（他之前12岁1m45就能穿重甲拿大剑）"}
{"time": 1736874782, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "扶着薇娅站稳身形"}
{"time": 1736874786, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "（现在14岁1m94，有点恐怖了）"}
{"time": 1736874806, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "（不过放在魔法世界的皇家，也正常）"}
{"time": 1736874850, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(还真是)"}
{"time": 1736874918, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“…窝这不是看到姐姐册封的骑士，想替姐姐把把关嘛…啊哈哈”\n安德斯有些尴尬的岔开话题。"}
{"time": 1736875001, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"把关?\"伸手纠住他的领子，\"不要回避我的问题!\""}
{"time": 1736875063, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“圣娅小姐，关于这件事我也有错，我也是有些手痒一时间就同意了要求。”\n白狼整理好衣领就插话进来。"}
{"time": 1736875166, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"...白狼，不要替这小子说话。\""}
{"time": 1736875207, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"我看你是几天不打上房揭瓦了，安德斯。想跟你姐过两招?\""}
{"time": 1736875350, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“唉唉唉，boss你身体还没好呢，等好了在打也不迟。”\n伊芙也不知道是劝架还是拱火。"}
{"time": 1736875410, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“唉…我知道错了圣娅姐，我只是…听到你遇到危险，感觉自己有些无能为力…”"}
{"time": 1736875435, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“我也想成为圣娅姐的骑士保护你啊！”"}
{"time": 1736875444, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"只是剑术的话。\"看起来确实生气了，正准备当场找到训练木刀，但听到这句话又停了下来，\"...\""}
{"time": 1736875607, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"安德斯，你是王族，并不是骑士。\"收回自己的手，\"...\""}
{"time": 1736875625, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“我也要…成为圣娅姐的骑士！”\n薇娅也攥起小拳头。"}
{"time": 1736875718, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“王族…王族就不行吗？那圣娅姐下次遇到危险怎么办？”"}
{"time": 1736875809, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"没事的。\"安抚薇娅，\"你们圣娅姐相当厉害，这次只是意外啦。\"瞪了一眼安德斯，\"王族，要学治国理政，不要一天到晚想着骑士。\""}
{"time": 1736876210, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“…知道了，话说圣娅姐身体什么时候能好？希望能快点好起来。”"}
{"time": 1736876236, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"医生说要两周...\""}
{"time": 1736876251, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"嗯..这段时间就看看书吧。\""}
{"time": 1736876384, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "一行人也算经过了这件事，白狼和伊芙以及后来送圣娅回房间路上遇到的梅妮，都算是认识了圣娅的弟弟和妹妹。"}
{"time": 1736876505, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "白狼在事后也莫名其妙的和安德斯关系好起来了？圣娅能经常看到安德斯和白狼在演武场打交，那打的叫一个狠，但是一问起来二人就笑着说我俩只是关系友好地切磋，如果忽视两人打的破破烂烂的衣服的话。"}
{"time": 1736876544, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"...\"只能皱着眉，然后提着剑亲自修理两人"}
{"time": 1736876574, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "不过这都是后话了，在第二天，伊芙就带着梅妮缠着圣娅学习魔法。"}
{"time": 1736876601, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "梅妮：“为什么要把我也拉来，我没什么天赋的啊…”"}
{"time": 1736876607, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "。log off"}
{"time": 1738082422, "type": "reply", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": 2875548981, "name": "小雅"}, "message": "继续记录乐谱"}
{"time": 1738082453, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "那么上回解决了安德斯和白狼的小矛盾之后"}
{"time": 1738082484, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "第二天一大早，圣娅房间的门就哐的一声打开"}
{"time": 1738082498, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "本来睡得好好的，惊醒"}
{"time": 1738082512, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "睁开睡眼惺忪的眼睑，\"嗯...什么？\""}
{"time": 1738082517, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "是伊芙，以及被拉着手臂拖进来的梅妮"}
{"time": 1738082541, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“牢大，是时候表演真正的魔法教学了”"}
{"time": 1738082562, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“教我还有梅妮魔法。”"}
{"time": 1738082588, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"魔法教学?\"放下头闭上眼继续睡一会，\"让我睡一会吧...\""}
{"time": 1738082588, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "梅妮：“为什么要把我也拉来，我没什么天赋的啊…”"}
{"time": 1738082649, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“不早了，已经到饭点了，该起来吃饭了。”"}
{"time": 1738082679, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"诶诶?再睡一会吧...没人叫我起床的...\""}
{"time": 1738082685, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "说着伊芙就一套很熟练的流程把圣娅拖起来换衣服"}
{"time": 1738082771, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "圣娅注意到梅妮和伊芙的身上并不是昨天的女仆装"}
{"time": 1738082775, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "不情愿地起床换掉睡衣，\"诶?上午是休息时间啦。\"点着头，\"女仆都没有喊我起来吧\""}
{"time": 1738082794, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "而是之前学习时穿的魔法学院校服"}
{"time": 1738082830, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "虽然圣娅没去学校上学而是在皇宫里开课的，但是这衣服圣娅和薇娅也有一套"}
{"time": 1738082877, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"诶...比起我还有更合适的老师吧？\""}
{"time": 1738082887, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"还是说，我们要去学院一起上课了？\""}
{"time": 1738082955, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“啊，这个是伊芙小姐说什么要有仪式感，所以找出来穿的。”"}
{"time": 1738082985, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "梅妮略有些脸红的说到"}
{"time": 1738083002, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"净做些多余的。\"翻个白眼，\"我可不是老师诶。\"伸手摸摸梅妮脑袋"}
{"time": 1738083004, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "似乎她因为从来没穿过这么高档的服饰有些害羞"}
{"time": 1738083046, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"什么安排啦?伊芙?\""}
{"time": 1738083062, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "翻出自己的校服，\"一起去学院?\""}
{"time": 1738083097, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "皇家魔法学院的校服价格昂贵，但可不是只在表面上下功夫，它有着较强的防火和耐脏功能，且材料坚韧不容易划破。"}
{"time": 1738083361, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "女性校服上部是毛衣打底衫，外层是黑色的西装风格套装，搭配略过膝的深绿色百褶裙，在西装右胸处有学院的标识文章。外层有一层带帽法袍，其袖口根据年级分为不同颜色和不同装饰。"}
{"time": 1738083362, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"虽然我也没去过就是了。\"小声"}
{"time": 1738083410, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "这衣服圣娅就试穿了一次就放进她200平米的试衣间吃灰了，因为防护性能其实也就那样。"}
{"time": 1738083456, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“唉唉，boss你没去过学校吗，那为什么魔法这么厉害啊？”"}
{"time": 1738083508, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“我听梅妮说你能放出铺天盖地的元素，并且还会瞬移，是很帅的瞬移啊！”"}
{"time": 1738083515, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"因为我，过目不忘哦?什么魔法只要看一眼就能学会。\"换上这一身衣服，\"那就一起去学校吧，我也是第一次去。\""}
{"time": 1738083545, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "带着她们出门，跟宫里通报一声去学院"}
{"time": 1738083625, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“在此之前先吃早饭吧，我还没吃过皇家早餐呢！”"}
{"time": 1738083668, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"不尝尝学院的早餐吗？听说也挺有意思的。\""}
{"time": 1738083718, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“确实也可以，以后有的是机会吃皇家早餐，毕竟我老大是boss你嘛！”"}
{"time": 1738083761, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "打个响指，点点头，登上去学院的马车"}
{"time": 1738083771, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"走吧，待会跟紧我哦?\""}
{"time": 1738083820, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "皇家魔法学院，顾名思义，其实也算是皇宫的一部分"}
{"time": 1738083861, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "因为皇家图书馆位于皇宫的西部地区，图书馆与学院相连接。"}
{"time": 1738083873, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "到了近处下车，不想惊扰到普通学生。"}
{"time": 1738083878, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "步行进学院"}
{"time": 1738083898, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "因此圣娅其实只需要经过图书馆和学院的连接处就可以进入学校了"}
{"time": 1738083970, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "步行进学院喵"}
{"time": 1738083973, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "一行三人在图书馆外的一条石板路上下了车"}
{"time": 1738083987, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "沿着连廊进入学院内部"}
{"time": 1738084028, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "由于已经到了学期末，学校里并没有很多闲逛的学生"}
{"time": 1738084083, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "也没有必要遮掩自己的行踪，看一眼地图，径直去学院的食堂吃早餐"}
{"time": 1738084198, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "皇家魔法学院大体分为四个部分：\n实战的魔法演习场和竞技场\n皇家图书馆\n以及一个巨大的环形教学楼\n还有其他的如食堂宿舍等生活区域"}
{"time": 1738084229, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "介绍一下学院，但其实自己也没来过，jpg"}
{"time": 1738084248, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "（不是哥们，你动作这么快干什么）"}
{"time": 1738084261, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "（我打字已经极限速度了）"}
{"time": 1738084283, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "（你编两句也行）"}
{"time": 1738084321, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(我草)"}
{"time": 1738084326, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(因为我火力全开)"}
{"time": 1738084367, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"这边是教学区，现在去的地方是生活区。\"根据自己看过一遍的印象介绍一下"}
{"time": 1738084583, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "学院的教学楼是环形的，每一层中间都是隔开的，由白色圆柱和外部的旋转楼梯连接，圆柱中间是空的，接入了重力魔法的法阵可以自由浮空上下。\n教学楼的每一层都根据用途分为了不同颜色，主要分为元素、炼金、法阵、变化、预知等等"}
{"time": 1738084657, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "其实也有很多课室由于人数太少和其他层合并在一起，这只是大体上的分类。"}
{"time": 1738084676, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "圣娅回想起只看过一遍的学校手册的话"}
{"time": 1738084681, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "介绍一下旋梯的用法，然后带她们去食堂，\"这边的早餐还挺有意思，不过这会已经学期末了，学生应该不怎么多。\""}
{"time": 1738084788, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“那个boss，这种魔法学院，是不是会有那种什么魔力测试的剧情…偶不，魔力测试天赋测试的地方吗？”"}
{"time": 1738084805, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"嗯...如果是开学的时候，应该会有吧。\""}
{"time": 1738084820, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "思考一下，对着路上遇见的学生点点头，继续走。"}
{"time": 1738084822, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "打了饭后众人在食堂角落找了个地方坐下，一边吃伊芙一边问到"}
{"time": 1738084907, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"来得不够巧，现在的话应该是没有了。\""}
{"time": 1738084937, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(感觉要被拉去睡了)"}
{"time": 1738084989, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "打几份学院特色菜，\"嗯...尝一尝吧。\"虽然自己也是第一次吃，\"听说风评还不错呢。\""}
{"time": 1738085017, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“那boss没有什么渠道可以找人测试吗？”"}
{"time": 1738085044, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"那还是很简单的。\"吃完饭带着她们去校长室"}
{"time": 1738085049, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“说不定梅妮就有什么隐藏天赋呢！”\n伊芙一把搂住梅妮"}
{"time": 1738085084, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"怎么说我也是一国公主嘛。\"敲敲门，\"梅妮肯定是占星术，预言法的天才啦。\"点头"}
{"time": 1738085108, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“唉唉…我只是个普通人，没有什么魔法天赋的，我只会观星的一些小法术的…”\n梅妮连连摆手"}
