{"time": 1738085185, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"观星的天赋就是你的才能，预言，星象息息相关，不能妄自菲薄哦?梅妮。\"摸摸头。"}
{"time": 1738085192, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(床位不够)"}
