{"time": 1738781439, "type": "reply", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": 2875548981, "name": "小雅"}, "message": "[流萤]演奏出: 1D6=2"}
{"time": 1738781448, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(什么超古代科技)"}
{"time": 1738781460, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"引力...星空?\""}
{"time": 1738781505, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "（怪不得梅妮r出来这么高的）"}
{"time": 1738781517, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "佯装疑惑，\"有什么联系吗？\"同时开启心灵能力，尝试读一下黑塔玩偶的思考"}
{"time": 1738781603, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "读取不到结果，灵魂视野显示黑塔人偶无灵魂之火"}
{"time": 1738781634, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "看向黑塔人偶，\"嗯...?女士的看法呢？\""}
{"time": 1738781704, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“我研究了好几天只知道是跟大概星空有关的东西。”"}
{"time": 1738781740, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“毕竟上面画了星空图，但是和我们的星空对比却不一样”"}
{"time": 1738781756, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“怎么，你看出来什么东西了吗？”"}
{"time": 1738781786, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "黑塔女士站起来带着迫切的目光看向圣娅"}
{"time": 1738781792, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"嗯....似乎是说星体之间互相有吸引力。\""}
{"time": 1738781832, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"它们之间的吸引共同构成了天体的运行，也就是我们头顶的这片星空的成因...\""}
{"time": 1738781890, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“好了好了，不用说了，我大概知道了让我自己研究。”"}
{"time": 1738781933, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"诶?\""}
{"time": 1738781936, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“既然你们几个小家伙帮我大概解决了一下这件事，那我带你们过去测试吧”"}
{"time": 1738781965, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"嗯...\"站起身，提问，\"黑塔女士，本人在哪里呢？"}
{"time": 1738782023, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "黑塔女士合上书籍，从桌子下面拿出了一柄钥匙形状的法杖。"}
{"time": 1738782063, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“你问这个干什么？这是秘密哦。”"}
{"time": 1738782094, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"诶?会很好奇吧，这种事情。\"戳戳自己的脸颊，看着她的动作"}
{"time": 1738782196, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "黑塔女士的法杖顶端稍稍亮起，然后迅速沉寂下去。"}
{"time": 1738782208, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "圣娅能感觉到这是侦测类的法术。"}
{"time": 1738782228, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"侦测?\""}
{"time": 1738782235, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"女士在干什么?\""}
{"time": 1738782264, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“用了跟你的那位同伴差不多的技术，这样回答你满意了吗？刨根问底的小家伙？”"}
{"time": 1738782295, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“好了好了，我们去测试吧，你看看你的同伴都等不及了。”"}
{"time": 1738782364, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "黑塔女士的法杖划过空中，魔力灵光形成了一道法杖，开启了一个长方形的传送门"}
{"time": 1738782407, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "圣娅回头看到眼里发光一脸期待催促圣娅眼神的伊芙"}
{"time": 1738782420, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"诶诶，可是提问才是更重要的嘛。这不是女士自己说的。\"带着伊芙和梅妮走进传送门"}
{"time": 1738782454, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"可不要弄出太大动静哦，测试的时候。\"叮嘱一下伊芙，对梅妮倒是不怎么担心。"}
{"time": 1738782551, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "众人先是来到了一处房间，这里由于是期末的原因，没有人在此。"}
{"time": 1738782588, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "黑塔女士法杖轻戳地面，随即房间里就亮起了灯"}
{"time": 1738782625, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "出现在众人眼前的是各个蒙着红布的仪器。"}
{"time": 1738782640, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "站在黑塔旁边，示意梅妮先上前测试"}
{"time": 1738782663, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "黑塔女士打了个响指，各个布都依次落下，露出了这些价值不菲的仪器。"}
{"time": 1738782747, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"伊芙的话，动静有些大。\"拉住伊芙，跟黑塔耳语，\"女士要做好心理准备\""}
{"time": 1738782796, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“根据最近几百年的改进，这批最新的仪器可以从个人魔力的质量与存量，以及魔力传导速度和亲和力等等方面测试新生的魔力天赋”"}
{"time": 1738782814, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "黑塔女士粗略介绍了一下这些仪器。"}
{"time": 1738782874, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"唉，我就不用再做了。\"叹口气，\"我的魔力量真的不算充裕呢...\""}
{"time": 1738782887, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“一般刚入学的新生都是只测试魔力属性和存量的，不过看在天才小公主的面子上，都测一遍吧”"}
{"time": 1738783011, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "梅妮先上前测试"}
{"time": 1738783021, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"所以说这个名号是怎么回事啦。\""}
{"time": 1738783072, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=-32055363][CQ:at,qq=1252219916] “不要担心，魔力存量是会根据年龄逐渐增长的，而且只要魔力利用率够高，存量少也够用了。”黑塔女士拍了拍圣娅的肩膀"}
{"time": 1738783098, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "梅妮的什么魔法元素亲和力更高？\n1火\n2水\n3风\n4地\n5雷\n6光\n7暗\n8大成功"}
{"time": 1738783129, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "（你r）"}
{"time": 1738783161, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "梅妮显然之前没做过这种测试，有些忐忑不安，又有些期待"}
{"time": 1738783165, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "。rd8"}
{"time": 1738783165, "type": "reply", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": 2875548981, "name": "小雅"}, "message": "[流萤]演奏出: 1D8=2"}
{"time": 1738783219, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"嗯...话是这么说啦。可是这次透支魔力好严重，这下好久都不能出门了。\""}
{"time": 1738783577, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“怎么样？我天赋是什么？”\n梅妮扭头看了看圣娅，又意识到这里其实黑塔女士才是专业的，又转头看黑塔女士"}
{"time": 1738783733, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"嗯...看上去是水元素亲和。\""}
{"time": 1738783742, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "也跟着看向黑塔"}
{"time": 1738783830, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“水元素吗，很适合女孩子的元素呢，比较全面但也没什么突出特点的元素。”"}
{"time": 1738783861, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "梅妮听到之后开心的笑了笑"}
{"time": 1738783876, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "伊芙上来和梅妮击掌庆祝。"}
{"time": 1738783915, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“先一口气把这位梅妮小姐测完吧”"}
{"time": 1738783923, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "黑塔带梅妮去下一个仪器"}
{"time": 1738783927, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"嗯，梅妮继续吧。\""}
{"time": 1738783952, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "跟在梅妮身后"}
{"time": 1738784013, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "这是个测量魔力量的仪器，把手放到水晶球上，用自己尽可能最大的魔力输出速度输出魔力，就能在后台得到数据。"}
{"time": 1738784047, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "那么梅妮的魔力存量是？\n50＋rd100"}
{"time": 1738784055, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "。rd100+50"}
{"time": 1738784055, "type": "reply", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": 2875548981, "name": "小雅"}, "message": "[流萤]演奏出: 1D100+50={68}+50=118"}
{"time": 1738784067, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(好像比圣娅高啊)"}
{"time": 1738784200, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "圣娅107"}
{"time": 1738784206, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "（嘻嘻）"}
{"time": 1738784211, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(低完了)"}
{"time": 1738784259, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“嗯嗯，魔力存量也算是同龄人中较好的了。”"}
{"time": 1738784326, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"嗯，梅妮的魔力量比我丰富哦。\""}
{"time": 1738784338, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "黑塔女士说完，又带着有了些许自信的梅妮前往下一台仪器"}
{"time": 1738784386, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=471886913][CQ:at,qq=1252219916] “但是圣娅小姐的实战真的太厉害了，我…我估计是做不到圣娅小姐那样了…”"}
{"time": 1738784518, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"嘛，每个人都有自己擅长和不擅长法事情嘛\"安慰她，\"梅妮的魔法更适合和星星同辉。\""}
{"time": 1738784721, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "接下来几个测试是根据魔力的控制力、魔力的纯度、以及恢复速度等方面，来得出测试者最佳的魔法发展方向，那么梅妮的方向是？\n1咒法化形系\n2塑能转换系\n3塑形重构系\n4生理变化系\n5恢复疗愈系\n6传心感知系\n7\n"}
