{"time": 1738786384, "type": "reply", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": 2875548981, "name": "小雅"}, "message": "[cn10]演奏出: 1D2=2"}
{"time": 1738786460, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“得出的结果是没有推荐方向呢…嗯，那说明你前途无量，每个都可以试试。”"}
{"time": 1738786481, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "黑塔女士露出了一秒憋笑的表情。"}
{"time": 1738786530, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“话说回来，这个最后一项的测试系统是近几年才有的。我们的天才小公主还没用过吧，要不要试试？”"}
{"time": 1738786535, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"没事啦，伊芙什么系的魔法都可以尝试一下。\""}
{"time": 1738786545, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"嗯...我也要试试吗？\""}
{"time": 1738786559, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "走上前，\"那我就试试吧。\""}
{"time": 1738786572, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "。rd7"}
{"time": 1738786572, "type": "reply", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": 2875548981, "name": "小雅"}, "message": "[流萤]演奏出: 1D7=5"}
{"time": 1738786847, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“看不出来，原来天才小公主还有治疗这天赋？”"}
{"time": 1738786910, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "其实圣娅看出，这机器只是从各个魔力性质来综合检测得到结果，只要改变过程中的一些变量，就能得到不同结果"}
{"time": 1738786947, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"嗯..治愈系的魔法我也没有系统学习过，或许之后可以考虑。\"伸手调整自己的魔力流更改测试结果"}
{"time": 1738786970, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "对于刚接触魔法的初学者，是做不到这样随意改变自己魔力性质以及输出方式的，所以结果对于新手更准确"}
{"time": 1738786987, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"不过这个机器，真的准吗？随便改一下投入的魔力流，结果就不一样了。\"一边吐槽一边看向黑塔"}
{"time": 1738787071, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“你也不看看你学了几年魔法了，她们俩可都是初学者，只会以最本能的方式来释放魔力，所以检测还是有一定准确性的。”"}
{"time": 1738787118, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“好了，魔法天赋测试就到这里，要我送送你们吗？”"}
{"time": 1738787204, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"麻烦黑塔女士了，直接送我们到教室吧。\""}
{"time": 1738787325, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "黑塔开传送门把你们送到教室外面的走廊上，自己随即回去研究了。"}
{"time": 1738787329, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "。log off"}
{"time": 1739291126, "type": "reply", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": 2875548981, "name": "小雅"}, "message": "继续记录乐谱"}
{"time": 1739291132, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "（怎么说开吗）"}
{"time": 1739291149, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "可以"}
{"time": 1739291175, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "（你猜猜deepseek给我写了什么）"}
{"time": 1739291183, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "（他给我编了个大的）"}
{"time": 1739291204, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "（我联想一下就能加进来"}
{"time": 1739291253, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "一行三人来到了教室外，由于是学期末，没多少教室在开课了"}
{"time": 1739291292, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "到是有部分理论课教室有人，伊芙踮脚探头从走廊的窗户外望去，发现是在考试。"}
{"time": 1739291347, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“话说boss，刚才你问校长的那个问题，校长说跟我一样是什么意思啊？”\n伊芙小声说"}
{"time": 1739291447, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(我在过隧道，转圈)"}
{"time": 1739291452, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(这么变态)"}
{"time": 1739291477, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "（我说你怎么卡了）"}
{"time": 1739291488, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(哪里的跟我一样，我怎么没印象了)"}
{"time": 1739291523, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "[CQ:json,data={\"app\":\"com.tencent.multimsg\"&#44;\"config\":{\"autosize\":1&#44;\"forward\":1&#44;\"round\":1&#44;\"type\":\"normal\"&#44;\"width\":300}&#44;\"desc\":\"&#91;聊天记录&#93;\"&#44;\"extra\":\"{\\\"filename\\\":\\\"d4987541-15c6-4166-b6db-5928983658f3\\\"&#44;\\\"tsum\\\":9}\\n\"&#44;\"meta\":{\"detail\":{\"news\":&#91;{\"text\":\"千成之愿: \\\"嗯...\\\"站起身，提问，\\\"黑塔女士，本人在哪里呢？\"}&#44;{\"text\":\"我叫五个五: 黑塔女士合上书籍，从桌子下面拿出了一柄钥匙形状的法杖。\"}&#44;{\"text\":\"我叫五个五: “你问这个干什么？这是秘密哦。”\"}&#44;{\"text\":\"千成之愿: \\\"诶?会很好奇吧，这种事情。\\\"戳戳自己的脸颊，看着她的动作\"}&#93;&#44;\"resid\":\"9DJzEzc5zMX3S+d43ciSyv1io3pffmiiterxU/cjvZoQGUL8yy7FBHXnwshd2DEI\"&#44;\"source\":\"群聊的聊天记录\"&#44;\"summary\":\"查看9条转发消息\"&#44;\"uniseq\":\"d4987541-15c6-4166-b6db-5928983658f3\"}}&#44;\"prompt\":\"&#91;聊天记录&#93;\"&#44;\"ver\":\"0.0.0.5\"&#44;\"view\":\"contact\"}\n]"}
{"time": 1739291589, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"嗯...其实我也没怎么听懂，黑塔女士毕竟是真正的天才。\"走过走廊，\"我们也找间教室吧\""}
{"time": 1739291740, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "你们随机找了少人的教室进去"}
{"time": 1739291768, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "不一会儿就有老师进来，开始布置期末的课题"}
{"time": 1739291796, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"嗯...似乎不太赶巧。\"看了一眼老师，比了个不用在意的手势，\"你们要试试题目吗？\""}
{"time": 1739291830, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "圣娅发现这是什么教室？\n1元素\n2炼金\n3预知\n4法阵\n5变化\n6"}
{"time": 1739291876, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "。rd6"}
{"time": 1739291876, "type": "reply", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": 2875548981, "name": "小雅"}, "message": "[流萤]演奏出: 1D6=4"}
{"time": 1739291981, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "圣娅看出这是法阵学的课室，令人出乎意料的是这位老师是20多岁的年轻棕发女性"}
{"time": 1739292016, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "一般来说这种跟数学有强关联的课题都是年纪大的男性老师"}
{"time": 1739292032, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"嗯..这么年轻嘛...\"自言自语，等她继续"}
{"time": 1739292129, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "她并没有对学生们进行传统的文字考试，而是布置了让同学回去研究一个法阵并写出法阵的运行方式作用，强调让学生们写出自己的理解。"}
{"time": 1739292158, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“有什么问题，现在可以问我。”"}
{"time": 1739292178, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "年轻的老师在黑板上写完一个大体例子之后如是说"}
{"time": 1739292201, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "现下倒是没有在研究的法阵，饶有兴趣地在最后打量"}
{"time": 1739292278, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "在同学们提完各自的问题后，老师就宣布下课了"}
{"time": 1739292292, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "这份作业的截止日期是一个月"}
{"time": 1739292335, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“boss，我们能不能不参与作业啊，我连这是什么东西都不知道。”\n伊芙凑过来小声说"}
{"time": 1739292359, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "很快教室里就剩下你们三位和这位年轻的女老师"}
{"time": 1739292404, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"嗯...期末的课程确实不太容易跟上。放假的时候记得补上这些课程，我会教你的。\"带着一行人上前，同时询问\"梅妮呢？有什么想法吗\""}
{"time": 1739292499, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“可是boss我也没见你上学啊，你之前不还是在皇宫里呆着？”"}
{"time": 1739292540, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“我没问题，我们观星的时候也会用到法阵的，之前在山顶的那个就是师傅留下来的。”"}
{"time": 1739292563, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“那个法阵的具体原理我也没有完全清楚，可以研究一下。”"}
{"time": 1739292579, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "梅妮回应圣娅"}
{"time": 1739292586, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1687902825][CQ:at,qq=2388921818] 伊芙吐槽到"}
{"time": 1739292597, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"嗯，我会辅助你的。\"回头弹一弹伊芙的额头，\"本公主可是天才。\""}
{"time": 1739292613, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "这时，女老师走到你们座位前"}
{"time": 1739292628, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“你们三个，我没有在课上见过呢”"}
{"time": 1739292647, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "站起来牵起裙摆微微颔首，\"初次见面，我们是路过的旁听生\""}
{"time": 1739292664, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"这节课麻烦教授了。\""}
{"time": 1739292679, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“哦，竟然对法阵学感兴趣吗！”"}
{"time": 1739292689, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "女老师眼睛明显一亮"}
{"time": 1739292753, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“那你们下个学期要不要报名这门课？”"}
{"time": 1739292850, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"好啊，我对法阵也只是有一些想法。\"(指多重奏饱和炮击的法阵)"}
{"time": 1739292901, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“对了，忘了自我介绍了，我是艾莉森·玛格丽特，你们叫我艾莉森老师就行。”"}
{"time": 1739292940, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“boss，你看看…能不能不上…”\n伊芙还在拉着圣娅的伊芙后摆小声说"}
{"time": 1739293066, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"不是你自己要学魔法的吗？\"秀眉挑起，回头瞪着伊芙"}
{"time": 1739293102, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“能不能换个简单的？这个一看就很难。”"}
{"time": 1739293153, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "伊芙看了看黑板，那复杂缭乱的法阵加上文字说明，已经让伊芙眼睛里的光一闪一闪了"}
{"time": 1739293264, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“这位同学，其实法阵明白原理之后很简单，就相当于一架马车，把它拆开之后有轮子、车轴等等部件，这些部件功能各不相同，组合到一起调整好互相之间的联系作用，就能发挥出1+1＞2的效果。”"}
{"time": 1739293309, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“可以从简单的法阵入手开始学习哦。如果需要入门书籍，可以去图书馆找这些。”"}
{"time": 1739293316, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"嗯...没有那么容易的哦。\"看着法阵，抬起手，在空中浮现出一圈圈缠绕在一起的繁复法阵，\"不过，很漂亮吧？\""}
{"time": 1739293395, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "艾莉森老师不知道从哪里掏出来一张写了各个名字的纸，而且圣娅发现这些纸不止一张，有很多印有同样内容的，看来艾莉森老师蓄谋已久，终于逮到了这次拉新学生的机会"}
{"time": 1739293471, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "伊芙并不想接过纸，于是梅妮就帮伊芙接过。\n随后艾莉森老师看到圣娅的法阵，也露出了高兴的神情。"}
{"time": 1739293559, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“嗯，不错的法阵，运行起来能放大魔力的输出吧，用的时候需要小心，同时你还可以调整一下这些…（省略）来增强效果。”"}
{"time": 1739293615, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "（我这个打字速度，如何？）"}
{"time": 1739293621, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"嗯嗯。\"听从艾莉森老师的建议调整一些法阵，随后在纸上签上自己的名字，\"伊芙的话，我也代签了哦\""}
{"time": 1739293626, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(你是真的快)"}
{"time": 1739293660, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "（等一下我切换一下阵地）"}
{"time": 1739293664, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "（我上床上去"}
{"time": 1739293916, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "伊芙已经倒在桌子上做灰白状了"}
{"time": 1739294010, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“不要担心这位同学，介于你们才来听我的课，你们上交的作业不用研究特别复杂的法阵，而且只要写出自己的理解，我都会酌情给分的。”"}
{"time": 1739294029, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "艾莉森走过来笑着摸了摸伊芙的白色头发"}
{"time": 1739294061, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"嗯，不过下次来参加应该是明年开学呢。\""}
{"time": 1739294083, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"这段时间我会补习她的魔术水平到正常的。\""}
{"time": 1739294177, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "（怎么你跟你开这个，我就首页刷到银色虞姬）"}
{"time": 1739294204, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "（银色虞姬打一个忍者的时间木叶的秋都穿三了）"}
{"time": 1739294246, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“那么只能面对了！boss我们现在就去图书馆找这些书吧！”"}
{"time": 1739294270, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "伊芙被摸摸之后突然振奋起来，眼睛里似乎都冒火了。"}
{"time": 1739294292, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(那确实打单最慢)"}
{"time": 1739294306, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"好啊，那你先去吧。\""}
{"time": 1739294325, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"我还打算带着梅妮再转一转\""}
{"time": 1739294405, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "（我靠，带土虚化的时候只有第4A丢手里剑那一下可以打到，这做的也太还原了吧）"}
{"time": 1739294436, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“我不认识路啊，也不认识字，boss带带我啊。”"}
{"time": 1739294548, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"那你还这么有干劲。\"从桌子上起身，\"教授，我们先走了?\""}
{"time": 1739294596, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“嗯，回去好好学习，你们肯定会对振阵法学感兴趣的。”"}
{"time": 1739294617, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "教授挥手跟你们道别。"}
{"time": 1739294730, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "离开教室，\"虽然我很少在外面露面，但知名度是不是太低了。\"路上小声吐槽，前往操场看看"}
{"time": 1739294769, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“不对吧，我看校长不就认识boss，还叫boss天才小公主。”"}
{"time": 1739294921, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"呃，毕竟校长是天才嘛。\"干巴巴地接上话，\"看看操场吧，这里应该还有竞技场之类的地方\""}
