{"time": 1753792353, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1035784968", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "（其实我想说你老爹也出差了，但是想一想好像不对）"}
{"time": 1753792394, "type": "recv", "message_id": "961907856", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "“混账老爹，昨天也不来看看我。”皱着眉，咬着嘴唇在想自己的味觉的事情"}
{"time": 1753792428, "type": "recv", "message_id": "136833407", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "那么你在神社后的杂物间找到了老爹，他似乎准备取出工具打扫一下卫生。"}
{"time": 1753792603, "type": "recv", "message_id": "481438115", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "瞪着眼睛朝他走过去"}
{"time": 1753792668, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1801307687", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“早上好，怎么今天起的这么早？昨天晚上和同学玩的开心吗？”"}
{"time": 1753792684, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1750148524", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "昨天的事情加上找了半天，导致心情现在极差，抿着嘴唇走上前，\"和同学玩?\""}
{"time": 1753792708, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2032662913", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"混账老爹，昨天连我什么时候回来的都不知道?你去干嘛了？\""}
{"time": 1753792765, "type": "recv", "message_id": "539007594", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "带着黑框眼镜，穿着传统和服的即是你的父亲"}
{"time": 1753792815, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1466418482", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“昨天上学之前不是你说晚上要出去和同学一起玩吗，叫我给你留门就行。”"}
{"time": 1753792874, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1991302035", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"...\"听到这话顿时很委屈，\"那你就不能多注意一下...注意一下吗？\"低下头，\"绘梨花差点回不来了\""}
{"time": 1753792966, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1208071160", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“怎么了，遇到什么事了吗？”"}
{"time": 1753792982, "type": "recv", "message_id": "944916268", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "你的父亲上前摸了摸你的头"}
{"time": 1753793090, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1719217050", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"在学校旧校舍遇到了幽灵。\"昨晚回来也没有洗澡加上今天一起床就来找老爹，额头还有些黏黏的，\"它..它可以替代我！要不是...\"捧起脖子上挂着的御守，\"绘梨花就....\""}
{"time": 1753793135, "type": "recv", "message_id": "645079153", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“没事，没事，现在在家里有天照大神保佑，慢慢说。”"}
{"time": 1753793157, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1329125719", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "你详细把事情经过告诉了你的父亲。"}
{"time": 1753793269, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1636927352", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“结果你不是去和同学玩，只是去后山旧校舍找幽灵了？”"}
{"time": 1753793370, "type": "recv", "message_id": "412120566", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "眨眨眼，低下头吞了口口水，说话声音都变小声了很多，\"嗯...\""}
{"time": 1753793389, "type": "recv", "message_id": "79148908", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“下次不要做这种危险的事了啊，起码要多做些准备…”"}
{"time": 1753793432, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1552273296", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"但是...但是，绘梨花现在没有味觉了。\"犹豫了一下还是开口"}
{"time": 1753793433, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1929328279", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“我和你母亲，小时候也曾经遇到过幽灵之类的事件。不过倒是没遇到过这种类型的…镜子鬼？”"}
{"time": 1753793468, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1283433108", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"我也不知道是什么...但是它可以代替我...把我困在镜子里，好恐怖...很吓人\""}
{"time": 1753793794, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1215872687", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“总之你先去进行一下参拜除灵的仪式。我打电话给你妈叫你妈提前回来看看。”"}
{"time": 1753793810, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1907169555", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“今天就先请假不去学校了吧。”"}
{"time": 1753793820, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1563246716", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“对了，早饭想吃什么？”"}
{"time": 1753793975, "type": "recv", "message_id": "240743227", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"...吃不出味道啦。\"沉默了一会才说话"}
{"time": 1753794000, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1247456951", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“吃不出味道又是什么意思？”"}
{"time": 1753794014, "type": "recv", "message_id": "517497526", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "不想解释太多，\"我要打电话，我想妈妈了。\""}
{"time": 1753794024, "type": "recv", "message_id": "379436114", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(有一说一，其实背景还有个妹妹)"}
{"time": 1753794039, "type": "recv", "message_id": "398729695", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(但是好像也没所谓)"}
{"time": 1753794059, "type": "recv", "message_id": "209195888", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "（妹妹跟妈妈一起出差去了）"}
{"time": 1753794111, "type": "recv", "message_id": "780862692", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "拿出手机拨号，\"绘梨花不知道跟什么东西做了交易...现在已经没有味觉了。\""}
{"time": 1753794133, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1025316860", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"...\"说完就沉默地等电话拨通"}
{"time": 1753794147, "type": "recv", "message_id": "627520811", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "（不是你每次这么自称我都感觉好出戏）"}
{"time": 1753794197, "type": "recv", "message_id": "18458053", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(体现关系亲密年纪不大吧这样是)"}
{"time": 1753794404, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1012641041", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "不久后电话就拨通了，你简略描述了一下你的情况后，你妈说下午就带着你妹妹回来。"}
{"time": 1753794448, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1808577335", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"妈...\"话语里全是不安，\"我是不是做了不好的事情...\""}
{"time": 1753794513, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1530896005", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "听到母亲的声音强忍着眼泪，\"差点回不来...唔..\""}
{"time": 1753794533, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1314201708", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“没有，这都不是事，不要害怕小绘梨花。对了下午可能有我的一个老同学要来，如果那时候我还没回来你和你爸提前招待一下。”"}
{"time": 1753794640, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2012166398", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"怎么这么淡定啦...\"忍不住吐槽，再接过话，\"谁?\""}
{"time": 1753794699, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1498621592", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“能解决你身上问题的人。”"}
{"time": 1753794722, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1488342184", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“收拾一下衣服吧。”"}
{"time": 1753794742, "type": "recv", "message_id": "21858254", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "你母亲好像在对你的妹妹说收拾行李的事"}
{"time": 1753794746, "type": "recv", "message_id": "88071162", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "然后电话就挂断了。"}
{"time": 1753794754, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1367082560", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "（你妹妹叫啥名）"}
{"time": 1753794770, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1586311255", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "（洗个澡）"}
{"time": 1753794816, "type": "recv", "message_id": "242564913", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(绘梨衣?)"}
{"time": 1753795170, "type": "recv", "message_id": "685440335", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "（你是真逆天）"}
{"time": 1753795255, "type": "recv", "message_id": "522231572", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(哈哈哈)"}
{"time": 1753795266, "type": "recv", "message_id": "265540586", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "（那我问你你怎么不是红头发）"}
{"time": 1753795380, "type": "recv", "message_id": "753088862", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(下意识想到的)"}
{"time": 1753795597, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1912290210", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "按掉手机，\"老爹，我去洗澡了。\""}
{"time": 1753796066, "type": "recv", "message_id": "71531019", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "（你也去洗澡是吧）"}
{"time": 1753796099, "type": "recv", "message_id": "687542432", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "（对的，毕竟昨晚没洗）"}
{"time": 1753796467, "type": "recv", "message_id": "703016213", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "那么洗完澡回到客厅，你爸正好在端菜上桌。"}
{"time": 1753796548, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2143940086", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "换上了神社用的蓝色和服，走到餐桌边坐下，想到没有味觉这件事，完全提不起什么食欲，\"...\""}
{"time": 1753796633, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1162116200", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "主食是米饭配味增汤，菜品是盐烤秋刀鱼，已经去除了鱼刺部分。还有一小碟纳豆和芥末酱油。以及你那一份里有着双份的金黄玉子烧。"}
{"time": 1753796650, "type": "recv", "message_id": "428494916", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“尝尝你最喜欢吃的甜玉子烧。”"}
{"time": 1753796697, "type": "recv", "message_id": "905805835", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"嗯...\"抱着昨晚一切都是梦的期待，夹起一块放进嘴里"}
{"time": 1753796733, "type": "recv", "message_id": "47991794", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "并无味道，只能吃到软软的口感。"}
{"time": 1753796868, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1884502030", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "这一桌早餐可谓是酸甜苦辣都有。"}
{"time": 1753796923, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2099780153", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "认命地叹口气，放下筷子，\"老爹，我吃不下去了。\""}
{"time": 1753796947, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1564459016", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "起身往庭院里走"}
{"time": 1753797036, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1832771289", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“我知道你没胃口…但是还是得吃饭啊。”"}
{"time": 1753797051, "type": "recv", "message_id": "521092585", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "你父亲跟着起身试图劝阻。"}
{"time": 1753797062, "type": "recv", "message_id": "5659185", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "而你的肚子也传来咕咕声。"}
{"time": 1753797129, "type": "recv", "message_id": "782105419", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "“...”重新坐下来继续吃玉子烧，“以后该怎么办啊...”"}
{"time": 1753797170, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2066438645", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“但是你不是也获得了那个预知的能力吗？”"}
{"time": 1753797194, "type": "recv", "message_id": "979040318", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“我想用这个能力说不能能得到你想要的答案。”"}
{"time": 1753797230, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1834103379", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "“唔...那我试试。”有一搭没一搭吃着玉子烧，心里询问味觉能不能恢复"}
{"time": 1753797336, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2139227320", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "是"}
{"time": 1753797409, "type": "recv", "message_id": "140640221", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "“诶...居然说还有机会诶？”振作起来，虽然没有味道，但是快速把早餐吃完，“老爹，我去扫院子啦，妈妈说下午有客人要来。”"}
{"time": 1753797953, "type": "recv", "message_id": "487405658", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“记得跟学校请假。”"}
{"time": 1753798007, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1142702456", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "（打会三角洲等下来）"}
{"time": 1753798080, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2101483645", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "（好的）"}
{"time": 1753806984, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1057988478", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "那么上午的时间可以快进，你可以选一件事情做来提升自己的技能，或者属性值。"}
{"time": 1753807038, "type": "recv", "message_id": "391114053", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "（你想要成长的技能或者属性，r一下，成功了就能成长，属性是涨2点）"}
{"time": 1753807103, "type": "recv", "message_id": "803829140", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "。en敏捷"}
