{"time": 1753807153, "type": "recv", "message_id": "820508216", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "（rp一下你干了啥？）"}
{"time": 1753807161, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1530818546", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "（平衡训练属于是）"}
{"time": 1753807197, "type": "recv", "message_id": "947447517", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "在院子里各处洒扫，但因为穿着和服的缘故，总是有些掌握不好平衡"}
{"time": 1753807262, "type": "recv", "message_id": "663443552", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "那么时间来到了下午，吃完午饭不久，就有人敲门。"}
{"time": 1753807295, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1012973964", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "满怀期待，淑女地走到门前开门"}
{"time": 1753807429, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1690283136", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "来人乃是一个穿着灰色西装的干练女子，手上带着黑色的手套，褐色的头发在身后扎成一股利落的单马尾。带着半框眼镜的女子看向你，开口。"}
{"time": 1753807455, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1822333030", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“你就是我的老同学的女儿？”"}
{"time": 1753807486, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1517314938", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“看起来精神面貌不错，没有被异常事件影响的很严重。”"}
{"time": 1753807514, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1293151722", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"呃...家母浅上结花...您是?\"从没见过，眨眨眼，有些摸不着头脑"}
{"time": 1753807618, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1503515072", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“我是异常管理局的搜查科人员，受你母亲邀请来调查这次事件。”"}
{"time": 1753807658, "type": "recv", "message_id": "662212194", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "说着，她从西装内兜拿出一张证件卡。"}
{"time": 1753807695, "type": "recv", "message_id": "602357586", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“先进去慢慢说吧，还是说你要打电话给你母亲确认一下？”"}
{"time": 1753807747, "type": "recv", "message_id": "396982297", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"异常管理局?\"定睛看一看证件卡上的名字"}
{"time": 1753807773, "type": "recv", "message_id": "715736366", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"妈妈说下午就会回来...阿姨要进来坐坐吗？\""}
{"time": 1753807810, "type": "recv", "message_id": "810640193", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“阿…阿姨？我看起来有这么老吗？”"}
{"time": 1753807830, "type": "recv", "message_id": "131917299", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "西装女子很无语地推了推眼镜。"}
{"time": 1753807869, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1402662793", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"...\"有些僵住，过了一会才开口\"呃...是我妈妈的同学...不应该叫阿姨吗？\""}
{"time": 1753807913, "type": "recv", "message_id": "318483527", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“算了，先进去坐吧。”"}
{"time": 1753807985, "type": "recv", "message_id": "811609460", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "进入客厅沙发坐下，你父亲端来了茶水并且和这位西装女性打了招呼，似乎是认识的样子。"}
{"time": 1753808005, "type": "recv", "message_id": "314259573", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "（现在知道我为什么r那个81了吧）"}
{"time": 1753808016, "type": "recv", "message_id": "792820637", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"...\"坐在旁边没说话，他们是不是瞒着我什么?"}
{"time": 1753808017, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1099254870", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "（你妈有认识的人）"}
{"time": 1753808045, "type": "recv", "message_id": "409793860", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "（如果信誉在50以上直接默认认识）"}
{"time": 1753808100, "type": "recv", "message_id": "456422807", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(我妈信誉81?)"}
{"time": 1753808101, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1512270518", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“好了，现在来谈谈吧。你有什么想问的，可以先说了。”"}
{"time": 1753808104, "type": "recv", "message_id": "715393591", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(那很厉害了)"}
{"time": 1753808116, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1227652559", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "（不是信誉81，是确定认不认识）"}
{"time": 1753808119, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1789698221", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"...镜子里的东西是什么?\""}
{"time": 1753808156, "type": "recv", "message_id": "920132045", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“直接就从这里开始吗？你就不好奇我背后的组织什么的？”"}
{"time": 1753808181, "type": "recv", "message_id": "68311240", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "说着她从兜里掏出了一个小本子，往上面写了什么。"}
{"time": 1753808230, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1486276170", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“那面镜子，按你的经历来看，应该是一个三级异常物品。”"}
{"time": 1753808269, "type": "recv", "message_id": "446311107", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“镜子里的那个投影是异常物品自身扭曲的规则带来的产物。”"}
{"time": 1753808296, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1103261921", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"妈妈又不会害我。\"摇摇头，\"异常物品?\"皱起眉，\"这是什么\""}
{"time": 1753808367, "type": "recv", "message_id": "383915502", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“就如同你昨晚经历的，这个地球上有些地方或者物品，会产生物理规则无法解释的现象，这些就被称为异常。”"}
{"time": 1753808398, "type": "recv", "message_id": "257889728", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“而我们异常管理局，就是对这些异常进行收容管理，避免它们危害人类。”"}
{"time": 1753808484, "type": "recv", "message_id": "299066896", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"呃...好像也不怎么意外...那，我失去的味觉...\""}
{"time": 1753808580, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1648943072", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "两人正说着，就听到一阵拉门的声音，然后进来了一位穿着和服的黑发美人。"}
{"time": 1753808656, "type": "recv", "message_id": "492039212", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "这正是你的母亲，浅上结花。"}
{"time": 1753808672, "type": "recv", "message_id": "658835681", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"妈！\"站起身扑到她怀里"}
{"time": 1753808703, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1552516616", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "她也一把抱住了你，慢慢抚摸着你的后背。"}
{"time": 1753808713, "type": "recv", "message_id": "922999473", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“没事了，没事了。”"}
{"time": 1753808741, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1693922110", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "安抚了一会儿，就拉着你一起坐在西装女性的对面。"}
{"time": 1753808744, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1175218797", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"呜呜...我好怕，以后再也见不到你了。\"身体完全放松下来靠在她身上，\"早上还...一点不急的样子...\""}
{"time": 1753808893, "type": "recv", "message_id": "345709109", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“那我可要好好说说你，谁让你孤身一人就去那种地方，还是在逢魔之时，即使没有遇到幽灵，遇到什么犯罪分子你个小身板也顶不住啊。”"}
{"time": 1753808900, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2004327787", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“下次不许这样了，知道吗？”"}
{"time": 1753808916, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1575745584", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "你妈开始口头教育你。"}
{"time": 1753808942, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1483428387", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "而对面的西装女性饶有兴致地看着你们二人互动，并且在本子上记录了什么。"}
{"time": 1753808995, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1950107860", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"呜...\"老老实实，不敢反驳，\"我好奇啦...而且妈妈以前也在那边念过书那。"}
{"time": 1753809022, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1940076335", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“这位是妈在大学时期认识的同学，毕业后在异常管理局工作，她是来解决你身上的问题的。”"}
{"time": 1753809037, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1939040687", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"哦对了...阿姨，我的味觉...\""}
{"time": 1753809062, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1681830686", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“九条雪绪，好久不见了。”"}
{"time": 1753809102, "type": "recv", "message_id": "476099061", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“确实好久不见了，上次见面还是你家孩子满月的时候。”"}
{"time": 1753809113, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1849994606", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“就是你，小姑娘。”"}
{"time": 1753809151, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1687083107", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"诶...\"自己当然没有什么印象，眨眨眼，转而开口，\"妈，妹妹呢？\""}
{"time": 1753809187, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1380477381", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“你妹妹跟父亲回房间了，让她接触到这些事还太早。”"}
{"time": 1753809283, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1485113848", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“关于你遇到的那个黑色雕像，以及你献祭味觉获取能力的事件，我怀疑是当时遇到了另一个异常。”"}
{"time": 1753809319, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1547524645", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“可以跟我详细说说当时的情景吗？”"}
{"time": 1753809333, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2042761391", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "九条雪绪拿起笔准备记录。"}
{"time": 1753809370, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1082480566", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "描述自己在被镜子里的自己追杀被甩飞到墙上的瞬间突然跌入一个黑色的空洞里看见了雕塑的事情"}
{"time": 1753809400, "type": "recv", "message_id": "353682528", "deleted": true, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "皱着眉，\"舍一感，得所欲果。\"\n\"捐一觉，获所求效。\"复述了一边"}
{"time": 1753809407, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1449940596", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "皱着眉，\"舍一感，得所欲果。\"\n\"捐一觉，获所求效。\"复述了一遍"}
{"time": 1753809445, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1041076481", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "最后重复了一遍“汝已知晓”"}
{"time": 1753809455, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1728050682", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“嗯，看起来这个异常的规则就是这样，付出代价来获取你当时想要的东西。”"}
{"time": 1753809513, "type": "recv", "message_id": "75514856", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"...那...味觉...\""}
{"time": 1753809571, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1315774564", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“那个镜子的灵场范围，看起来包含了一整座学校后山，起码能判定为一个三级异常。而你在献祭之后，镜子里的异常反而感到害怕，那么你遇到的这个雕像起码是四级甚至最高级五级异常。”"}
{"time": 1753809584, "type": "recv", "message_id": "615473726", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“这就有些难办了。”"}
{"time": 1753809644, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2146966819", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“五级异常，这么跟你说，在古代科学并不发达的事情，这些异常中有一部分曾经被人加封神话传说，尊为神明。”"}
{"time": 1753809691, "type": "recv", "message_id": "713735570", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"呃...\""}
{"time": 1753809712, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1053623771", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“你获取的预知能力还能使用吗？对你味觉的事用过吗？”"}
{"time": 1753809719, "type": "recv", "message_id": "421047296", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"那能判断是什么吗？\"吞口口水，\"如果没有什么后续影响...\""}
{"time": 1753809745, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1358582656", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"啊啊...可以...早上的时候问过一次，回答是可以恢复味觉...\""}
{"time": 1753809776, "type": "recv", "message_id": "754154672", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“哦呀，那说不定有办法。”"}
{"time": 1753809805, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1006130499", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“也许需要你和我回总部看看。”"}
{"time": 1753809824, "type": "recv", "message_id": "325603381", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“你的意思呢，我的老同学？”"}
{"time": 1753809922, "type": "recv", "message_id": "870958723", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "抓住妈妈的手，一直在发抖，声若蚊蝇，\"不...\""}
{"time": 1753810004, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1728398625", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "（你不个啥）"}
{"time": 1753810018, "type": "recv", "message_id": "663611249", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"害怕...\""}
{"time": 1753810377, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1671716538", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "你妈脸上满是担忧，握住了你的手"}
{"time": 1753810388, "type": "recv", "message_id": "439467270", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“我能不能陪她一起去啊。”"}
{"time": 1753810414, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1202234845", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“当然可以，只是和检查身体类似，不用这么紧张。”"}
{"time": 1753810440, "type": "recv", "message_id": "326058477", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"...要去哪?\""}
{"time": 1753810459, "type": "recv", "message_id": "78228735", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“对于小姑娘你这种人，我们异常管理局有不少呢，甚至一部分是我们的员工。”"}
{"time": 1753810488, "type": "recv", "message_id": "327773853", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“去东京，离这也不远就是了。”"}
{"time": 1753810507, "type": "recv", "message_id": "124061535", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"...唔，一定要去吗？\""}
{"time": 1753810510, "type": "recv", "message_id": "567858767", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“在走之前，你要不要看看昨天你遇到的那个镜子是怎么被收容的？”"}
{"time": 1753810551, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1317063323", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“不去也行，登记一下，然后你自己找恢复味觉的方法？”"}
{"time": 1753810684, "type": "recv", "message_id": "12756263", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"...\"认命一样叹口气，\"我要去...\""}
{"time": 1753810797, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1049049770", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "站起身，\"我去看看妹妹。\""}
{"time": 1753810826, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1407724792", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "那么你起身离开了。你的母亲留下来和九条雪绪接着聊。"}
{"time": 1753810833, "type": "recv", "message_id": "786568573", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "。log off"}
{"time": 1753979062, "type": "reply", "message_id": "1223643651", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": 2875548981, "name": "小雅"}, "message": "继续记录乐谱"}
{"time": 1753979140, "type": "recv", "message_id": "248813064", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "你回到楼上找你妹妹和父亲，你母亲还在和九条雪绪接着聊。"}
{"time": 1753979234, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1932573437", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "心情沉重，但是尽量面上不显，深呼吸"}
{"time": 1753979297, "type": "recv", "message_id": "222897318", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "（你要找你妹妹干什么，不干什么特别的事就跳过了）"}
{"time": 1753979312, "type": "recv", "message_id": "500646087", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(抒情吧)"}
{"time": 1753979499, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1505893508", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "你在楼上带了一会儿，逃避了一会子现实之后，你妈喊你下楼"}
{"time": 1753979517, "type": "recv", "message_id": "725838740", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "看样子是九条雪绪要离开了。"}
{"time": 1753979571, "type": "recv", "message_id": "565518086", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"姐姐离开一段时间。\"摸摸妹妹脑袋，\"嗯...很快就回来。\""}
{"time": 1753979578, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1893502131", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "叹口气下楼"}
{"time": 1753979695, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1621682340", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "你下楼正好看到在玄关的二人。"}
{"time": 1753979713, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1487640958", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "九条雪绪向你招招手。"}
{"time": 1753979725, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1724993943", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“要不要去看看那面镜子的怎么被收容的？”"}
{"time": 1753979753, "type": "recv", "message_id": "783351806", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“你也可以“报仇”一下，不是吗？”"}
{"time": 1753979754, "type": "recv", "message_id": "820995184", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "点点头，\"我正好要好好嘲笑他\""}
{"time": 1753979786, "type": "recv", "message_id": "569259611", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "看到你同意了，九条雪绪笑了一下。"}
{"time": 1753979830, "type": "recv", "message_id": "510307822", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“那我们明天就出发去东京检查，你和你母亲一起去，记得向学校多请一天假。”"}
{"time": 1753979849, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2022771743", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "你母亲这时走过来摸了摸你的脑袋。"}
{"time": 1753979859, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1092923023", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "然后掏出了一枚新的护身符。"}
{"time": 1753979894, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1805089551", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"这是私人恩怨吧？\"接过护身符，\"妈...我弄坏了原来那个\""}
{"time": 1753979897, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1325506462", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“你那个旧的护身符快坏了吧，我给你个新的，比之前那个效果更好。”"}
{"time": 1753979974, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1755051686", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "看到旧的护身符上几乎裂成两半的裂口，你妈眉头微皱，随后闭上眼睛。"}
{"time": 1753979996, "type": "recv", "message_id": "100570317", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“受苦了，小绘梨花。”"}
{"time": 1753980007, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1870781965", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "随后把你抱得更紧。"}
{"time": 1753980021, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1296619404", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "仿佛害怕失去你。"}
{"time": 1753980045, "type": "recv", "message_id": "275820654", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"没事没事，都是我乱跑，弄坏了妈妈给的护身符。\"此刻倒是安心下来，\"妈妈在身边的话，东京我也不怕了。\""}
{"time": 1753980324, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1815975659", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "那么你们跟着九条雪绪出门，上了一个黑色高级轿车，雪绪是司机。"}
{"time": 1753980383, "type": "recv", "message_id": "389050193", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "车很快就开到了校门口，雪绪探头出示了一下证件后，门卫就让车进入了。"}
{"time": 1753980443, "type": "recv", "message_id": "700521927", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "车子开到后山的一条道路上停下，前面已经有一辆货车停靠在路旁。"}
{"time": 1753980478, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1218884501", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "同时车上有着四五个穿着灰色工作服的人员。"}
{"time": 1753980494, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1861867897", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "九条雪绪上去跟他们打了个招呼。"}
{"time": 1753980518, "type": "recv", "message_id": "39688947", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "坐在后座上，紧握着妈妈的手，说不紧张是假的"}
{"time": 1753980568, "type": "recv", "message_id": "199180061", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "这时在你昨天上去的小路上下来了一位跟雪绪穿着大差不差西服的中年男人，男人的手上拿着一支烟，并没有点燃。"}
{"time": 1753980572, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1794192974", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "（可以侦查）"}
{"time": 1753980581, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1114777756", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "。ra侦查"}
{"time": 1753980581, "type": "reply", "message_id": "1114777756", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": 2875548981, "name": "小雅"}, "message": "[浅上绘梨花]进行技能[侦查:80]检定: 1D100=15 极难成功，流水落花春去也，天上人间"}
{"time": 1753980743, "type": "recv", "message_id": "283264147", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "你发现中年男人的一只眼睛上有疤，这只眼睛眼球不会动，是假眼。"}
{"time": 1753980765, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1685796937", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "随后雪绪带着中年男人向你们走过来。"}
{"time": 1753980782, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1837263890", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "雪绪让你们母子俩下车。"}
{"time": 1753980829, "type": "recv", "message_id": "123728558", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "不去看他的眼睛，拽着妈妈的袖子下车"}
{"time": 1753980978, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1512358716", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "（你这前后反差太大了，前面背景是一个人天黑上旧校舍探险都不怕）"}
{"time": 1753980983, "type": "recv", "message_id": "183612525", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "（这就怕了）"}
{"time": 1753981008, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1599098676", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(怕生不怕事)"}
{"time": 1753981149, "type": "recv", "message_id": "356736418", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "那个男人看到你们努力挤出笑容，然后把烟收了起来。"}
{"time": 1753981215, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1118736255", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“初次见面，我是九条科长的同事，收容科的小仓健。”"}
{"time": 1753981262, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1557796461", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"你...你好...\""}
{"time": 1753981272, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1148485624", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“听说小姑娘你昨天晚上被这个三级异常带到灵场里转了一圈还出来了，看不出来挺厉害的嘛！”"}
{"time": 1753981415, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1395288070", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"呃...是妈妈的御守救下了我。\""}
{"time": 1753981468, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1288907538", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“但是你确实破解了异常的规则不是吗？”"}
{"time": 1753981496, "type": "recv", "message_id": "29673611", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "九条雪绪对你眨了一只眼补充到。"}
{"time": 1753981542, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2058845575", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“好了，现在让我们上去回收那个镜子吧。准备工作已经做好了。”"}
{"time": 1753981566, "type": "recv", "message_id": "651422584", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"嗯嗯。\"提起那个镜子就来气，\"怎么报复?\""}
{"time": 1753981655, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1265105188", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "小仓健招呼那几个工作人员，有的人拿着不知名仪器，有的人背着包，排着队沿着小路上山。"}
{"time": 1753981672, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1950406122", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "九条雪绪领着你们走在人群后面。"}
{"time": 1753981677, "type": "recv", "message_id": "430763335", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "并且回答你的问题。"}
{"time": 1753981738, "type": "recv", "message_id": "736168780", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“报复？看不出来你这个小姑娘还挺咬牙还牙的，你想怎么报复？”"}
{"time": 1753981806, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1895891903", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "随后她拿出了一个长条形小木盒，并且从盒子里拿出了一副眼镜，给你带上。"}
{"time": 1753981857, "type": "recv", "message_id": "148084368", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"那当然啦。\"露出笑容，\"他可是让我差点回不来了诶?只是报复，已经算轻了的吧？\"被戴上眼镜，\"这是什么?\""}
{"time": 1753981917, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2142477489", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“这副眼镜可以段时间内屏蔽异常对你的感知，从那面镜子看来，你是个面容模糊不清的人，因此暂时无法复制你了。”"}
{"time": 1753981952, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1792091144", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“你可以借着这个机会骂骂它之类的。”"}
{"time": 1753981982, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1461559488", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "随后她拉进距离在你耳边说：“别骂的太脏喽，你妈还在旁边呢。”"}
{"time": 1753981988, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1963310618", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"诶...其实我当时就在想了，这种东西能破坏掉吗？\""}
{"time": 1753982008, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1496107819", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "随后雪绪就吃了你母亲一个爆栗。"}
{"time": 1753982047, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1774593238", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“我都听见了。不过我也会报复那面镜子一下的，敢伤害我女儿。”"}
{"time": 1753982087, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1142043883", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "雪绪吐了吐舌头，继续回答你的问题。"}
{"time": 1753982093, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1096720540", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"诶诶?\"其实自己说的是气话居多，完全不知道该怎么报复异常这种东西，\"感觉我只能骂两句...\""}
{"time": 1753982103, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1239034784", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "抬起头看一眼妈妈的神色"}
{"time": 1753982136, "type": "recv", "message_id": "655021411", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“一般来说这种能解决方法简单的异常都要进行收容处理的。而你之前也试过了，简单的物理方法可能很难破坏那面镜子。”"}
{"time": 1753982188, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1639862390", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "这时你们走到了之前警告拦网在的地方，这里已经被清理出了能让成年人轻松通过的入口。"}
{"time": 1753982233, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1613322744", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "有几名人员留在附近设置了仪器，剩下的跟着小仓健接着向上走。"}
{"time": 1753982269, "type": "recv", "message_id": "786312352", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"嗯...也就是说，有办法破坏咯?\""}
{"time": 1753982336, "type": "recv", "message_id": "510718933", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“当然有，异常管理局有的是办法。”"}
{"time": 1753982360, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1038630863", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"原来如此。\"不再开口，默默跟上"}
{"time": 1753982369, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1273547115", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "你们跟着人群进入旧校舍，走到四楼401门口。"}
{"time": 1753982410, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2069499163", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "小仓健和工作人员似乎特意等你们先进去“报复”完，然后再进行工作。"}
{"time": 1753982445, "type": "recv", "message_id": "797842269", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "你的母亲扶住你的肩膀。"}
{"time": 1753982455, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1656650801", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "拉着妈妈的手走进去"}
{"time": 1753982468, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1946891301", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“别害怕，有我在，今天给你看看你妈的本事。”"}
{"time": 1753982500, "type": "recv", "message_id": "325956007", "deleted": true, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "那么你们三人进去后，那面镜子阳台。"}
{"time": 1753982513, "type": "recv", "message_id": "570955762", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "那么你们三人进去宿舍后，那面镜子仍在阳台。"}
{"time": 1753982540, "type": "recv", "message_id": "541779836", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "（过去看镜子就过侦查）"}
{"time": 1753982638, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1916111750", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "。ra侦查"}
{"time": 1753982638, "type": "reply", "message_id": "1916111750", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": 2875548981, "name": "小雅"}, "message": "[浅上绘梨花]进行技能[侦查:80]检定: 1D100=39 困难成功，且将新火试新茶，诗酒趁年华"}
{"time": 1753982644, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1710007872", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"嗯嗯。\""}
{"time": 1753982712, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1950218753", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "那面镜子里面的人影一阵变化，只能变成一团有这2个红点的人形黑影。"}
{"time": 1753982748, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1834283604", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"哼，坏东西！\"忍不住出口"}
{"time": 1753982768, "type": "recv", "message_id": "23088824", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"怎么样，现在你是不是完蛋了。\""}
{"time": 1753982850, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2063955746", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“我当是谁呢，原来是昨天那个害怕的小姑娘。”"}
{"time": 1753982883, "type": "recv", "message_id": "362790986", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“要不是意外，我早就出去了。”"}
{"time": 1753982911, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1254413068", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“我还记得当时你被我打的惨叫啊，要不要我模仿给你听听？”"}
{"time": 1753982995, "type": "recv", "message_id": "637552350", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"哼...\"昨晚确实有够丢脸，\"但是....但是我出来了！\""}
{"time": 1753983049, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2115296922", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“不用跟它废话了小绘梨花。”"}
{"time": 1753983079, "type": "recv", "message_id": "717189146", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "你的母亲上前拿出御币。"}
{"time": 1753983091, "type": "recv", "message_id": "886862501", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "（可以过侦查）"}
{"time": 1753983346, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2008475548", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "。ra侦查"}
{"time": 1753983346, "type": "reply", "message_id": "2008475548", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": 2875548981, "name": "小雅"}, "message": "[浅上绘梨花]进行技能[侦查:80]检定: 1D100=46 成功，春风得意马蹄急，一日看尽长安花"}
{"time": 1753983549, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1734076724", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "你发现，镜子里的人影变成了你母亲的样子，正准备发作，却被你母亲带着一层光辉的御币抽回了原形。"}
{"time": 1753983564, "type": "recv", "message_id": "639713961", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "同时人影发出痛苦的惨叫。"}
{"time": 1753983716, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1284356735", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"哇...妈妈好厉害！\""}
{"time": 1753983823, "type": "recv", "message_id": "51999699", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "你母亲又打了几下，才收起御币，看向你。"}
{"time": 1753983837, "type": "recv", "message_id": "860370986", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“想学我到时候教你。”"}
{"time": 1753983875, "type": "recv", "message_id": "882642859", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "雪绪也在旁边鼓起了掌，然后示意小仓健带人进来。"}
{"time": 1753983946, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2092270980", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"嗯嗯。\"直点头，对着镜子颐气指使，\"我妈妈还收拾不了你！\""}
{"time": 1753983952, "type": "recv", "message_id": "418416528", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "你们退到宿舍内，看那几名工作人员用一块画着阵法与咒符的黑布蒙上了镜子，然后用工具把镜子卸了下来彻底包住。"}
{"time": 1753983961, "type": "recv", "message_id": "838442764", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "装到了一个箱子里。"}
{"time": 1753983992, "type": "recv", "message_id": "103361179", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "随后小仓健指挥他们把箱子带走。"}
{"time": 1753984040, "type": "recv", "message_id": "547266103", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“想不到这学校的旧校舍竟然能有三级异常，收容后可能要多调查一下了。”"}
{"time": 1753984050, "type": "recv", "message_id": "652785125", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“到时候麻烦你们搜查科了。”"}
{"time": 1753984075, "type": "recv", "message_id": "244165161", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "小仓健拍了拍雪绪的肩膀。"}
{"time": 1753984103, "type": "recv", "message_id": "40517928", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“好了，这下事情就告一段落了。”"}
{"time": 1753984116, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1918964802", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "九条雪绪看向你。"}
{"time": 1753984147, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1933597279", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“晚上回去收拾一下行李，你和你母亲可能要在东京的总部待两天。”"}
{"time": 1753984169, "type": "recv", "message_id": "821868637", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "事已至此，点点头，拉着妈妈的手"}
{"time": 1753984204, "type": "recv", "message_id": "364500372", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "此时太阳已经西下，变成不刺眼的橘黄色。"}
{"time": 1753984236, "type": "recv", "message_id": "373281620", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "山间吹来一阵风，带起树林里的鸟鸣和蝉鸣。"}
{"time": 1753984265, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1042755379", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "你们就在这夕阳下慢慢沿着小路下山回到家中。"}
{"time": 1753984271, "type": "recv", "message_id": "173853269", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "。log off"}
{"time": 1766163338, "type": "reply", "message_id": "451834540", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": 2875548981, "name": "小雅"}, "message": "继续记录乐谱"}
{"time": 1766163404, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1904660064", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "前情提要，在狂信子干掉远处偷袭的Archer后，你们也成功逃离黑色巨人的追击，莉维娅一行人和所长一行人在穗群原学园门口汇合了。"}
{"time": 1766163439, "type": "recv", "message_id": "635129360", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "库丘林在之前的作战会议上也分享了这个特异点的相关信息，其中就包括异常源头Saber所在的位置，位于大空洞所在地点"}
{"time": 1766163454, "type": "recv", "message_id": "471630359", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "[CQ:image,file=E80F02B34A7815933069F9EF5E1DEEB4.jpg,sub_type=0,url=https://multimedia.nt.qq.com.cn/download?appid=1407&amp;fileid=EhRBltf1D2eFTjWQ6DR2i6_rwGcmpxj-swUg_wooqun8yY_KkQMyBHByb2RQgL2jAVoQUsS_SFWsE_KfYL0Ull6TCnoCwAuCAQJneg&amp;rkey=CAQSMAcU8A6dEmcmD_IJdNki5S3PaKCm9KHiGOnNXSnrOyIajWF7sctuZcLrLuvwdI51wg,file_size=88574]"}
{"time": 1766163484, "type": "recv", "message_id": "248641988", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"这种差事是不是太麻烦了?\"摇摇头，为被卷入这种事深深忧愁"}
{"time": 1766163567, "type": "recv", "message_id": "460251642", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“但是眼下就仅剩我们几个人能拯救人理了，所以给我认真一点。”"}
{"time": 1766163578, "type": "recv", "message_id": "230589327", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "奥尔加所长走在前方回应。"}
{"time": 1766163589, "type": "recv", "message_id": "586790158", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "一行人往北方的大空洞移动中。"}
{"time": 1766163683, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1603706260", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"我只是个职员啦？\"打个哈欠，\"这边不是有御主嘛\""}
{"time": 1766163713, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1415071832", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "跟在所长身后，一路注意四周的突发情况"}
{"time": 1766164063, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1649123371", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "众人到达大空洞之后，进入眼帘的景象即是烧焦的大地，以及一个巨大的坑洞，似乎这里发生过什么剧烈的战斗。"}
{"time": 1766164136, "type": "recv", "message_id": "421848366", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "皱了皱眉，\"立香酱，这里要小心一些。\""}
{"time": 1766164157, "type": "recv", "message_id": "392562466", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "在坑洞底部，坑底的中心，有一名骑士半跪于地。她的甲胄并非黯淡，而是吞噬一切光线的极黑，犹如将这片焦土的伤痕穿在了身上。每片甲叶的纹理都凝固着红色的不详魔力。\n\n骑士缓缓抬头，凝视着天空——那里，粘稠如沥青的“暗”正从天穹的裂痕中缓缓淌下，仿佛世界的一道溃烂伤口的脓血。她没有言语，只是将手中漆黑的长剑插入焦土，动作带着千钧之重，又轻如叹息。"}
{"time": 1766164247, "type": "recv", "message_id": "941650559", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "莉维娅身旁的立香也露出了一脸凝重的表情，紧张的握紧拳头，有几滴汗从额头留下。"}
{"time": 1766164274, "type": "recv", "message_id": "644003841", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"那就是...圣杯?\"轻声开口，拍拍立香的肩膀，\"这里要靠你了，御主亲。\""}
{"time": 1766164285, "type": "recv", "message_id": "642899994", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "[CQ:image,file=D185D032E19D909E33A6B212D1924FDD.jpg,sub_type=0,url=https://multimedia.nt.qq.com.cn/download?appid=1407&amp;fileid=EhQZ_PyLJv3B_g5XUk4stqm2EabTFhj7twIg_woo1PWV1pLKkQMyBHByb2RQgL2jAVoQ_o_JZ2QK-9nBfL_p-1xTknoCSFGCAQJneg&amp;rkey=CAQSMAcU8A6dEmcmD_IJdNki5S3PaKCm9KHiGOnNXSnrOyIajWF7sctuZcLrLuvwdI51wg,file_size=39931]"}
{"time": 1766164335, "type": "recv", "message_id": "92763505", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"我只是职员哦?拯救世界是御主的任务吧？\"向着所长确认道，背着手站在立香身边"}
{"time": 1766164455, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1485014507", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "（稍等我去开一下剧情，我弄到文字版了）"}
{"time": 1766164633, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1008840349", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "奥尔加玛丽并没有管莉维娅推卸责任的话语，而是开口：这就是大圣杯……这不是超高级的魔术炉心吗……为什么远东的岛国里会有这种东西啊……"}
{"time": 1766164661, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1725816218", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "罗曼医生：跟据资料，这是由名为爱因兹贝伦的炼金术大师制作而成。  他们不属于魔术协会，好像是仅由&#91;#人造人:Homunculus&#93;构成的一族。"}
{"time": 1766164687, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1792436600", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"嗯...怎么处理?\""}
{"time": 1766164725, "type": "recv", "message_id": "220739492", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "术阶库丘林打断你们的对话：抱歉，就聊到这里吧。我们被那家伙发现了。"}
{"time": 1766164790, "type": "recv", "message_id": "971891676", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "库丘林：敌人是亚瑟王，虽然看起来是个小姑娘，但是你们不要小瞧她哦！"}
{"time": 1766164857, "type": "recv", "message_id": "143893203", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "库丘林：嗯。只要打倒她，这座城市的异变就会消失。之后就是你们的工作了。虽然不知道会发生什么，但请你们在力所能及的范围内好好干吧。"}
{"time": 1766164857, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1697470954", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"啧，还要跟这家伙打吗？\""}
{"time": 1766164873, "type": "recv", "message_id": "657130199", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "皱着眉，\"玛修，你可以用宝具吗？\""}
{"time": 1766164929, "type": "recv", "message_id": "157386537", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“唉，前辈，我会努力尝试能不能用出来的。”玛修有些紧张地回应。"}
{"time": 1766164998, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2082747424", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "库丘林：“说的没错，那家伙的攻击附带有不要钱一般的魔力，每一下都如同宝具一般，防御的事情就要小姑娘你努把力了！”"}
{"time": 1766165063, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1200808768", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "漆黑的骑士看到你们进入战斗距离，也开口说话：——————哦？还真是个很有趣的从者呢。"}
{"time": 1766165072, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1990332881", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"嗯...\"虽然有心将这件事交给玛修，不过...\"我们也会帮忙的，不过...我们的作用有限哦?\"指着自己和狂信子"}
{"time": 1766165232, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2045278921", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“只要是长老的敌人，我会使出全力！”狂信子也升起满满的战意，随后进入气息遮蔽，准备在暗处使出致命一击。"}
{"time": 1766165232, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2083676201", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"麻烦，能请您让开吗？毕竟我们有任务在身呢。\"对着对方开口"}
{"time": 1766165266, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2146138650", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "漆黑的亚瑟王：啊啊。因为一言一行始终都处在被监视的状态下。故而我反其道而行，选择如若稻草人般沉默地守在这里。 \n不过———有意思。紫发小姑娘，你那个宝具确实有意思。 \n做好准备，不知名的少女。你的防守是否确实坚不可摧，就由这把剑来确认一下吧！"}
{"time": 1766165355, "type": "recv", "message_id": "362234650", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“玛修，虽然我有些紧张，但是一起战斗吧！我会支援你的！”\n藤丸立香露出手上的令咒，对着玛修说到。"}
{"time": 1766165401, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1221480764", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=2083676201]“对不起呢诸位，我有着不得不守在这里的使命，要想碰圣杯就要先打倒我！”"}
{"time": 1766165413, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1194064047", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "金发的骑士王回应到。"}
{"time": 1766165417, "type": "recv", "message_id": "82458021", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "眨眨眼，心里和狂信子对话，\"把舞台暂时让开他们吧。\""}
{"time": 1766165482, "type": "recv", "message_id": "338710106", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "那么双方摆开架势一触即发"}
