{"time": 1766168670, "type": "recv", "message_id": "954199048", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "亚瑟王不敌玛修攻击，被狠狠拍飞出去，铠甲都碎裂了几块。"}
