{"time": 1766169030, "type": "recv", "message_id": "733354409", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "狂信子毫不费力的从亚瑟王碎裂的铠甲处刺入。"}
{"time": 1766169073, "type": "recv", "message_id": "55692340", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(木拉塔)"}
{"time": 1766169076, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1367872486", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "亚瑟王：———哼。我似乎不知不觉地手下留情了。居然在最后关头没能下手。 虽说我想要守护圣杯，却终因自身的过度执着而导致了失败。"}
{"time": 1766169112, "type": "recv", "message_id": "652755145", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“到头来，无论命运如何改变，只要我孤身一人，总会迎来同样的末路吗。 ”"}
{"time": 1766169129, "type": "recv", "message_id": "627381957", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "亚瑟王的身影化作金色的灵子，开始缓缓消散。"}
{"time": 1766169152, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1467566874", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“啊？　你这话啥意思啊。你这家伙到底知道些什么？ ”\n库丘林似乎有些疑问。"}
{"time": 1766169192, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2005892325", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“总有一天你也会知道的，爱尔兰的光之子。还有，观星台的诸位…”"}
{"time": 1766169207, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1146617292", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"那我呢?\"指着自己"}
{"time": 1766169223, "type": "recv", "message_id": "713243188", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "亚瑟王依次看向奥尔加玛丽，佩佩，莉维娅，最后目光落在藤丸立香上。"}
{"time": 1766169230, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1117627930", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“Grand Order———围绕圣杯展开的战争才刚刚开始。”"}
{"time": 1766169270, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1408861549", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "耸耸肩，也不期待答案，\"反正不管怎么样，后续的事情不要让我参与就好啦。\""}
{"time": 1766169324, "type": "recv", "message_id": "971742655", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“居然这个时候强制返回吗？”库丘林的身影也开始缓缓消散，随后他回过头来对你们说到，\n\n“嘁，虽然难以接受，但没办法！接下来回收圣杯就拜托你们啦！如果有下次的话，以Lancer的身份召唤我吧！”"}
{"time": 1766169399, "type": "recv", "message_id": "270462591", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1408861549]“你又在妄自菲薄什么啊，这场战斗你和藤丸立香不都做的不错嘛？”\n奥尔加所长吐槽到。"}
{"time": 1766169434, "type": "recv", "message_id": "347748855", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“话说，&#91;#冠位指定:Grand Order&#93;……那个从者为什么说出了这个称呼……？”\n奥尔加玛丽喃喃自语。"}
{"time": 1766169473, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1855712619", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"拜拜。\"朝着库丘林挥挥手，\"可是我只想做个职员诶?\"听完所长的话回复，\"御主这种事，又麻烦又累人，有立香酱就好啦。\""}
{"time": 1766169496, "type": "recv", "message_id": "378499763", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“玛丽所长，请指示！”\n藤丸立香认真的准备听从所长指令。"}
{"time": 1766169544, "type": "recv", "message_id": "137417471", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "奥尔加玛丽：哎……？　啊，是啊。干得不错，咕哒、玛修。 \n虽然还有很多存疑之处，不过任务至此结束。 \n先回收那颗水晶体吧。\n导致剑士异常的理由……以及冬木市变成特异点的原因，怎么看都是因为那个。"}
{"time": 1766169582, "type": "recv", "message_id": "625121008", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“是，立刻紧急回收——什么！？”"}
{"time": 1766169601, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1799290849", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "事情大概告了一段落，刚准备放松，\"怎么了?\"立刻打起精神"}
{"time": 1766169607, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1076952736", "deleted": true, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "[CQ:image,summary=&#91;雷欧&#93;,file=a3-a34cfb8f78764def74e61d5b461dc87c.gif,url=https://gxh.vip.qq.com/club/item/parcel/item/a3/a34cfb8f78764def74e61d5b461dc87c/raw300.gif,key=a57c30c0ce4a1c53,emoji_id=a34cfb8f78764def74e61d5b461dc87c,emoji_package_id=195499]"}
{"time": 1766169620, "type": "recv", "message_id": "890062357", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "玛修准备回收圣杯的时候，有个人影出现了。"}
{"time": 1766169681, "type": "recv", "message_id": "818389470", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“哎呀，没想到你们居然走到这一步。真是超出了预定计划，也超出我的容忍底线了。 第48名御主适任者，本以为你只是个毫无潜质的小毛孩，我才好心放过你，看来是我疏忽了。”"}
{"time": 1766169709, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1244302113", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "来者身穿绿色的衣袍和礼帽。"}
{"time": 1766169731, "type": "recv", "message_id": "417501059", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“雷夫教授！？”"}
{"time": 1766169739, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1678797813", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "玛修有些不敢相信自己的眼镜。"}
{"time": 1766169774, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1851197109", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"雷夫?\"皱眉看着他，\"你为什么在这里?\""}
{"time": 1766169787, "type": "recv", "message_id": "233208169", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“雷夫———！？雷夫教授？他在那里吗？”罗曼医生的声音也穿了出来，但是信号有些不太好。"}
{"time": 1766169791, "type": "recv", "message_id": "426593890", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "指尖凝聚出魔弹，对准他\"别动。\""}
{"time": 1766169835, "type": "recv", "message_id": "385414976", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“嗯？　这声音是罗玛尼的吗？还有莉维娅，你们也活下来了啊。 我明明叫你们立刻到管制室来的，居然没听我的指示。真是的———   一个个都是无组织无纪律的杂碎，简直让我恶心。”"}
{"time": 1766169868, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1663409986", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "雷夫教授一瞬间露出狰狞的表情，但是又转回那一副温和的嘴脸。"}
{"time": 1766169890, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1994582247", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“人类这种存在为什么总是这样，为何总想要偏离既定的命运呢？”"}
{"time": 1766169923, "type": "recv", "message_id": "590681164", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"偷吃草莓蛋糕怎么你了？对吧罗马尼。\"语气变得严肃，\"你到底是什么?名为雷夫的个体。\"魔弹从手中发射，朝他飞去"}
{"time": 1766169926, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1794116184", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "。rd100"}
{"time": 1766169926, "type": "reply", "message_id": "1794116184", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": 2875548981, "name": "小雅"}, "message": "[顾时汐]演奏出: 1D100=25"}
{"time": 1766169985, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1271441255", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“事到如今你认为这种魔术把戏对我有用吗？”雷夫不屑的说到。"}
{"time": 1766169990, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1431521453", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "。rd100"}
{"time": 1766169990, "type": "reply", "message_id": "1431521453", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": 2875548981, "name": "小雅"}, "message": "[斯薇塔]演奏出: 1D100=99"}
{"time": 1766170026, "type": "recv", "message_id": "782117458", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "魔弹在行进到里雷夫一定距离就自动消散成蓝色的光。"}
{"time": 1766170045, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1797928486", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“别攻击莉维娅！”"}
{"time": 1766170059, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1960633531", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "奥尔加玛丽所长大声制止。"}
{"time": 1766170082, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1846691310", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“雷夫……啊啊，雷夫，雷夫，你活着啊雷夫！ 太好了，自从你不在之后，我都不知道该如何守护迦勒底了！”"}
{"time": 1766170105, "type": "recv", "message_id": "52259219", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"啧。\"拉住所长扯在自己身后，这种时候自己得挡在前面，\"所长，你还没看出来吗？\""}
{"time": 1766170136, "type": "recv", "message_id": "555440321", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“玛丽所长，那个人很危险，不是我们认识的雷夫教授！”玛修戒备着看着雷夫。"}
{"time": 1766170189, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1694256880", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"那家伙已经不是雷夫了，是别的什么东西。\"逐渐放开身体里的魔力锁，以太开始涌向更高位的阶层，\"虽然我只是个文员，不过真要和我比过一场吗？雷夫教授。\""}
{"time": 1766170203, "type": "recv", "message_id": "563000474", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“啊啊，都是些意料外的状况，真令人火大。 其中最出乎我意料的其实是你，奥尔加。我明明把炸弹设置在你的脚下，没想到你居然还活着！”"}
{"time": 1766170213, "type": "recv", "message_id": "173123457", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "雷夫又露出了狰狞的表情"}
{"time": 1766170216, "type": "recv", "message_id": "598207385", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "同时暗暗指挥狂信子准备偷袭"}
{"time": 1766170249, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1840064024", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "[CQ:image,file=E7D103366B1DF26167F855F63AC6C143.jpg,sub_type=0,url=https://multimedia.nt.qq.com.cn/download?appid=1407&amp;fileid=EhTD8W6F0gecSgWYWzj7PYcysgR7khid0QMg_wootsWE8qjKkQMyBHByb2RQgL2jAVoQbN6Pdj-c2ieLPaAezZI4VHoCUAaCAQJneg&amp;rkey=CAISMPxXnrdDdy4QT_NPwTzm_fitCbHhY9sDejAjAz0ihJRtJO0CnrCeGJYkb_IBltc3vw,file_size=59549]"}
{"time": 1766170256, "type": "recv", "message_id": "111395902", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "（几嘿人哦）"}
{"time": 1766170298, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1799252734", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“——————哎？……雷……雷夫？　那个……你这是……什么意思？”奥尔加玛丽有些不可置信的看着雷夫。"}
{"time": 1766170354, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1860829459", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“不，也不能说你还活着吧。你已经死了。你的肉体早就死了。 \n&#91;#特里斯墨吉斯忒斯:灵子演算装置&#93;真是好心，把化为残留意念的你转移到了这片土地上。 \n你想啊。你生前根本没有灵子转移的资质吧？拥有肉体的状态下你是无法转移的。 \n懂了吗。正因为你死了，你才获得了一直以来渴望着的资质。 \n所以你已经无法回迦勒底了。因为一旦你回到迦勒底，你的意识就会消亡。”"}
{"time": 1766170393, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1758522880", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "站在山坡上的雷夫面色阴沉，根本就不是印象中的雷夫教授。"}
{"time": 1766170413, "type": "recv", "message_id": "204140404", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"...嘶。\"未能阻止他说出口，\"啧，我不管你是谁还是别的什么，今天就留在这里吧。\"指挥狂信子出手"}
{"time": 1766170459, "type": "recv", "message_id": "915116302", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"立香，玛修，别愣着，佩佩，麻烦带着所长后退。\"自己朝着雷夫的方向突进"}
{"time": 1766170486, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1369995206", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“哎……哎？　我会……消亡……？等一下……我无法回……迦勒底了？”\n奥尔加玛丽所长已经被雷夫的话震惊到无法思考了。"}
{"time": 1766170569, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1082362470", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“得罪了，所长！”藤丸立香听到莉维娅的指挥一把公主抱起所长，开始在玛修的掩护下撤退。"}
{"time": 1766170651, "type": "recv", "message_id": "919906352", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"Assassin，动手。\""}
{"time": 1766170662, "type": "recv", "message_id": "361681729", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“还不明白吗，这种情况下你一个小小迦勒底员工又有什么用？不过是侥幸成为了御主罢了！”"}
{"time": 1766170722, "type": "recv", "message_id": "201873748", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "雷夫对着金色的晶体—圣杯，伸手，那晶体飞速移动到雷夫手中。"}
{"time": 1766170740, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1917805456", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "随后Assassin狂信子从背后出现攻击雷夫。"}
{"time": 1766170751, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1717091361", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "。rd100+30狂信子的偷袭"}
{"time": 1766170751, "type": "reply", "message_id": "1717091361", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": 2875548981, "name": "小雅"}, "message": "[斯薇塔]使用[狂信子的偷袭]演奏出:[1D100+30={73}+30=103]"}
{"time": 1766170770, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1968249212", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "。rd100+100雷夫的虚数防御"}
{"time": 1766170770, "type": "reply", "message_id": "1968249212", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": 2875548981, "name": "小雅"}, "message": "[斯薇塔]使用[雷夫的虚数防御]演奏出:[1D100+100={50}+100=150]"}
{"time": 1766170780, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2123360525", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(这么有数值)"}
{"time": 1766170822, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1888524462", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"罗马尼。\"轻声开口，单方面联系迦勒底的医生本人，\"能断掉通讯吗？接下来的事情，不想被看见。\""}
{"time": 1766170825, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1607569108", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "狂信子的攻击被牢牢恰在空中无法前进，就像是被固定了空间一样。"}
{"time": 1766170899, "type": "recv", "message_id": "769566567", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“——好！那就先暂时断掉通讯，现场就交给你们了！”\n一声电子音之后，罗曼医生的灵子头像消散了。"}
{"time": 1766170975, "type": "recv", "message_id": "911304818", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "魔力冲破枷锁，直达上层位格，\"雷夫教授，我上了。\""}
{"time": 1766170987, "type": "recv", "message_id": "197164707", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(好像还要r一下到什么阶段了？)"}
