{"time": 1767025941, "type": "recv", "message_id": "59842947", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "正在和无数触手缠斗的莉维娅明显感觉到了一股庞大的魔力降临到了眼前的魔神柱身上"}
{"time": 1767026082, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1154122462", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“莉维娅，你那个形态是怎么回事？你在迦勒底信息登记里可没写啊！”\n奥尔加玛丽所长一边在玛修掩护下艰难躲避激光，一边大声质问。"}
{"time": 1767026203, "type": "recv", "message_id": "728143808", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“好厉害！这就是迦勒底员工的实力吗？”\n这是冒星星眼的藤丸立香。"}
{"time": 1767026229, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1590670987", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“莉维娅前辈，刚才多谢有你了！”\n这是玛修。"}
{"time": 1767026265, "type": "recv", "message_id": "170639007", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "佩佩对莉维娅变身的情况只是小小惊讶了一下，但是很快就集中精神在躲避和防御上。"}
{"time": 1767026328, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1846061669", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"没关系...\""}
